    "sanity": 8,
    "subname": "The Folklorist",
    "subnameZh": "民俗学家",
    "text": "[reaction] At the start of your turn: Either add 1 [bless] token or 1 [curse] token to the chaos bag, whichever there are fewer of (in case of a tie, you choose), or remove 2 [bless] tokens and 2 [curse] tokens from the chaos bag to take an additional action this turn.\n[elder_sign] effect: +2. Add 1 [bless] and 1 [curse] token to the chaos bag.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]当你回合开始时：在混乱袋中加入1个[bless]标记或1个[curse]标记(取混乱袋中数量较少者，若数量相等则由你选择)；或者从混乱袋中移除2个[bless]标记和2个[curse]标记，以在本回合中进行一个额外行动。\n[elder_sign]效果：+2。在混乱袋中加入1个[bless]标记和1个[curse]标记。",
