    "subnameZh": "农夫",
    "text": "You may be assigned damage/horror dealt to [[Ally]] assets or other investigators at your location.\n[reaction] When you would be defeated by damage and/or horror: Instead, heal all of your damage and horror and swap this card with its bonded [[Resolute]] version, either side faceup.\n[elder_sign] effect: +1.",
