    "text": "Clues cannot be discovered from locations with no investigators.\n[action] If your location is unsealed and [[Dormant]], investigators at that location spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Place 1 resource on it, as a seal.\nObjective - At the end of the round, if a total of 7 locations are sealed and/or in the victory display, advance.",
    "textZh": "不能发现没有调查员的地点的线索。\n[action]如果你的地点未封印且为[[沉寂]]，该地点的调查员共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：在上面放置1资源，作为一个封印。\n目标 - 当一轮结束时：如果总计有7个地点被封印和/或在胜利区，推进。",
