    "encounterName": "The Silent Heath",
    "encounterPosition": 6,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "The Warrens are likely the final resting place of the Pearl family. Studying their remains may shed light on what really happened here.",
    "flavorZh": "“兔子洞”看来就是珀尔家族最后的安息之地了。研究他们的遗存或许能启发你这里到底发生了什么。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
