    "text": "[action] Spend 1 [per_investigator] clues and choose an enemy at a connecting [[Dark]] location: Move that enemy to your location.\nObjective - When an investigator enters Fungal Cave, immediately advance.",
    "textZh": "[action]花费1[per_investigator]个线索并选择一个连接的[[黑暗]]地点的一个敌人：将该敌人移动到你的地点。\n目标 - 在有调查员进入真菌洞穴时，立即推进。",
