    "text": "[fast] Investigators at a single location adjacent to Chelydran Hybrid's location spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: For the remainder of the round, change Chelydran Hybrid's patrol location to that location.\nForced – At the end of the enemy phase: Chelydran Hybrid takes 1 damage for each ready [[Abomination]] enemy at its location.\nObjective – At the end of the round, if the Chelydran Hybrid is at the Starting Location, immediately advance.",
    "textZh": "[free]在鳄龟混种所在地点的某个相邻地点的调查员共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：在本轮剩余时间内，将鳄龟混种的巡逻地点改成该地点。\n强制 - 当敌军阶段结束时：鳄龟混种所在地点每有一个重整状态的[[异形]]敌人，鳄龟混种受到1点伤害。\n目标 - 当一轮结束时：如果鳄龟混种在起始地点，立即推进。",
