    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull]: -X. X is the number of doom in play.\n[cultist]: -3. If you succeed, place 1 barrier at your location.\n[tablet]: -4. The nearest enemy readies, moves, and attacks as if it were the enemy phase.\n[elder_thing]: -5. Remove a barrier, decoy, or trap at your location.",
    "backTextZh": "困难/专家\n[skull]：-X。X为场上毁灭标记的数量。\n[cultist]：-3。如果你检定成功，在你的地点放置1个屏障。\n[tablet]：-4。最近的敌人重整、移动并攻击，如同是敌军阶段。\n[elder_thing]：-5。在你的地点移除1个屏障、诱饵或陷阱。",
