    "backName": "By the Skin of Your Skin",
    "backNameZh": "九死一生",
    "backText": "If 4 or fewer damage is on The Captives:\nDespite the seemingly endless onslaught, relatively few of the captives were harmed. As you survey the wrecked interior of the farmhouse, some captives weep into their hands, and others look at you accusingly. How can you convince them that their lives were worth saving?\n(→R1) (page 50).\n\nOtherwise:\nThe farm is a charnel house of gore and viscera. When confronted with the onslaught, many of the captives ran, screaming, into the jaws of the monstrosities. The morning light illuminates a scene that will haunt your dreams.\n(→R2) (page 50).",
    "backTextZh": "如果病俘上的伤害少于等于4点：\n尽管怪物的猛攻看似无穷无尽，实际受到伤害的病俘并不算多。你仔细检查农庄内部的惨状，有些病俘手捂着脸哭泣，其他则怨恨地望着你。你要如何说服他们相信自己的生命值得拯救？\n(→结局1)(第50页)。否则：\n农场已经成了埋尸地，遍布血污和脏器。面对猛攻的时候，许多病俘逃跑了、尖叫着，落入怪物的虎口。晨光映出的景象在你梦中逡巡不去。\n(→结局2)(第50页)。",
    "backimagesrc": "/bundles/cards/10629b.jpg",
    "code": "10629",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
