    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull]: -X. X is the number of [[Colour]] enemies in play.\n[cultist]: -6. Discard 1 card at random from your hand.\n[tablet]: -8. You may place 1 doom on your investigator card to treat this token's modifier as -3, instead.\n[elder_thing]: -5. If this is a fight or evasion attempt against Cosmic Emissary, you automatically fail instead.",
