    "backText": "If you flipped this act while or after playing the Dawn of the Second Day prelude, read the following:\nAs you walk through the village, a wave of dizziness washes over you and you stumble forward, putting your hand out to steady yourself. You cut your palm on the corner of a stack of mirrors and cry out in pain as thick, heavy raindrops begin to fall.\n([codex] 17) (page 42).",
    "backTextZh": "如果你在进行“第二个黎明”前奏时或之后翻面本场景，阅读以下内容：\n你正在村子里走着，突然一阵头晕目眩，脚下打滑，不得不伸出手来撑着身子。你在一堆镜子的边角上割破了手掌，痛叫出声。就在这时，天上下起了瓢泼大雨。\n([codex]17)(第42页)。",
