    "text": "Surge.\nForced - If Gloria Goldberg uses her [reaction] ability and this treachery is among the looked-at cards, it must be chosen and placed facedown beneath her (if you cannot, discard a non-weakness card beneath her first). Then, if there are 3 copies of this treachery beneath her, she is defeated and suffers 1 mental trauma.",
    "textZh": "涌动。\n强制 - 如果歌莉娅·戈德堡使用了她的[reaction]能力且本诡计在查看的卡牌中，则必须选择将本诡计正面朝下放在她底下(如果你不能这么做，先弃掉她底下的一张非弱点卡牌)。然后，如果她底下有3张本诡计，她被击败并承受1点精神创伤。",
