    "text": "Sadie Sheldon gains: \"[action] Spend up to 4 resources: Parley. Test [willpower] or [combat] (5). This test gets -1 difficulty for each resource spent as part of this action's cost. For each point you succeed by, place 1 of your clues on Sadie Sheldon.\"\nObjective - When damage is placed on Sadie Sheldon, advance.\nObjective - If there are 3 clues on Sadie Sheldon, advance.",
    "textZh": "萨迪·谢尔顿获得：“[action]花费至多4个资源：谈判。检定[willpower]或[combat](5)。作为本行动费用花费的每个资源使本次检定难度-1。你每成功超过难度1点，在萨迪·谢尔顿上放置你的1个线索。”\n目标 - 萨迪·谢尔顿被放置伤害时，推进。\n目标 - 如果萨迪·谢尔顿上有3个线索，推进。",
