    "text": "Aloof.\nSpawn - Nearest [[Arkham]] location with clues.\nForced - After an investigator at Gang Informant's location discovers 1 or more clues while this enemy is ready: That investigator must either spend 3 resources or place 1 doom on the current agenda.",
    "textZh": "冷漠。\n生成 - 最近的有线索[[阿卡姆]]地点。\n强制 - 本敌人处于重整状态时，本敌人所在地点的一位调查员发现1个或更多线索后：该调查员必须花费3个资源，或在当前密谋上放置1个毁灭标记。",
