    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[fast] Spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Decrease your location's flood level.\nObjective – Make your way to the sea floor! If each surviving investigator is at Obsidian Foundations, you may advance.",
    "textZh": "[fast]调查员共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：降低你所在地点的淹没等级。\n目标 - 前往海底！如果每位存活调查员均位于黑曜石地基，调查员可以推进。",
