    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Each location is connected to each location adjacent to it.\n[fast] Spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Decrease your location's flood level.\nObjective – At the end of the round, if each surviving investigator is at Barrier Core (Active), you may advance. (Hint: Reactivate the Barrier Core by revealing and draining locations!)",
    "textZh": "每处地点与其相邻的每处地点相连。\n[fast]调查员共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：降低你所在地点的淹没等级。\n目标 - 一轮结束时，如果每位存活调查员均位于屏障核心(已激活)，调查员可以推进。(提示：揭示并排空地点，以重新激活屏障核心！)",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "act",
    "typeName": "Act",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/11539"
