    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull]: -X. X is the amount of doom on enemies and assets in play (to a max of 8).\n[cultist]: -3. If there is a [[Cultist]] enemy at your location, reveal another token.\n[tablet]: -5. If you fail, place 1 doom on an enemy at your location (with no doom on it, if able).\n[elder_thing]: -6. If you fail, take 1 damage or 1 horror.",
    "backTextZh": "困难/专家\n[skull]：-X。X为场上敌人和支援上毁灭标记的总数(最多为8)。\n[cultist]：-3。如果你所在地点有[[异教徒]]敌人，揭示另一个标记。\n[tablet]：-5。如果你失败，在你所在地点一名敌人上放置1个毁灭标记(尽可能为其上没有毁灭标记的敌人)。\n[elder_thing]：-6。如果你失败，受到1点伤害或1点恐惧。",
