    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[reaction] After the investigators have translated any 3 of the following glyphs ([tdc_rune_l], [tdc_rune_m], [tdc_rune_n], [tdc_rune_p], [tdc_rune_o]): Reveal the Sealed Chamber location. (Hint: Each of these glyphs are found in this scenario.).\nObjective - When the round ends, if an investigator controls the Tidal Tablet story asset, advance.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]调查员翻译下列任意3个符文后([tdc_rune_l]、[tdc_rune_m]、[tdc_rune_n]、[tdc_rune_p]、[tdc_rune_o])：揭示封印腔室地点。(提示：每个符文均可在本剧本中找到。)。\n目标 - 一轮结束时，如果一位调查员控制潮汐碑匾剧情支援，推进。",
