    "subnameZh": "机器之心",
    "text": "Core of the Vault cannot be flooded.\nForced - If The Inescapable is defeated at this location: Search all in- and out-of-play areas for each copy of Still Behind You and remove them from the game. In your Campaign Log, record the creature was defeated.\n[action] [action] Spend 3 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: You study the machine. Proceed to Scenario Interlude: The Vault Core (page 26).",
    "textZh": "秘库核心不能被淹没。\n强制 - 穷途异魔在本地点被击败时：查找所有场上和场外区域，找出每张仍在你身后，将其从游戏中移除。在剧本日志中记录该生物被击败了。\n[action][action]调查员共同花费3[per_investigator]个线索：你研究机器。进入冒险幕间故事：秘库核心(第26页)。",
