    "backFlavor": "\"One could not be sure that the sea and the ground were horizontal, hence the relative position of everything else seemed phantasmally variable.\"\n-H.P. Lovecraft, \"The Call of Cthulhu\"",
    "backFlavorZh": "“人们无法确定海洋与地面是否水平，因而其他一切事物的相对位置都显得如幻般变化莫测。”\n-H.P. 洛夫克拉夫特，《克苏鲁的呼唤》",
