    "doubleSided": true,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "court_of_the_ancients",
    "encounterName": "Court of the Ancients",
    "encounterPosition": 2,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "The massive tower rises above you, promising enticing knowledge and forbidden truths. However, the imminent peril of navigating the ancient, crumbling structure comes into sharp focus as a chunk of obsidian crashes down nearby. For all its grandeur, you are not safe here.",
    "flavorZh": "巨塔耸立在你头顶，承诺着诱人的知识与禁忌真相。然而，当一块黑曜石在附近坠落时，你骤然意识到在这座古老崩坏结构中穿行的迫切危险。尽管它宏伟壮丽，你在这里并不安全。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
