    "text": "During the enemy phase, each location is considered to be connected to the location above and below it.\nForced - After the Great Lift moves: Each investigator at the Great Lift must test [agility] (2). Each investigator who fails takes 1 damage.",
    "textZh": "敌军阶段中，每处地点视为与其上方和下方地点相连。\n强制 - 大升降机移动后：位于大升降机的每位调查员必须检定[agility](2)。每位失败的调查员受到1点伤害。",
