    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "You cannot enter this location unless there are 3 or more [[Glyph]] cards in the victory display.\nAs an additional cost to enter Ancient Altar, investigators at East Antechamber must spend 4 [per_investigator] clues, as a group.",
    "backTextZh": "除非胜利区有3张或更多[[符文]]卡牌，否则你不能进入本地点。\n作为进入古代祭坛的额外费用，位于东侧前厅的调查员必须共同花费4[per_investigator]个线索。",
