    "text": "Luminous Archives gets +1 shroud for each [[Glyph]] card at or attached to it.\n[fast] Spend X actions (to a minimum of 1): Search the encounter discard pile for up to X [[Glyph]] cards and draw them, one at a time.\n[action]: Move. Move to a revealed [[Passageway]] location.",
    "textZh": "本地点上或附属到本地点的每有1张[[符文]]卡牌，本地点隐藏值+1。\n[fast]花费X次行动(最少为1次)：查找遭遇弃牌堆，找出至多X张[[符文]]卡牌，依次将其抽取。\n[action]：移动。移动到一处已揭示[[通道]]地点。",
    "traits": [
      "R'lyeh",
      "Passageway"
    ],
    "traitsZh": [
      "拉莱耶",
      "通道"
    ],
