    "provenanceId": "11641",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Each non-weakness enemy may enter or leave open sky as if it were a location.\nEach location is connected to each location (and open sky) adjacent to it.\nForced - When an investigator's location would leave play: Move that investigator to any [[Central]] location. They take 2 direct damage.",
    "textZh": "每名非弱点敌人可以如同开阔天空是一处地点般进入或离开开阔天空。\n每处地点与其每处相邻地点(及开阔天空)相连。\n强制 - 一位调查员所在地点将要离场时：将该调查员移动到任意[[中央]]地点。该调查员受到2点直接伤害。",
