    "text": "Forced - When doom would be placed on a card other than a story asset: Place 1 resource on the scenario reference card, as Disturbance, instead. If the current Disturbance is 6 or more (8 or more instead of there are exactly 1 or 2 investigators in the game), immediately advance (do not remove doom from cards in play).\nObjective - Prepare your artifacts for the final showdown!",
    "textZh": "强制 - 一张非剧情支援卡牌将要被放置毁灭标记时：改为在剧本辅助卡上放置1个资源，作为扰动。如果当前扰动值为6或更多(如果游戏中恰好有1或2名调查员，改为8或更多)，立刻推进(不移除场上卡牌上的毁灭标记)。\n目标 - 为最终对决准备你的神器！",
