    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Forced - When doom is placed on this agenda: Each investigator takes 1 direct horror.\n[fast] During your turn, remove 1 doom from an [[Artifact]] asset you control: Cthulhu loses relentless and gets -1 fight and -1 evade until the end of the round. (Limit once per asset per round.)\nObjective - If you manage to defeat Cthulhu: (→R1) (page 39)",
    "textZh": "强制 - 本密谋被放置毁灭标记时：每位调查员受到1点直接恐惧。\n[fast]在你的回合期间，从你控制的一张[[神器]]支援上移除1个毁灭标记：克苏鲁本轮失去无情，且战斗值和躲避值各-1。(每轮每张支援限1次。)\n目标 - 如果你设法击败克苏鲁：(→结局1) (第39页)",
