    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull]: -X. X is the number of locations with no scenario cards beneath them.\n[cultist]: -5. If this test fails, place 1 doom on the nearest enemy with no doom on it.\n[tablet]: -5. If this test fails, place 1 of your clues on your location.\n[elder_thing]: -4. If your location is flooded, reveal another token.",
