    "text": "[action] Investigators at your location spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Draw the top card beneath your location. If it is an asset, take control of it. \nObjective - When the round ends, if an investigator at Tillinghast Esoterica controls at least 1 [[Artifact]] asset, the investigators may advance. (Hint: Recover as many artifacts as possible!)",
    "textZh": "[action]位于你所在地点的调查员共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：抽取你所在地点下方最上方的卡牌。如果它是一张支援，将其控制。\n目标 - 一轮结束时，如果蒂林哈斯特密所的一位调查员控制至少1张[[神器]]支援，调查员可以推进。(提示：尽可能找回更多神器！)",
