    "text": "Each [[Star Spawn]] enemy loses patrol and its printed Prey instructions and gains hunter and \"Prey - You.\"\n[tdc_rune_u] · [tdc_rune_x] · [tdc_rune_o] · [tdc_rune_o] · [tdc_rune_d] · [tdc_rune_f] · [tdc_rune_z]\n[fast] Exhaust Horror in Clay: Either treat this asset's printed text box as if it were blank until the end of the round (except for Traits), or move a [[Star Spawn]] enemy once in any direction.",
    "textZh": "每名[[星之眷族]]敌人失去巡逻和其印刷的猎物指示，并获得猎手和“猎物 - 你”。\n[tdc_rune_u] · [tdc_rune_x] · [tdc_rune_o] · [tdc_rune_o] · [tdc_rune_d] · [tdc_rune_f] · [tdc_rune_z]\n[fast]横置黏土恐怖：将本支援的印刷文本框视为空白，直到本轮结束(除特性外)，或将一名[[星之眷族]]敌人向任意方向移动一次。",
