    "packName": "The Drowned City Campaign Expansion",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 207,
    "provenanceId": "11707",
    "quantity": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "If Cthulhu (Hoary Wings) is in play:\nEach investigator at Cthulhu's location discards 1 card at random from hand. Resolve Cthulhu's patrol keyword an additional time.\nIf Cthulhu (Fierce Visage) is in play:\nThe investigator with the highest [willpower] tests [willpower] (X), where X is Cthulhu's Rage. If they fail, they must either take 1 horror, or choose and discard a non-story asset they control.\nIf Cthulhu (Wicked Claw) is in play:\nIf Cthulhu did not move via his patrol keyword this round, Cthulhu (Wicked Claw) attacks each investigator at its location.",
    "textZh": "如果克苏鲁(灰白双翼)在场：\n克苏鲁所在地点的每位调查员随机弃掉其手牌中的1张卡牌。额外结算一次克苏鲁的巡逻关键词。\n如果克苏鲁(凶恶面容)在场：\n[willpower]最高的调查员检定[willpower](X)，其中X为克苏鲁的狂怒值。如果该调查员失败，其必须受到1点恐惧，或选择并弃掉其控制的一张非剧情支援。\n如果克苏鲁(邪恶利爪)在场：\n如果克苏鲁本轮未以其巡逻关键词移动，克苏鲁(邪恶利爪)攻击其所在地点每位调查员。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/11707"
