    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "If Cthulhu (Hoary Wings) is in play:\nThe investigator with the highest [agility] tests [agility] (X), where X is Cthulhu's Rage. If they fail, they take 1 damage or 1 horror.\nIf Cthulhu (Fierce Visage) is in play:\nEach investigator at Cthulhu's location loses 2 resources.\nIf Cthulhu (Wicked Claw) is in play:\nThe investigators must decide, as a group:\n- Each investigator loses 1 action during their next turn.\n- Cthulhu (Wicked Claw) attacks each investigator at its location.\n- Each investigator takes 1 direct horror.",
    "textZh": "如果克苏鲁(灰白双翼)在场：\n[agility]最高的调查员检定[agility](X)，其中X为克苏鲁的狂怒值。如果该调查员失败，受到1点伤害或1点恐惧。\n如果克苏鲁(凶恶面容)在场：\n克苏鲁所在地点的每位调查员失去2个资源。\n如果克苏鲁(邪恶利爪)在场：\n调查员必须共同决定：\n- 每位调查员在其下个回合失去1次行动。\n- 克苏鲁(邪恶利爪)攻击其所在地点每位调查员。\n- 每位调查员受到1点直接恐惧。",
    "traits": [],
