    "text": "Place 1 damage token on the [[Rooftop]] location nearest to Cthulhu, as a ruin token. If there are 2 or more ruin tokens on that location,each investigator is killed and each enemy at that location is discarded. Then, remove that location and this card from the game.\nOtherwise, shuffle this card into the Cthulhu deck along with the Cthulhu discard pile.",
