    "text": "Decrease the flood level of Cthulhu's location and choose another location (with an investigator, if able) that can have its flood level increased. Increase the flood level of the chosen location.\nEach investigator at a fully flooded location tests [agility] (X), where X is Cthulhu's Rage. If they fail, they must either take 1 damage or discard a non-story asset they control.",
    "textZh": "降低克苏鲁所在地点的淹没等级，并选择另一处可提高淹没等级地点(尽可能有调查员)。提高所选地点的淹没等级。\n位于完全淹没地点的每位调查员检定[agility](X)，其中X为克苏鲁的狂怒值。如果该调查员失败，其必须受到1点伤害，或弃掉其控制的一张非剧情支援。",
