    "agility": 2,
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavor": "Daniela worked hard to make a name for herself as a mechanic. She'd only just paid off her new garage when Arkham was devastated by a cataclysmic flood, sending her business quite literally underwater. Rather than mope, she rolled up her sleeves, like always, and got back to work. Now she works an extra shift tuning up engines at the new meat-packing factories. But she's started to hear talk about strange things going on in the waterfront district: locals gone missing; corpses drained of blood; and rumors of a shadowy figure that stalks the alleys at night. Daniela knows better than to dismiss these strange happenings as mere circumstance. Whatever it is, she intends to be ready.",
    "backFlavorZh": "丹妮拉辛勤工作，就为了在机修的行当里闯出点名堂。她刚还清新修理厂的贷款，毁灭阿卡姆的滔天洪水就来了，让她的整个生意真的泡了汤。她没有失落，而是和往常一样卷起袖子继续干。现在她还加班负责调试肉类加工厂的机器。但她开始听说滨水区发生了奇怪的事情：本地人失踪、鲜血淋漓的尸体，还有传言说黑影在晚上游走于街巷。丹妮拉清楚的很，不能把这些怪事当作偶然。不管是什么，她都要做好准备。",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "Deck Size: 30.\nDeckbuilding Options: Guardian cards ([guardian]) level 0-5, Survivor cards ([survivor]) level 0-2, Neutral cards level 0-5.\nDeckbuilding Requirements (do not count toward deck size): Daniela's Wrench, In Harm's Way, 1 random basic weakness.",
    "backTextZh": "牌库卡牌张数：30。\n牌库构建选项：守卫者卡牌([guardian])等级0-5，生存者卡牌([survivor])等级0-2，中立卡牌等级0-5。\n牌库构建需求(不计入牌库卡牌张数)：[丹妮拉的扳手]、[身临危境]、1张随机基础弱点。",
