    "text": "Revelation - Put The Necronomicon into play in your threat area. It cannot leave play except by the [action] ability below.\nYou cannot play assets or trigger abilities on other assets you control.\n[action]: Test [willpower] (5). If you succeed, discard The Necronomicon. If you fail, shuffle it into your deck and take 1 horror.",
