    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull] -X. X is twice the number of Fire! treacheries in play.\n[cultist] -3. If this is an attack or evasion targeting a [[Cultist]] enemy, reveal another token.\n[tablet] -4. If you are at a [[Ritual Site]] location, you automatically fail instead.\n[elder_thing] -5. If you fail, draw the topmost copy of Fire! in the encounter discard pile.",
    "backTextZh": "困难/专家\n[skull]-X。X为场上[着火了！]诡计数量的两倍。\n[cultist]-3。如果本次检定是以[[异教徒]]敌人为对象的攻击或躲避，再揭示一个标记。\n[tablet]-4。如果你在[[仪式地]]地点，改为你自动失败。\n[elder_thing]-5。如果你检定失败，抽取遭遇弃牌堆最顶部的一张[着火了！]。",
