    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/50025.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Return to The Midnight Masks",
    "nameZh": "重返午夜假面",
    "originalCode": "50025",
    "pack": "rtnotz",
    "packName": "Return to the Night of the Zealot",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 25,
    "provenanceId": "50025",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Perform the setup as indicated in the Night of the Zealot Campaign Guide, with the following exceptions:\n- When gathering encounter sets, also gather the new encounter sets for Return to the Midnight Masks shown here.\n- Construct the act deck using one of the two copies of Agenda 1a- \"Predator or Prey\" at random, without looking at their other sides. Remove the other version of Agenda 1a from the game.\n(Continued on reverse side.)",
    "textZh": "遵循狂热之夜的剧本手册进行冒险设置，但以下步骤例外：\n- 在找出遭遇组的卡牌时，还需要为重返午夜假面找出几个新遭遇组，如下所示：\n- 随机从2张密谋1a——“猎人还是猎物？”中选择1张来构建密谋牌库，不要查看另一面。将其他版本的密谋1a从游戏中移除。\n(继续阅读背面。)",
