    "text": "Forced - After Clover Club Lounge is revealed: Put the set-aside Clover Club Stage into play.\nWhile it is Act 1, Clover Club Lounge gains: \"[action]: Look at the top card of your deck. If it is an [[Ally]] asset, you may put it into play. Otherwise, draw it. (Limit once per round.)\"",
