    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "- Before creating the \"Exhibit Deck,\" add the 2 new Exhibit Hall locations to the original 6 Exhibit Hall locations. Set Exhibit Hall (Restricted Hall) aside and randomly remove 2 Exhibit Hall locations from the game. Then, continue creating the Exhibit Deck as normal.\nFor the duration of this scenario, the following additional rule applies:\n\"While an investigator is resolving the text on agenda 1b and agenda 2b, the Forced ability on the next agenda in the agenda deck is considered to be active.\"\nAttach this card to the scenario reference card as a reminder.",
    "backTextZh": "- 创建“展厅牌库”前，将2张新版展厅地点加入原版6张展厅地点。将展厅(禁止入内)放在一边，随机将2张展厅地点从游戏中移除。然后，按照常规设置创建展厅牌库。\n本场冒险期间，加入以下规则：\n“调查员结算密谋1b或密谋2b的文本时，密谋牌库下一张密谋卡上的强制能力视为生效。”\n将本卡牌附属到冒险参考卡牌，作为提醒。",
