    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Perform the setup as indicated in The Dunwich Legacy Campaign Guide, with the following exceptions:\n- When gathering encounter sets, also gather the new encounter sets for Return to Blood on the Altar shown here.\n- Set each copy of Hired Gun aside, out of play.\n- Remove the original Village Commons location from the game and replace it with the new Village Commons (Silent Decay).\n(Continued on reverse side.)",
    "textZh": "遵循敦威治遗产的剧本手册进行冒险设置，但以下步骤例外：\n- 在找出遭遇组的卡牌时，还需要为重返血色祭坛找出几个新遭遇组，如下所示：\n- 将所有受雇枪手放在一边，位于场外。\n- 将原版的公共空地地点从游戏中移除，用新版的公共空地(腐朽沉默)地点替换。\n(继续阅读背面。)",
