    "backFlavor": "\"I my self did not more than a Fortnight ago catch a very plain Discourse of evill Powers in the Hill behind my House; wherein there were a Rattling and Rolling, Groaning, Screeching, and Hissing, such as no Things of this Earth cou’d raise up…\"\n-H. P. Lovecraft, \"The Dunwich Horror\"",
    "backFlavorZh": "“不到两周前，咱就在自家房子后面的山丘中清楚地听到邪恶力量的对话，回响着咯咯声、滚动声、呻吟声、尖啸声以及嘶嘶声，肯定不是这个世界能长出来的东西……”H.P. 洛夫克拉夫特《敦威治恐怖事件》",
