    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "- Remove 4 copies of Brood of Yog-Sothoth from the original scenario and replace them with the 4 new versions of Brood of Yog-Sothoth from the Return to Undimensioned and Unseen encounter set.\nFor the duration of this scenario, the following additional rule applies:\n\"If a Brood of Yog-Sothoth would be put into play, it is chosen at random from among the set-aside versions of Brood of Yog-Sothoth.\"\nAttach this card to the scenario reference card as a reminder.",
    "backTextZh": "将原版的4张犹格·索托斯之子从游戏中移除，用重返无人知晓遭遇组中4张新的犹格·索托斯之子替换。\n本场冒险期间，加入以下规则：\n“如果有犹格·索托斯之子将被放置入场，随机从放在一边的犹格·索托斯之子中选择并放置入场。”\n将本卡牌附属到冒险参考卡牌，作为提醒。",
