    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "- Check Campaign Log. If the Ritual was completed: Replace Act 2a - \"Into the Beyond\" with the new Act 2a - \"Into the Beyond (v. II)\" included in this encounter set.\n- Replace Agenda 3a - \"Breaking Through\" with the new Agenda 3a - \"Breaking Through (v. II)\" included in this encounter set.\n- Put the single-sided Realms Beyond location into play and spawn Yog-Sothoth there.",
    "backTextZh": "- 检查剧本日志。如果仪式已完成：用本遭遇组新的场景2a——“超越领域(版本二)”替换场景2a——“超越领域”。\n- 用本遭遇组新的密谋3a——“突破(版本二)”替换密谋3a——“突破”。\n- 将单面的彼端领域地点放置入场，并将犹格·索托斯生成在该地点。",
