    "text": "Perform the setup as indicated in The Dunwich Legacy Campaign Guide, with the following exceptions:\n- When gathering encounter sets, also gather the new encounter sets for Return to Lost in Time and Space shown here.\n- Set Seth Bishop (Thrall of Yog-Sothoth) aside, out of play.\n(Continued on reverse side.)",
    "textZh": "遵循敦威治遗产的剧本手册进行冒险设置，但以下步骤例外：\n- 在找出遭遇组的卡牌时，还需要为重返迷失时空找出几个新遭遇组，如下所示：\n- 将赛斯·毕晓普(犹格·索托斯的奴仆)放在一边，位于场外。\n(继续阅读背面。)",
