    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Perform the setup as indicated in The Path to Carcosa Campaign Guide, with the following exceptions:\n- When gathering encounter sets, also gather the new encounter sets for Return to The Last King shown here.\n(Continued on reverse side.)",
    "textZh": "遵循卡尔克萨之路的剧本手册进行冒险设置，但以下步骤例外：\n- 在找出遭遇组的卡牌时，还需要为重返最后的王者找出几个新遭遇组，如下所示：\n(继续阅读背面。)",
