    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "- Set the Host of Insanity enemy and the Radical Treatment treachery aside, out of play.\n- When determining which version of act 2 to use, do not follow the original setup instructions. Instead, remove the original versions of act 2 from the game, and check the Campaign Log. If you have more (or equal) Conviction than Doubt, use the new Act 2 - \"The Really Bad Ones\" (v. III). If you have more Doubt than Conviction, use the new Act 2 - \"The Really Bad Ones\" (v. IV).",
    "backTextZh": "- 将疯狂之主敌人和根除疗法诡计卡放在一边，位于场外。\n- 在决定使用哪个版本的场景2时，不要遵循原版的执行设置。改为将原版的场景2从游戏中移除，并检查剧本日志。如果你的确信高于(或等于)疑惑，使用新的场景2——真正可怕的人(版本三)。如果你的疑惑高于确信，使用新的场景2——真正可怕的人(版本四)。",
