    "text": "Ignore the text on the unrevealed side of [[Arkham Asylum]] locations.\nObjective - Find the Patient Confinement location with Daniel Chesterfield. (You will be instructed when to advance.)",
    "textZh": "忽略[[阿卡姆疯人院]]地点未揭示面上的文字。\n目标 - 找到关着丹尼尔·契斯特菲尔德的病人拘禁室地点。(要推进场景时，你会收到指示)。",
