    "permanent": false,
    "position": 40,
    "provenanceId": "52040",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Perform the setup as indicated in The Path to Carcosa Campaign Guide, with the following exceptions:\n- When gathering encounter sets, also gather the new encounter sets for Return to A Phantom of Truth shown here.\n- Randomly choose 1 of the 2 Montparnasse locations, 1 of the 2 Grand Guignol locations, 1 of the 2 Père Lachaise Cemetery locations...\n(Continued on reverse side.)",
    "textZh": "遵循卡尔克萨之路的剧本手册进行冒险设置，但以下步骤例外：\n- 在找出遭遇组的卡牌时，还需要为重返真相幻影找出几个新遭遇组，如下所示：\n- 随机从2张蒙巴纳斯地点中选择1张，2张大木偶剧场地点中选择1张，2张拉雪兹神父公墓地点中选择1张……\n(继续阅读背面。)",
