    "backFlavor": "This area is known for its cafés and bars, and is often frequented by starving artists. Perhaps some of these creative types will become famous someday. Most, you assume, will fade into obscurity.",
    "backFlavorZh": "这个街区以其咖啡馆和酒吧著称，也是穷困潦倒的艺术家经常光顾的地方。说不定哪一天，这里某个天才艺术家还能名扬四海。但你清楚，大部分只会默默无名。",
