  "52048": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "- Next, randomly choose 4 Catacombs locations and remove them from the game, without looking at them.\n- Build the remainder of the Catacombs deck as normal.\nFor the duration of this scenario, the following additional rules apply:\n\"For the purposes of Corpse Dweller's spawn ability, The Man in the Pallid Mask does not count as a [[Humanoid]] enemy.\nWhile it is act 2, The Man in the Pallid Mask cannot leave the Tomb of Shadows.\"\nAttach this card to the scenario reference card as a reminder.",
    "backTextZh": "- 接着，随机选择4张地下墓穴地点，并将其从游戏中移除，不要查看。\n- 按照常规设置创建地下墓穴剩余部分。\n本场冒险期间，加入以下规则：\n“结算尸体寄居者的生成能力时，苍白面具下的男子不视为[[类人]]敌人。\n当前场景为场景2时，苍白面具下的男子不能离开暗影坟墓。”\n将本卡牌附属到冒险参考卡牌，作为提醒。",
    "backimagesrc": "/bundles/cards/52048b.png",
    "code": "52048",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": true,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "return_to_the_pallid_mask",
    "encounterName": "Return to The Pallid Mask",
    "encounterPosition": 1,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavorZh": "",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/52048.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Return to The Pallid Mask",
    "nameZh": "重返苍白面具",
    "originalCode": "52048",
    "pack": "rtptc",
    "packName": "Return to the Path to Carcosa",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 48,
    "provenanceId": "52048",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Perform the setup as indicated in The Path to Carcosa Campaign Guide, with the following exceptions:\n- When gathering encounter sets, also gather the new encounter set for Return to The Pallid Mask shown here.\n- When building the Catacombs deck, first set aside the Tomb of Shadows and the Blocked Passage, as normal. \n- Next, add the 4 new Catacombs locations included in this encounter set with the remaining Catacombs locations, and determine your starting location, as normal.\n(Continued on reverse side.)",
    "textZh": "遵循卡尔克萨之路的剧本手册进行冒险设置，但以下步骤例外：\n- 在找出遭遇组的卡牌时，还需要为重返苍白面具找出几个新遭遇组，如下所示：\n- 在创建地下墓穴牌库时，首先按照常规设置将暗影坟墓和堵塞通道放在一边。\n- 接着，将本遭遇组中4张新的地下墓穴地点与剩余地下墓穴地点放在一起，按照常规设置决定你的起始地点。\n(继续阅读背面。)",
    "traits": [
      "Return"
    ],
    "traitsZh": [
      "重返"
    ],
    "type": "scenario",
    "typeName": "Scenario",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/52048"
  },
