    "subnameZh": "沉睡者归来",
    "text": "Alert. Hunter. Retaliate.\nWhile this enemy has 5 [per_investigator] or more damage on it, it gets +2 fight and -2 evade.\nForced - After a successful attack or evasion attempt against this enemy ends: Place 1 resource on it. Then, if there are 2 [per_investigator] resources on it, it vanishes with a sinister hiss. (Set it aside, out of play. It keeps all damage tokens.)",
    "textZh": "警戒。猎手。反击。\n瓦卢西亚的预示者上有5[per_investigator]点或更多伤害时，其得到+2攻击值和-2躲避值。\n强制 - 在对本敌人进行的一次成功的攻击或躲避尝试结束后：在该卡牌上放置1资源。然后，如果该卡牌上有2[per_investigator]资源，瓦卢西亚的预示者发出奸险的嘶嘶声并遁去身影。(将该卡牌放在一边，位于场外。该卡牌保留所有伤害标记。)",
