    "subnameZh": "时间重序",
    "text": "[action]: Resign. You've escaped... for now.\n[action]: Check your supplies. If you have torches: Look at the top 2 cards of the exploration deck. Discard 1 treachery or enemy looked at by this effect. Shuffle the exploration deck. This ability can be used at any location.",
