    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Return to Threads of Fate",
    "nameZh": "重返命运之线",
    "originalCode": "53028",
    "pack": "rttfa",
    "packName": "Return to the Forgotten Age",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 28,
    "provenanceId": "53028",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Perform the setup as indicated in The Forgotten Age Campaign Guide, with the following exceptions:\n- When gathering encounter sets, also gather the new encounter sets for Return to Threads of Fate shown here.\n- Set the Veda Whitsley story asset aside, out of play.\n(Continued on reverse side.)",
    "textZh": "遵循失落的时代的剧本手册进行冒险设置，但以下步骤例外：\n- 在找出遭遇组的卡牌时，还需要为重返命运之线找出几个新遭遇组，如下所示：\n- 将薇达·惠茨利剧情支援放在一边，位于场外。\n(继续阅读背面。)",
