    "provenanceId": "53044",
    "quantity": 1,
    "shroud": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "While you are at Coyoacán, damage/horror cannot be healed from cards you control.\n[action] If you have 5 or more total damage and/or horror on your investigator: Explore. Draw the top card of the exploration deck. If it is a location with a matching location symbol in the upper-left corner, place it on top of this location, taking its place.",
    "textZh": "你位于科约阿坎区时，你控制的卡牌上的伤害/恐惧不能被治愈。\n[action]如果你的调查员上总计有至少5点伤害和/或恐惧：探索。抽取探索牌库顶的一张卡牌。如果抽出的地点左上角带有对应地点符号，将其放在本地点上方并替代本地点。",
