    "position": 45,
    "provenanceId": "53045",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Perform the setup as indicated in The Forgotten Age Campaign Guide, with the following exceptions:\n- When gathering encounter sets, also gather the new encounter sets for Return to Heart of the Elders, Part 1 shown here.\n- Remove Act 1a - \"Search for the Pattern\" from the game and replace it with the new Act 1a - \"A Familiar Pattern.\"\n(Continued on reverse side.)",
    "textZh": "遵循失落的时代的剧本手册进行冒险设置，但以下步骤例外：\n- 在找出遭遇组的卡牌时，还需要为重返久远腹地，第一部分找出几个新遭遇组，如下所示：\n- 将场景1a——“研究图案”从游戏中移除，使用新的场景1a——“熟悉的图案”替代。\n(继续阅读背面。)",
