    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Perform the setup as indicated in The Forgotten Age Campaign Guide, with the following exceptions:\n- When gathering encounter sets, also gather the new encounter sets for Return to The City of Archives shown here.\n- Put Halls of Pnakotus (Southern Corridors) into play.\n(Continued on reverse side.)",
    "textZh": "遵循失落的时代的剧本手册进行冒险设置，但以下步骤例外：\n- 在找出遭遇组的卡牌时，还需要为重返天机之城找出新遭遇组，如下所示：\n- 将纳克特廊道(南翼通道)放置入场。\n(继续阅读背面。)",
