    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Return to The Depths of Yoth",
    "nameZh": "重返幽嘶深渊",
    "originalCode": "53059",
    "pack": "rttfa",
    "packName": "Return to the Forgotten Age",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 59,
    "provenanceId": "53059",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Perform the setup as indicated in The Forgotten Age Campaign Guide, with the following exceptions:\n- When gathering encounter sets, also gather the new encounter sets for Return to The Depths of Yoth shown here.\n- After setup, search the collection for the new Harbinger of Valusia (The Sleeper Returns) and set it aside, out of play. If the Harbinger of Valusia would enter play during this scenario, use this version instead of the original one.\n(Continued on reverse side.)",
    "textZh": "遵循失落的时代的剧本手册进行冒险设置，但以下步骤例外：\n- 在找出遭遇组的卡牌时，还需要为重返幽嘶深渊找出几个新遭遇组，如下所示：\n- 在冒险设置后，查找收藏，找出新版的瓦卢西亚的预示者(沉睡者归来)并将其放在一边，位于场外。在本场冒险期间，如果要将瓦卢西亚的预示者放置入场，使用该版本替代原版。\n(继续阅读背面。)",
