    "text": "Victorian Halls is connected to Wine Cellar.\n[action]: You disturb the tranquility of this quiet place in search of evidence. Discard cards from the top of the encounter deck until a [[Monster]] enemy is discarded. Set that enemy aside, out of play. Then gain 2 clues (from the token pool). (Group limit once per game.)",
    "textZh": "维多利亚式宴会厅和酒窖相互连接。\n[action]：你为找证据，搅了这地方的清净。从遭遇牌库顶弃掉卡牌，直到弃掉一张[[怪物]]敌人。将该敌人放在一边，位于场外。然后，获得2个线索(从供应堆拿取。)。(团队每场游戏仅限一次。)",
