    "text": "Perform the setup as indicated in The Circle Undone Campaign Guide, with the following exceptions:\n- When gathering encounter sets, also gather the new encounter sets for Return to The Wages of Sin shown here.\n- Set the Erynn MacAoidh story asset aside, out of play.\n(Continued on reverse side.)",
    "textZh": "遵循万象无终的剧本手册进行冒险设置，但以下步骤例外：\n- 在找出遭遇组的卡牌时，还需要为重返恶罪报应找出几个新遭遇组，如下所示：\n- 将伊琳·麦考伊剧情支援放在一边，位于场外。\n(继续阅读背面。)",
