    "provenanceId": "54036",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[reaction] When you would \"banish\" a ghost: You may instead place it beneath Erynn MacAoidh, Heretic side faceup.\n[action] If you are at Erynn MacAoidh's location, spend 1 [per_investigator] clues: Parley. Choose a Heretic beneath her and place it beneath this act.\nObjective - Help Erynn find answers by placing Heretics beneath this act. If there are 3 beneath this act, advance.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]当你将要“驱除”一个幽灵时：你可以改为将其异端者面朝上放在伊琳·麦考伊底下。\n[action]如果你位于伊琳·麦考伊所在地点，花费1[per_investigator]个线索：谈判。选择她底下一张异端者放在本场景底下。\n目标 - 通过将异端者放到本场景底下来帮助伊琳寻找答案。如果本场景底下有3张异端者，推进。",
