    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "- When choosing which version of Acts 3 and 4 to use during setup, add the following bullet point above all the others:\n- If the investigator sided with the Lodge and Erynn joined the investigators, use the new Act 3 - \"Beyond the Mist (v. V)\" and Act 4 - \"The Binding Rite.\"\nFor the duration of this scenario, the following additional rule applies:\n\"While resolving The Watcher's Grasp treachery, The Spectral Watcher does not exhaust after it attacks.\"\nAttach this card to the scenario reference card as a reminder.",
    "backTextZh": "- 在选择场景3和场景4的版本时，将以下条目加在其他条目之前：\n- 如果调查员支持密社且伊琳加入了调查员，使用新版场景3——“迷雾彼端(版本五)”和场景4——“咒缚仪式”。\n\n本场冒险期间，加入以下规则：\n“在结算看守人的攫噬诡计时，幽灵看守人在攻击后不会横置。”\n将本卡牌附属到冒险参考卡牌，作为提醒。",
