    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "What Must Be Done (v. II)",
    "nameZh": "必竟之事(版本二)",
    "originalCode": "54057",
    "pack": "rttcu",
    "packName": "Return to the Circle Undone",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 57,
    "provenanceId": "54057",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[action] Spend X clues: Draw the top X cards of the Cosmos. Choose one to put into play using its \"Cosmos -\" instructions, and move to it. Shuffle the rest back into the Cosmos.\nObjective - If the lead investigator is a The Black Throne and there are no clues on it, advance.",
    "textZh": "[action]花费X个线索：抽取“宇宙”顶上的X张卡牌。选择其中一张卡牌，按照其“宇宙 -”指示放置入场，并移动到其上。将其余卡牌洗回“宇宙”。\n目标 - 如果调查员队长位于黑色王座，且该地点上没有线索，推进场景。",
