    "subnameZh": "女飞行员",
    "text": "[fast] If 2 different non-weakness cards you control are committed to this skill test: Draw 1 card. (Limit once per test.)\n[elder_sign] effect: +1. After this test ends, for every 2 points you succeeded by, return a card you committed to this test to your hand.",
    "textZh": "[fast]如果本次技能检定中投入了2张你控制的不同非弱点卡牌：抽取1张卡牌。(每次检定限一次。)\n[elder_sign]效果：+1。本次检定结束后，你每成功超过难度2点，便将你投入本次检定的一张卡牌返回手牌。",
