    "text": "[reaction] After you fail a skill test: You may take an additional action during your turn this round. (Limit once per round.)\n[elder_sign] effect: +1. You may instead choose to automatically fail this skill test to heal 1 damage and 1 horror.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]你技能检定失败后：本轮你的回合期间可以进行一次额外行动。(每轮限一次。)\n[elder_sign]效果：+1。你可以改为选择让本次技能检定自动失败，治愈1点伤害和1点恐惧。",
