    "backFlavor": "A raised ladder leads halfway down a concrete chamber, filled with a bubbling sludge that gives off an awful stench.",
    "backFlavorZh": "一架凸起的梯子通向一间混凝土密室的中部，密室内充满冒泡的污泥，散发着令人作呕的恶臭。",
