    "pack": "lol",
    "packName": "The Labyrinths of Lunacy",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 35,
    "provenanceId": "70035",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "You find a ventilation shaft through which you can fit some important items...\nRevelation - Place The Vent in a [[Distortion]] location. If it is act 1, Groups B and C put the set-aside Key of Mysteries into play at that location.\n[fast]: Place any number of your resource tokens or clues on this card, and/or place any number of [[Item]] assets you control underneath this card. You may also place a written note underneath this card.\n[action]: Take control of any number of tokens, cards, or notes on/underneath this card.\n[reaction] At the end of the round: You send all of the tokens and cards gathered here through the ventilation shaft. Flip this card over and follow the instructions on the other side.",
    "textZh": "你发现一条通风井，可以放进一件或多件重要物品……\n显现 - 将通风井放在一个[[扭曲]]地点。如果是场景1，B组和C组将放在一边的奥秘之钥放置入场，放在该地点。\n[free]：将任意数量的资源标记或线索放在本卡牌上，和/或将任意数量你控制的[[道具]]支援放在本卡牌下方。你也可以将一张写下的便笺放在本卡牌下方。\n[action]：控制任意数量本卡牌上或下方的标记、卡牌或便笺。\n[reaction]在本轮结束时：你将聚集在此处的所有标记和卡牌通过通风井送出。将本卡牌翻面并遵循其背面的指示。",
