  "72025": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavor": "You plummet through space until you land in Lot C. You have the telescope in hand, but you are not alone.",
    "backFlavorZh": "你穿过太空坠入C片场。望远镜握在你手中，但你并不孤单。",
    "backName": "Return from the Cosmos",
    "backNameZh": "从宇宙归来",
    "backText": "Discard each enemy in play. Move each investigator to Space Set. Each investigator loses all of their clues.\nAdd each location with victory X and no clues on it to the victory display. Remove each [[Cosmos]] and [[Ritual Site]] card from the game. Put each set-aside [[Set]] location into play unrevealed, along with Central Lot, (Blurred) side faceup. Search the victory display for Saturnite Monarch and put it into play at Central Lot with its (In An Alien Land) side faceup.\nShuffle the top 2 cards of the Reel deck into the encounter deck, along with the encounter discard pile.\nAdd 1 [cultist], 1 [tablet], and 1 [elder_thing] to the chaos bag.\nPut the Helios Telescope story asset into play under the control of any investigator.",
    "backTextZh": "弃掉场上的所有敌人。将每位调查员移动到太空布景。每位调查员失去其所有线索。\n将每个具有胜利X且其上没有线索的地点加入胜利区。将每张[[宇宙]]和[[仪式地]]卡牌从游戏中移除。将每张放在一边的[[布景]]地点以未揭示面放置入场，并将中央片场以(模糊)面朝上放置入场。查找胜利区，找出土星人君主，将其以(异乡)面朝上放置在中央片场。\n将胶片牌库顶的2张卡牌与遭遇弃牌堆一起混洗入遭遇牌库。\n在混乱袋中加入1个[cultist]、1个[tablet]和1个[elder_thing]。\n将赫利俄斯望远镜剧情支援放置入场，由任意一位调查员控制。",
    "backimagesrc": "/bundles/cards/72025b.jpg",
    "code": "72025",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": true,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "cosmic_journey",
    "encounterName": "Cosmic Journey",
    "encounterPosition": 1,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "As you float noiselessly through space, André mentions that the Telescope must have caused this madness. With nothing but Saturn and its moons in front of you, you have no other choice but to explore these celestial bodies.",
    "flavorZh": "你无声地漂浮在太空中，安德烈提起一定是望远镜造成了这场疯狂。眼前只有土星及其卫星，你别无选择，只能探索这些天体。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "illustrator": "Drazenka Kimpel",
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/72025.jpg",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "A Cosmic Journey",
    "nameZh": "宇宙之旅",
    "originalCode": "72025",
    "pack": "film_fatale",
    "packName": "Film Fatale",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 25,
    "provenanceId": "72025",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Each Possessed Extra gets +2 health.\nObjective - Rebuild the telescope. When the round ends, if there are 3 shards on Helios Telescope, advance. (Hint: Explore the cosmos to rebuild the telescope.)",
    "textZh": "每个附身临演得到+2生命值。\n目标 - 重建望远镜。一轮结束时，如果赫利俄斯望远镜上有3个碎片，推进。(提示：探索宇宙以重建望远镜。)",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "act",
    "typeName": "Act",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/72025"
  },
  "72026": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backName": "The Shattered Scope",
    "backNameZh": "破碎的望远镜",
    "backText": "If this act advanced via its forced effect:\nThe Monarch easily knocks you aside and snatches the telescope from your arms. It clicks rapidly at the militant Saturnites surrounding you. You don't understand what it has planned with this immense power, but you know it isn't good.\n(→R1).\n\nIf this act advanced via its objective:\nAfter only a short time with the Helios Telescope, you have begun to master its power. The Monarch falls to the floor, exhausted. You take aim and fire a fantastical beam at the Saturnite. With a shriek, the monarch and its subjects vanish, leaving nothing but memories.\nAdd the Helios Telescope to the victory display.\n(→R2).",
    "backTextZh": "如果本场景以其强制效果推进：\n君主轻易将你撞开，从你手中夺走望远镜。它朝包围你的好战土星人急促地咔哒作响。你不明白它打算用这股强大力量做什么，但你知道绝非好事。\n(→结局1)。\n\n如果本场景以其目标效果推进：\n使用赫利俄斯望远镜不久后，你已开始掌握它的力量。君主精疲力竭地倒在地上。你瞄准土星人，射出一道奇幻光束。随着一声尖啸，君主和它的臣民消失无踪，只留下记忆。\n将赫利俄斯望远镜加入胜利区。\n(→结局2)。",
    "backimagesrc": "/bundles/cards/72026b.jpg",
    "code": "72026",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": true,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "cosmic_journey",
    "encounterName": "Cosmic Journey",
    "encounterPosition": 2,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "The telescope's transporting beam may be able to send the Saturnites home, but the monarch is hellbent upon taking it.",
    "flavorZh": "望远镜的传送光束或许能把土星人送回家，但君主一心要夺走它。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "illustrator": "Drazenka Kimpel",
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/72026.jpg",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "From Whence They Came",
    "nameZh": "它们从何而来",
    "originalCode": "72026",
    "pack": "film_fatale",
    "packName": "Film Fatale",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 26,
    "provenanceId": "72026",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Each Possessed Extra gets +2 health, +1 fight, +1 evade, and gains elusive and the [[Saturnite]] trait.\n[action] Spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Place 1 shard on Helios Telescope.\nForced - If Helios Telescope has no shards on it, advance.\nObjective - Dethrone the monarch. If the Saturnite Monarch is defeated, advance.",
    "textZh": "每个附身临演得到+2生命值、+1战斗值和+1躲避值，并获得逃逸和[[土星人]]特性。\n[action]调查员共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：在赫利俄斯望远镜上放置1个碎片。\n强制 - 如果赫利俄斯望远镜上没有碎片，推进。\n目标 - 推翻君主。如果土星人君主被击败，推进。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "act",
    "typeName": "Act",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/72026"
  },
