    "backName": "Return from the Jungle",
    "backNameZh": "从丛林归来",
    "backText": "If the Allosaurus enemy is in play, set it aside out of play (keeping all tokens and attachments). Discard each other enemy in play. Move each investigator to Jungle Set. Each investigator loses all of their clues.\nAdd each location with victory X and no clues on it to the victory display. Remove each [[Jungle]] location from the game. Put each set-aside [[Set]] location into play, unrevealed, along with Central Lot, (Blurred) side faceup. If the Allosaurus enemy is set aside, spawn it at Central Lot, (Rampaging Predator) side faceup.\nShuffle the top 2 cards of the Reel deck into the encounter deck, along with the encounter discard pile.\nAdd 1 [cultist], 1 [tablet], and 1 [elder_thing] to the chaos bag.",
    "backTextZh": "如果异特龙敌人在场，将其放在一边，位于场外(保留其所有标记和附属卡牌)。弃掉场上的每名其他敌人。将每位调查员移动到丛林布景。每位调查员失去其所有线索。\n将每个具有胜利X且其上没有线索的地点加入胜利区。将每张[[丛林]]地点从游戏中移除。将每张放在一边的[[布景]]地点以未揭示面放置入场，并将中央片场以(模糊)面朝上放置入场。如果异特龙敌人被放在一边，将其以(横冲直撞的掠食者)面朝上生成在中央片场。\n将胶片牌库顶的2张卡牌与遭遇弃牌堆一起混洗入遭遇牌库。\n在混乱袋中加入1个[cultist]、1个[tablet]和1个[elder_thing]。",
    "backimagesrc": "/bundles/cards/72037b.jpg",
    "code": "72037",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
