    "text": "Each Possessed Extra gets +2 health, +2 evade, and gains alert and the [[Dinosaur]] trait.\n[fast] Spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Search the top 6 cards of the encounter deck for an enemy and spawn it at the location with the most investigators.\nObjective - Shatter the staff. If the Staff of the Serpent is defeated, advance.",
    "textZh": "每个附身临演得到+2生命值、+2躲避值，并获得警戒和[[恐龙]]特性。\n[fast]调查员共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：查找遭遇牌库顶的6张卡牌，找出一名敌人，将其生成在调查员最多的地点。\n目标 - 打碎手杖。如果巨蛇之杖被击败，推进。",
