    "text": "Each Possessed Extra gets +1 fight, +1 health, and gains elusive.\nExhausted enemies cannot be damaged.\nObjective - When the round ends, if the Accursed Cape is in the victory display, advance.",
    "textZh": "每个附身临演得到+1战斗值、+1生命值，并获得逃逸。\n已横置的敌人不能受到伤害。\n目标 - 一轮结束时，如果受诅咒的斗篷位于胜利区，推进。",
