    "text": "The Contessa cannot leave Throne of Blood.\nForced - When you reveal this location: Search all in- and out-of-play areas for The Contessa and move her to Throne of Blood. Heal all damage from The Contessa and attach the set-aside Accursed Cape story asset to her.\n[fast] Spend 1 clue: Deal 1 damage to an enemy at Throne of Blood",
