    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull]: -3 (-6 instead if you are at a [[Bayou]] location).\n[cultist]: -3. If the Rougarou is in your location, reveal another token.\n[tablet]: Reveal another token. If you fail, until the end of the round, you cannot move.\n[elder_thing]: -4. If the Rougarou is at your location or a connecting location, it attacks you.",
    "backTextZh": "困难/专家\n[skull]：-3。(如果你位于[[河口]]地点，改为-6。)\n[cultist]：-3。如果狼人位于你所在地点，再揭示一个混乱标记。\n[tablet]：再揭示一个混乱标记。如果你失败，本轮结束前不能移动。\n[elder_thing]：-4。如果狼人位于你所在地点或一个连接地点，它攻击你。",
