    "text": "Forced - After The Rougarou leaves a location: Place 1 clue from the token bank on that location.\nObjective - \"We have to destroy the beast!\" If The Rougarou is defeated: (→R2)\nObjective - \"Maybe there's another way...\" While an investigator is engaged with The Rougarou, he or she may choose to advance. (Limit once per phase.)",
    "textZh": "强制 - 狼人离开一个地点后：从标记池在该地点放置1个线索。\n目标 - “我们必须消灭这头野兽！”如果狼人被击败：(→结局2)。\n目标 - “也许还有别的办法……”一位调查员与狼人交战时，可以选择推进。(每阶段限一次。)",
