    "backFlavor": "Black storm clouds loom above you, watching patiently as you trudge through the bayou. Their shapes twist and churn in the night sky, blotting out the stars.",
    "backFlavorZh": "黑色的暴风云在头顶盘旋，耐心注视着你艰难地穿过河口。它们的形状在夜空中扭曲翻腾，遮蔽了星辰。",
