    "encounterCode": "venice",
    "encounterName": "Carnevale of Horrors",
    "encounterPosition": 6,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "The civilians in the Basilica are safe for now, but Venice is doomed if you don't act quickly. The only way to ensure the safety of the sacrifices is to draw the creature in the lagoon away from the city. Sweat beads down your forehead as you realize this decision may be your last. Legs trembling, you head toward the moored boats docked by the canals.",
    "flavorZh": "大教堂里的市民暂时安全，但你若不快些行动，威尼斯就注定毁灭。确保祭品安全的唯一方法，就是将潟湖生物引离城市。你意识到这可能是自己最后一次抉择，汗珠顺着额头滴落。双腿颤抖着，你朝运河旁停泊的小船走去。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
