    "backFlavor": "The Ponte di Rialto is the oldest bridge spanning the Grand Canal. It has endured for centuries, but even its stone may crumble should you fail.",
    "backFlavorZh": "里亚尔托桥是横跨大运河最古老的桥梁。它已历经数个世纪，但若你失败，连它的石材也可能崩塌。",
