    "encounterName": "The Eternal Slumber",
    "encounterPosition": 6,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "You pursue the Brotherhood's agent west as he flees the city. Following his trail into the desert will be easier if you join the archaeological expedition currently underway.",
    "flavorZh": "兄弟会成员逃出了城市，你跟着他一路往西。要是加入新近的考古探险队，在沙漠追寻兄弟会踪迹就会容易得多。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "illustrator": "Lino Drieghe",
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/83006.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Secrets in the Sand",
    "nameZh": "沙漠中的秘密",
    "originalCode": "83006",
    "pack": "guardians",
    "packName": "Guardians of the Abyss",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 6,
    "provenanceId": "83006",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Clues cannot be placed on [[Cairo]] locations.\n[action] If you are at an [[Expedition]] location: Explore. Draw the top card of the exploration deck. If it is a connecting location, put it into play and move to it.",
    "textZh": "线索不能放置在[[开罗]]地点。\n[action]如果你位于一个[[探险]]地点：探索。抽取探索牌库顶的1张卡牌。如果该卡牌是一个连接地点，将其放置入场，并移动到该地点。",
