    "packName": "Guardians of the Abyss",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 20,
    "provenanceId": "83020",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[action]: Explore. Draw the top card of the exploration deck. If it is a connecting location, put it into play and move to it.\nObjective - At the end of the round, if each undefeated investigator is at the Eldritch Gate and they spend the requisite number of clues, advance.",
    "textZh": "[action]：探索。抽取探索牌库顶的一张卡牌。如果该卡牌是一个连接地点，将其放置入场，并移动到该地点。\n目标 - 一轮结束时，如果每位未被击败的调查员都位于异界之门，花费所需数量的线索推进场景。",
