    "text": "Aloof. Patrol (nearest location with clues).\nForced - At the end of the enemy phase: Move 1 clue to Arkham Officer from its location, flipping it to its doom side.\n[action]: Parley. Test [willpower] (3). If you succeed, either automatically evade Arkham Officer, or flip one of its doom to its clue side and take control of it.",
    "textZh": "冷漠。巡逻(最近的有线索地点)。\n强制 - 敌军阶段结束时：将其所在地点的1个线索移到阿卡姆警官上，并将其翻至毁灭面。\n[action]：谈判。进行一次[willpower](3)检定。如果你成功，选择一项：自动躲避阿卡姆警官；或将其上的一个毁灭标记翻至线索面，并控制它。",
