    "stage": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Alien Device gains: \"[action] If Vengeful Specter is exhausted and at your location, remove 2 clues from Alien Device: Deal 2 damage to Vengeful Specter.\"\nObjective - If Vengeful Specter is defeated, advance.",
    "textZh": "异星装置获得：“[action]如果复仇幽魂已横置且位于你所在地点，从异星装置上移除2个线索：对复仇幽魂造成2点伤害。”\n目标 - 如果复仇幽魂被击败，推进。",
    "traits": [],
