    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Tome of Rituals gains: \"[action] Remove 2 clues from Tome of Rituals: Fight. This attack uses [willpower] instead of [combat]. If you succeed, instead of dealing damage, remove 3 doom from the attacked enemy.\"\nObjective - If Otherworldly Meddler is defeated or has no doom on it, advance.",
    "textZh": "仪式古书获得：“[action]从仪式古书上移除2个线索：攻击。本次攻击使用[willpower]，而非[combat]。如果你成功，改为不造成伤害并从被攻击敌人上移除3个毁灭标记。”\n目标 - 如果异界干涉者被击败或其上没有毁灭标记，推进。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "agenda",
    "typeName": "Agenda",
