    "text": "Time-Worn Locket gains: \"[reaction] When Hotel Manager would attack an investigator at your location, remove 2 clues from Time-Worn Locket: Cancel that attack.\"\nObjective - If Hotel Manager is defeated, advance.",
    "textZh": "陈旧的挂坠盒获得：“[reaction]酒店经理将要攻击你所在地点的一位调查员时，从陈旧的挂坠盒上移除2个线索：取消该次攻击。”\n目标 - 如果酒店经理被击败，推进。",
    "traits": [],
