    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Each [[Guest]] enemy loses Victory 0, loses [[Innocent]], and gains [[Cultist]].\nEach [[Lead]] asset gains: \"[action] If Dimensional Shambler is at your location, remove 1 clue from this asset: Evade. Automatically evade Dimensional Shambler.\nObjective - If there are no [[Cultist]] enemies in play, advance.",
    "textZh": "每名[[宾客]]敌人失去胜利0和[[无辜]]，并获得[[异教徒]]。\n每张[[迹象]]支援获得：“[action]如果次元蹒跚者位于你所在地点，从该支援上移除1个线索：躲避。自动躲避次元蹒跚者。”\n目标 - 如果场上没有[[异教徒]]敌人，推进。",
    "traits": [],
