    "text": "Each [[Lead]] asset gains: \"[action] Remove 1 clue from this asset: Search the encounter deck and discard pile for a [[Staff]] enemy and draw it. Shuffle the encounter deck.\"\n[reaction] After a [[Staff]] enemy is defeated: Deal 1 horror to Harvested Brain.\nObjective - If there is 2 plus 1 [per_investigator] horror on Harvested Brain, advance.",
    "textZh": "每张[[迹象]]支援获得：“[action]从本支援上移除1个线索：查找遭遇牌库和遭遇弃牌堆，找出一名[[职工]]敌人并将其抽取。混洗遭遇牌库。”\n[reaction]一名[[职工]]敌人被击败后：对采集的大脑造成1点恐惧。\n目标 - 如果采集的大脑上有2+1[per_investigator]点恐惧，推进。",
