    "text": "Room 212 gains: \"[action] If Tome of Rituals is at this location: Test [willpower] (5) or [intellect] (5). If you succeed, move up to 1 [per_investigator] clues from Tome of Rituals to Harvested Brain.\nObjective - If Harvested Brain has 3 [per_investigator] clues on it, advance",
    "textZh": "212房间获得：“[action]如果仪式古书位于本地点：进行一次[willpower](5)或[intellect](5)检定。如果你成功，将仪式古书上的至多1[per_investigator]个线索移到采集的大脑上。\n目标 - 如果采集的大脑上有3[per_investigator]个线索，推进。",
