    "text": "Each [[Guest]] enemy loses Victory 0, loses [[Innocent]], and gains [[Cultist]].\nBasement gains: \"[action]: Test [willpower] (4) or [agility] (4). You may remove 1 clue from a [[Lead]] asset in the Basement to reduce the difficulty of this test by 2. If you succeed, remove 1 doom from the agenda.\"\nObjective - If there is no doom on this agenda, advance.",
    "textZh": "每名[[宾客]]敌人失去胜利0和[[无辜]]，并获得[[异教徒]]。\n地下室获得：“[action]：进行一次[willpower](4)或[agility](4)检定。你可以从地下室的一张[[迹象]]支援上移除1个线索，使本次检定难度-2。如果你成功，从本密谋上移除1个毁灭标记。”\n目标 - 如果本密谋上没有毁灭标记，推进。",
