    "provenanceId": "85007",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Forced - After any amount of damage is placed on Vulnerable Heart: Place twice that much damage on Subject 8L-08 as well.\n[fast] While an investigator at your location is attacking Vulnerable Heart, spend 1 clue: That investigator gets +2 [combat] for this attack.\nObjective - At the end of the round, you must advance.",
    "textZh": "强制 - 任意数量的伤害被放置在脆弱心脏上后：也在个体代号8L-08上放置等同于该伤害数量两倍的伤害。\n[free]你所在地点一位调查员正在攻击脆弱心脏时，花费1个线索：该调查员本次攻击得到+2[combat]。\n目标 - 本轮结束时，你必须推进。",
