    "text": "Forced - When any amount of doom is placed on a player card: Place that amount of doom on any agenda as well.\nObjective - Investigators may only spend the requisite number of clues if no [[Cultist]] enemies are in play.",
    "textZh": "强制 - 任意数量的毁灭标记将要放置到一张玩家卡时：同时将等量毁灭标记放置到任意密谋上。\n目标 - 仅当场上没有[[异教徒]]敌人时，调查员可以花费所需数量的线索。",
