    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[action] If you are at a [[Ritual Site]]: You try to seal off the portal. Place 1 of your clues around Hub Dimension. Then you may test [willpower] (2) or [intellect] (2). If you succeed, place 1 of your clues around Hub Dimension.\nForced - When any amount of doom is placed on a player card: Place that amount of doom on any agenda as well.\nObjective - If your group has \"sealed off the Hub Dimension,\" advance.",
    "textZh": "[action]如果你位于[[仪式地]]：你尝试封印传送门。在次元枢纽周围放置你的1个线索。然后你可以进行一次[willpower](2)或[intellect](2)检定。如果你成功，再在次元枢纽周围放置你的1个线索。\n强制 - 任意数量的毁灭标记将要放置到一张玩家卡时：同时将等量毁灭标记放置到任意密谋上。\n目标 - 如果你的组“封印了次元枢纽”，推进场景。",
