    "backFlavor": "Boosted by the unprecedented prosperity of the Roaring Twenties, New York City is in the midst of a building boom as towers grow ever taller. Skyscrapers are topping one another in rapid succession: the Woolworth Building was surpassed by the Chrysler Building, which will soon be eclipsed by the Empire State Building.",
