    "backFlavor": "Just south of Miskatonic University in Uptown, Miriam Beecher's novelty shop is filled with various arcane oddities the likes of which science cannot explain. After many years of work, Miriam ponders retirement and perhaps the sale of her store.",
    "backFlavorZh": "米斯卡塔尼克大学南面的上城区，米里亚姆·比彻的新奇商店摆满科学无法解释的秘法奇物。多年辛劳后，米里亚姆开始考虑退休，以及或许出售店铺。",
