    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull]: -X. X is your alarm level.\n[cultist]: Reveal another token. If you fail, raise your alarm level by 1.\n[tablet]: -4. The nearest enemy moves once toward you.\n[elder_thing]: -6. You may raise your alarm level by 1 to automatically succeed, instead.",
    "backTextZh": "困难 / 专家\n[skull]：-X。X等同于你的警戒等级。\n[cultist]：再抽取一个标记。如果你检定失败，将你的警戒等级提升1。\n[tablet]：-4。最近的敌人朝你移动一次。\n[elder_thing]：-6。你可以将你的警戒等级提升1，改为自动成功。",
