    "encounterPosition": 5,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "The cult is against you. Creatures from beyond time and space are against you. Now fortune itself is against you. No one said this would be easy.",
    "flavorZh": "邪教与你为敌；超越时空而来的怪物与你为敌；现在连运气本身都与你为敌。你早就知道这一切不会这么容易。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
