    "text": "[reaction] After you trigger the [action] ability on a [[Game]] location: Remove 1 clue from The Wellspring of Fortune (2 clues instead if you gained resources from the [[Game]] location's ability).\nObjective - Accomplish as many tasks as you can and get out before you are noticed! If each undefeated investigator has resigned, advance.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]你触发一个[[游戏]]地点上的[action]能力后：移除时运泉源上的1个线索(如果你从[[游戏]]地点的能力获得资源，改为移除2个线索)。\n目标 - 在被注意到前尽可能完成最多任务并离开！如果每位未被击败的调查员都撤退，推进。",
