    "text": "[action] Move. Discard the top card of the encounter deck and check its game icon (if an investigator \"obtained a schematic,\" you may mulligan up to two times):\n- Ifits suit is ♣ or ♠: Move to Guard Room.\n- If its suit is ♥: Move to Casino Lounge.\n- If its suit is ♦: Move to Baccarat Table.",
    "textZh": "[action] 移动。弃掉遭遇牌库顶的1张卡牌，并检查它的游戏图标。(如果有调查员\"取得蓝图\"，你可以最多重调两次)：\n- 如果其花色为♣或♠：移动到守卫室。\n- 如果其花色为♥：移动到赌场交谊厅。\n- 如果其花色为♦：移动到百家乐。",
