    "myriad": false,
    "name": "The Stakeout",
    "nameZh": "事前准备",
    "originalCode": "88023",
    "pack": "fof",
    "packName": "Fortune and Folly",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 23,
    "provenanceId": "88023",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Each of the following is a task that can be completed in Fortune and Folly, Part I:\n □ An investigator \"found a vent.\"\n □ An investigator \"impersonated a high roller.\"\n □ An investigator \"convinced Isamara to participate in the heist.\"\n □ An investigator \"obtained an employee uniform.\"\n □ An investigator \"stole Abarran's keys.\"\n □ An investigator \"cleaned out the house.\"Forced - When an investigator is eliminated (by defeat or resignation): Place each of that investigator's clues on this story card, instead of placing them at their location.",
    "textZh": "以下是你可以在时运与愚行，第一部分中完成的任务：\n □调查员\"找到通风口\"。\n □调查员\"扮演高额赌客\"。\n □调查员\"说服伊萨玛拉参与劫案\"。\n □调查员\"取得员工制服\"。\n □调查员\"盗取阿巴兰的钥匙\"。\n □调查员\"满载而归\"。强制 - 一位调查员退场(被击败或撤退)时：将该调查员的所有线索放到本剧情卡牌上，而不是放到其所在地点。",
