  "88027": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backName": "Personal Entanglement",
    "backNameZh": "私人恩怨",
    "backText": "You have learned that someone from your past works in this casino - what are the odds? Unfortunately, Abarran has learned of this connection as well. You have to rescue them before it's too late!\nAttach this story card to Owner's Office. This story card represents somebody connected to the lead investigator.\n[action] Investigators at Owner's Office spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Remove this story card from the game.\nForced - At the end of the enemy phase: Place 1 horror on this story card (2 horror instead if there is an enemy at Owner's Office).If there is 6 or more horror on this story card:\nYou are too late. The lead investigator suffers 1 mental trauma. Each investigator takes 2 direct horror. Remove this story card from the game.",
    "backTextZh": "你认出了几名过去工作中认识的熟人——这种概率有多大？不幸的是阿巴兰也得知了这层关系，你必须在太迟前将他们救出来！\n将本剧情卡牌叠加到老板办公室。本剧情卡牌代表调查员队长过去的熟人。\n[action]位于老板办公室的调查员可以作为团队共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：从游戏中移除本剧情卡牌。\n强制 - 敌军阶段结束时：在本剧情卡牌上放置1点恐惧(如果有敌人位于老板办公室，改为放置2点恐惧)。如果本剧情卡牌上有6点或更多恐惧：\n你太迟了。调查员队长受到1点精神创伤。每位调查员受到2点直接恐惧。从游戏中移除本剧情卡牌。",
    "backimagesrc": "/bundles/cards/88027b.jpg",
    "code": "88027",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": true,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "fortune_and_folly",
    "encounterName": "Fortune and Folly",
    "encounterPosition": 27,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavorZh": "",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/88027.jpg",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Fortune's Disfavor",
    "nameZh": "时运不济",
    "originalCode": "88027",
    "pack": "fof",
    "packName": "Fortune and Folly",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 27,
    "provenanceId": "88027",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Isamara warned you that the relic you seek possesses strange abilities that bring misfortune upon those who are not favored by its bearer. Perhaps, then, you should have factored a sudden turn of fortune into your plans. For, at this moment, in the midst of your high-stakes heist, everything is about to be turned upside-down...\nFlip this card over and resolve the text on its other side.",
    "textZh": "伊萨玛拉警告过你，追寻的遗物有呼唤不幸的力量，尤其会降临在不合其拥有者心意的人身上。也许你应该将突发状况考虑进计划内；劫案进行途中，所有事情都可能发生……\n将本卡牌翻到背面，并结算另一面的文字。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/88027"
  },
