  "89011": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "Read only if \"the escort failed:\"\nRemove Mi-Go Destroyer, Armored Car, and this card from the game. Each investigator takes 1 damage. Lose 1 countermeasure.\nRead only if \"the car reached its target:\"\nIt’s chilling what a machine of war can do when it’s fully unleashed, but in this case, you’re relieved at the thundering of its gun and the crunch of its tires on alien ground. With this area secure, the military can focus its efforts on the anomaly itself. Although they don’t thank you for your efforts directly, the detachment of agents following you around tells you they view you as an asset.\nPut the set-aside G-Men story asset into play under any investigator’s control. Remove Armored Car from the game. Add Mi-Go Destroyer and this card to the victory display. Deal 5 damage to Subject 8L-08.",
    "backTextZh": "仅当“护送失败”时阅读：\n将米戈毁灭者、装甲车和本卡牌从游戏中移除。每位调查员受到1点伤害。失去1对策。\n仅当“装甲车抵达目标”时阅读：\n完全释放的战争机器何等可怕，但在这次你却因它的炮火轰鸣和轮胎碾过异星地面的巨响而感到宽慰。此区域既已安全，军方就能将精力集中在异常现象本身。虽然他们没有直接感谢你的努力，但跟在你身边的那队特工表明，他们认为你是值得利用的资产。\n将放在一边的联邦探员剧情支援放置入场，受任意一位调查员控制。将装甲车从游戏中移除。将米戈毁灭者和本卡牌加入胜利区。对个体代号8L-08造成5点伤害。",
    "backimagesrc": "/bundles/cards/89011b.jpg",
    "code": "89011",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": true,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "migo_incursion_2",
    "encounterName": "Mi-Go Incursion II",
    "encounterPosition": 1,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "You’ve heard from some of the civilians fleeing to the perimeter of the quarantine zone that the military is sending in armor to secure Blackwater. You’re not sure a bigger gun is the answer, but it might help deter the creatures that have been wreaking havoc across the town. If you can clear the path and prevent it from getting devoured like the rest of the vehicles they’ve sent in, maybe it can make a real difference.",
    "flavorZh": "你听从隔离区逃往边缘的平民说，军方正派遣装甲部队来保卫黑水镇。你不确定更大的枪是否就是答案，但它或许能震慑那些在镇上肆虐的生物。如果你能清理道路，防止它像其他被派进来的车辆一样遭到吞噬，或许真能带来改变。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/89011.jpg",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Escort the Car",
    "nameZh": "护送装甲车",
    "originalCode": "89011",
    "pack": "blbe",
    "packName": "The Blob That Ate Everything ELSE!",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 11,
    "provenanceId": "89011",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Revelation - Put the set-aside Armored Car into play at the location farthest from the Fungus Mound. Spawn the set-aside Mi-Go Destroyer enemy at the Fungus Mound. Put this card into play next to the act deck.\nForced - After Armored Car enters the Fungus Mound: Remember that \"the car reached its target.\" Flip this card over.\nForced - If Armored Car is defeated or devoured: Remember that \"the escort failed.\" Flip this card over.",
    "textZh": "显现 - 将放在一边的装甲车放置入场，放在距离真菌丘最远的地点。将放在一边的米戈毁灭者敌人生成在真菌丘。将本卡牌放置入场，放在场景牌库旁。\n强制 - 装甲车进入真菌丘后：记录“装甲车抵达目标”。将本卡牌翻面。\n强制 - 装甲车被击败或被吞噬时：记录“护送失败”。将本卡牌翻面。",
    "traits": [
      "Part 1"
    ],
    "traitsZh": [
      "第1部分"
    ],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/89011",
    "victory": 1
  },
