  "89014": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "Read only if \"the brain was taken:\"\nRemove Mi-Go Scientist, Brain Case, and this card from the game. The investigators, as a group, return 3 of their clues to the token pool.\nRead only if \"the brain was recovered:\"\nThe scientists listen to your story and examine the cylinder. To your surprise, you hear a distorted voice from what must be a strange speaker stemming from the jar. The brain vibrates within. \"Oh, thank the heavens. I can hear you. Where am I?\" it asks. You explain what has transpired, and ask why the creatures were after it. \"I know something they needed. Here, I can teach you - do you have a pen?\"\nPut the set-aside Corrosive Cloud story asset into play under any investigator’s control. Remove Brain Case from the game. Add Mi-Go Scientist and this card to the victory display. Any investigator discovers 1 clue each from up to 2 locations. Gain 1 countermeasure.",
    "backTextZh": "仅当“大脑被带走”时阅读：\n将米戈科学家、脑盒和本卡牌从游戏中移除。调查员共同将其3个线索放回标记池。\n仅当“大脑已夺回”时阅读：\n科学家们听完你的故事，检查圆筒。令你惊讶的是，你从罐子中伸出的奇怪扬声器里听见一个扭曲的声音。里面的大脑振动起来。“噢，谢天谢地。我能听见你们。我在哪里？”它问道。你解释了发生的一切，并问那些生物为什么追逐它。“我知道它们需要的东西。来，我可以教你们——你们有笔吗？”\n将放在一边的腐蚀云雾剧情支援放置入场，受任意一位调查员控制。将脑盒从游戏中移除。将米戈科学家和本卡牌加入胜利区。任意一位调查员可以从至多2个地点各发现1个线索。获得1对策。",
    "backimagesrc": "/bundles/cards/89014b.jpg",
    "code": "89014",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": true,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "migo_incursion_2",
    "encounterName": "Mi-Go Incursion II",
    "encounterPosition": 4,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "You thought you’d seen everything, but when you spot one of the creatures flying overhead with a human brain in its grasp, you realize you’re sorely mistaken. Even more surprising, it seemed to be cradling the brain safely inside a glass cylinder, as if it were a scientific sample. Are these monsters collecting human brains? The irony isn’t lost on you - the creatures are likely doing the same kind of research as the scientists at the research site - but even still, you have to find this creature and stop this sick experiment!",
    "flavorZh": "你本以为已见识过一切，但看到一只生物飞过头顶、爪中抓着人脑时，你意识到自己大错特错。更令人惊讶的是，它似乎将大脑安全地安放在玻璃圆筒中，仿佛那是一份科学样本。这些怪物在收集人脑吗？讽刺的是，这些生物很可能正在进行与研究营地科学家相同的研究；但无论如何，你必须找到这只生物并阻止这场病态的实验！",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/89014.jpg",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Reclaim the Brain",
    "nameZh": "夺回大脑",
    "originalCode": "89014",
    "pack": "blbe",
    "packName": "The Blob That Ate Everything ELSE!",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 14,
    "provenanceId": "89014",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Revelation - Spawn the set-aside Mi-Go Scientist enemy at the location farthest from the Fungus Mound. Attach the set-aside Brain Case asset to Mi-Go Scientist. Put this card into play next to the act deck.\nForced - If Brain Case is at Research Site and under an investigator’s control: Remember that \"the brain was recovered.\" Flip this card over.\nForced - If Brain Case is at Fungus Mound and attached to Mi-Go Scientist: Remember that \"the brain was taken.\" Flip this card over.",
    "textZh": "显现 - 将放在一边的米戈科学家敌人生成在距离真菌丘最远的地点。将放在一边的脑盒支援附属到米戈科学家。将本卡牌放置入场，放在场景牌库旁。\n强制 - 如果脑盒位于研究营地且受一位调查员控制：记录“大脑已夺回”。将本卡牌翻面。\n强制 - 如果脑盒位于真菌丘且附属到米戈科学家：记录“大脑被带走”。将本卡牌翻面。",
    "traits": [
      "Part 1"
    ],
    "traitsZh": [
      "第1部分"
    ],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/89014",
    "victory": 1
  },
