  "89017": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "Read only if \"the Mi-Go completed their research:\"\nRemove both Mi-Go Researchers and this card from the game. Each [[Ooze]] enemy that was researched readies and heals all damage on it. An investigator returns 1 of their clues to the token pool.\nRead only if \"the Mi-Go research was stopped:\"\nEventually, the creatures’ thirst for knowledge isn’t enough to keep them in this hostile environment, and they flee back to the void of space - at least, for now. In the aftermath, you recover one of the strange tools the creatures were carrying: a scalpel of some glasslike, razor-sharp material.\nPut the set-aside Alien Instruments story asset into play under any investigator’s control. Add both Mi‑Go Researchers and this card to the victory display. Until the end of the game, each [[Mi-Go]] enemy gets –2 health and –2 evade. Any investigator discovers 1 clue at any revealed location.",
    "backTextZh": "仅当“米戈完成研究”时阅读：\n将两名米戈研究员和本卡牌从游戏中移除。每个被研究的[[软泥]]敌人重整，并治愈其所有伤害。一位调查员将其1个线索放回标记池。\n仅当“米戈研究被阻止”时阅读：\n最终，这些生物对知识的渴望不足以让它们留在这个敌对环境中，它们逃回太空的虚空之中——至少暂时如此。事后，你找回了其中一件生物携带的奇怪工具：一把玻璃般材质制成、锋利如剃刀的手术刀。\n将放在一边的外星器具剧情支援放置入场，受任意一位调查员控制。将两名米戈研究员和本卡牌加入胜利区。游戏结束前，每个[[米戈]]敌人生命值-2，躲避值-2。任意一位调查员在任意已揭示地点发现1个线索。",
    "backimagesrc": "/bundles/cards/89017b.jpg",
    "code": "89017",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": true,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "migo_incursion_2",
    "encounterName": "Mi-Go Incursion II",
    "encounterPosition": 7,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "Flitting about the night sky, the alien entities descend, searching. Observing. But for what purpose? Did they bring the ooze-thing here, or are they in the dark, too? One thing is for sure: They’re terrifying the quarantined citizens of Blackwater and causing pandemonium. If they’re not going to help contain the subject, they’re just stirring up trouble. Perhaps you can \"discourage\" them from performing their research so you can focus your efforts on the real threat.",
    "flavorZh": "外星实体在夜空中飞掠、降下，搜索，观察。但目的为何？是它们把软泥怪带来这里，还是它们也被蒙在鼓里？有一点可以确定：它们正恐吓黑水镇被隔离的居民，制造混乱。如果它们不打算帮助收容个体，就只是在捣乱。或许你可以“劝阻”它们进行研究，让你能专注于真正的威胁。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/89017.jpg",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Prevent Their Research",
    "nameZh": "阻止它们的研究",
    "originalCode": "89017",
    "pack": "blbe",
    "packName": "The Blob That Ate Everything ELSE!",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 17,
    "provenanceId": "89017",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Revelation - Spawn both set-aside Mi-Go Researcher enemies, one at the Fungus Mound, and the other at the location farthest from the Fungus Mound. Put this card into play next to the act deck.\nForced - If there are no Mi-Go Researcher enemies in play: Remember that \"the Mi-Go research was stopped.\" Flip this card over.\nForced - If there are 6 resources on this story card: Remember that \"the Mi-Go completed their research.\" Flip this card over.",
    "textZh": "显现 - 将两名放在一边的米戈研究员敌人生成：一名在真菌丘，另一名在距离真菌丘最远的地点。将本卡牌放置入场，放在场景牌库旁。\n强制 - 如果场上没有米戈研究员敌人：记录“米戈研究被阻止”。将本卡牌翻面。\n强制 - 如果本剧情卡牌上有6个资源：记录“米戈完成研究”。将本卡牌翻面。",
    "traits": [
      "Part 1"
    ],
    "traitsZh": [
      "第1部分"
    ],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/89017",
    "victory": 1
  },
