    "subname": "The Librarian",
    "subnameZh": "图书馆员",
    "text": "You get +1 [willpower] and +1 sanity for each [[Tome]] asset you control.\n[fast]: One at a time, resolve an [action] ability on each [[Tome]] asset you control, ignoring their [action] cost. (Limit once per game.)\n[elder_sign] effect: +1. You may return a [[Tome]] asset from your discard pile to your hand.",
    "textZh": "你每控制一本[[书籍]]支援，你获得+1[willpower]和+1神志。\n[free]：依次结算你控制的所有[[书籍]]支援的[action]能力，无须支付[action]费用。(每场游戏仅限一次。)\n[elder_sign]效果：+1。你可以从弃牌堆将1张[[书籍]]支援置入手牌。",
