    "text": "Daisy Walker deck only. Advanced.\nYou have 2 additional hand slots, which can only be used to hold [[Tome]] assets.\n[reaction] When you play a [[Tome]] asset during your turn, exhaust Daisy's Tote Bag: That asset gains fast.",
