    "subtype": "weakness",
    "text": "Advanced.\nRevelation - Put this card into play in your threat area, with 3 horror on it. It cannot leave play while it has 1 or more horror on it.\nWhile it is in play, treat each [elder_sign] you reveal on a chaos token as a [cultist], [tablet], and [elder_thing] (resolve all three).\n[action]: Move 1 horror from this card to Daisy Walker. Then, if The Necronomicon has no horror on it, discard it.",
    "textZh": "进阶。\n显现 - 将死灵之书放置入场，放到你的威胁区域，带有3点恐惧。死灵之书上有恐惧时不能离场。\n将你揭示的每个混乱标记上的[elder_sign]视为[cultist]、[tablet]和[elder_thing](同时结算它们)。\n[action]：将死灵之书的1点恐惧移动到黛西·沃克上。然后，如果死灵之书没有恐惧，将其弃掉。",
