    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Ignore all Objectives on locations.\n[fast] If you are Daisy Walker, investigators at your location spend 1 [per_investigator] clues: Shuffle 1 facedown player card beneath this location into your deck.\nObjective - Find a way to banish the Namer of the Dead before it is too late.",
    "textZh": "忽略所有地点上的目标。\n[free]如果你是黛西·沃克，你所在地点的调查员共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：将此地点下方的一张玩家卡洗入你的牌库。\n目标 - 在一切都太迟了之前驱除死书之灵！",
