    "subname": "Presence Within the Grimoire",
    "subnameZh": "魔典内的存在",
    "text": "Hunter.\nPrey - Daisy Walker only.\nForced - When Namer of the Dead would be defeated: Instead, fully heal it, exhaust it, and move it to Orne Library.\n[action] If you are Daisy Walker and you control at least 4 non-weakness [[Tome]] assets: Parley. Test [willpower] (18). This test gets -2 difficulty for each [[Tome]] asset you control. If you succeed, advance the act.",
    "textZh": "猎手。\n猎物 - 仅限黛西·沃克。\n强制 - 如果死书之灵将要被击败：改为治愈其所有伤害，将其横置并移动到奥恩图书馆。\n[action]如果你是黛西·沃克且你控制了至少4本非弱点[[书籍]]支援：谈判。检定[willpower](18)。你每控制一本非弱点[[书籍]]支援，本次检定难度降低2。如果你成功，推进场景。",
