    "text": "[fast] Spend up to 3 resources: Test a base skill value of 3 against a difficulty equal to the amount of resources just spent. If you succeed, gain twice the number of spent resources. Only [agility] and [wild] skill icons may be committed to this test. (Limit once per round.)\n[elder_sign] effect: +1. Choose a level 2 or less card in your discard pile. Add the chosen card to your hand.",
    "textZh": "[free]花费至多3资源：进行一次基础值为3，难度为你花费的资源数量的技能检定。如果你检定成功，获得两倍于花费数量的资源。在本次检定中你只能投入[agility]和[wild]图标。(每轮仅限一次。)\n[elder_sign]效果：+1。从你的弃牌堆选择一张等级不超过2的牌，将其置入你的手牌。",
