    "encounterPosition": 3,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "You don't want trouble, so it's best not to cause it. Try not to go all in too soon, or you'll likely take the bounce.",
    "flavorZh": "你不想惹麻烦，所以最好别主动生事。尽量别太快赌上全部筹码，否则很可能会被轰出去。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
