    "text": "When Clover Club Bouncer is engaged with you, it gets +1 fight and +1 evade for every 5 resources you have.\n[action] Spend 3 resources: Parley. Test [intellect] (2). If you succeed, disengage from Clover Club Bouncer and exhaust it. It does not ready during the next upkeep phase.",
