    "text": "[fast] Investigators at Agnes Baker's location spend 2 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Agnes Baker collects the memory at her location.\nForced - If Agnes Baker is defeated, proceed to (→R2).\nObjective - Collect more memories than Elspeth. If all 9 memories have been collected (by either party), advance.",
    "textZh": "[free]位于艾格尼丝·贝克所在地点的调查员共同花费2[per_investigator]个线索：艾格尼丝·贝克收集该地点的回忆。\n强制 - 如果艾格尼丝·贝克被击败：(→结局2)。\n目标 - 收集比艾尔佩斯更多的回忆。如果场上9个回忆全部被收集(被任意一方)，推进场景。",
