    "subname": "Hyperborean Sorceress",
    "subnameZh": "希波利尔法师",
    "text": "Alert. Patrol (nearest location with at least 1 memory). Retaliate.\nElspeth Baudin cannot be automatically evaded and gets -1 fight and -1 evade for each memory she has collected.\nForced - When Elspeth Baudin would be defeated: Instead, heal all damage from her, flip her over, and resolve the text on her other side.",
    "textZh": "警戒。巡逻(最近的有回忆的地点)。反击。\n艾尔佩斯·博丹不能被自动躲避，其每收集一个回忆，获得-1攻击和-1躲避。\n强制 - 如果艾尔佩斯·博丹将要被击败：改为治愈其所有伤害，然后将其翻面并结算另一面的文本。",
