    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Forced - When a non-weakness [[Cultist]] enemy would be defeated: Heal damage from that enemy until it has 1 remaining health, instead.\nForced - If Roland Banks is defeated: Proceed to (→R2)\n[action]: Resign. You don't want to miss your deadline, so you close the case.",
    "textZh": "强制 - 当[[异教徒]]敌人将要被击败时：改为治愈其伤害直到剩余1点生命。\n强制 - 如果罗兰·班克斯被击败：(→结局2)。\n[action]：撤退。你不想错过最后期限，草草结案。",
