    "text": "[fast] The investigators spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Flip over a facedown conspirator at your location and put it into play engaged with you.\n[fast] Spend 1 resource: Exhaust a [[Cultist]] enemy engaged with you (it remains engaged). Only Roland Banks may trigger this ability.]\nObjective - Parley with as many conspirators as you can. If 10 [[Cultist]] enemies are in the victory display, advance.",
    "textZh": "[free]调查员共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：将你所在地点面朝下的同谋翻面并与你交战。\n[free]花费1资源：横置一个与你交战的[[异教徒]]敌人(其依然与你交战)。只有罗兰·班克斯可以使用此能力。\n目标 - 尽可能揭露异教徒的阴谋。如果胜利区有10个[[异教徒]]敌人，推进。",
