    "subnameZh": "苍白下界",
    "text": "Jim Culver deck only. Permanent.\nEach attached spirit loses all printed traits and gains the [[Geist]] trait. When damage/horror would be placed on an attached spirit, it must be placed on Jim Culver, instead.\nForced – When your turn begins: Attach the top card of the spirit deck to The Beyond, as a spirit. If 4 or more spirits are attached, flip this card and resolve its text.",
    "textZh": "吉姆·卡尔弗牌库专用。永久。\n附属的灵魂失去其印刷特性并获得[[灵怪]]特性。当伤害和/或恐惧将要被分配到附属的灵魂上时，改为放置到吉姆·卡尔弗上。\n强制 - 你的回合开始时：将灵魂牌库顶的牌正面朝上附属到彼端上，作为一个灵魂。如果有4张或更多附属的灵魂，将彼端翻面并结算另一面的文本。",
