    "text": "Hunter. Prey – Jim Culver only.\nYou may fight or evade this enemy while it is attached to The Beyond (as if it were engaged with you). If you succeed, discard it. If you fail, spawn it engaged with you.\nForced – When you attach a spirit to The Beyond via its forced effect: Vengeful Shade attacks you (even if it is not at your location).",
    "textZh": "猎手。猎物 - 仅限吉姆·卡尔弗。\n当复仇魂灵被附属在彼端上时，你可以攻击和躲避它（如同与你交战）如果你检定成功，弃掉复仇魂灵。如果你检定失败，生成它并与你交战。\n强制 - 当你因为彼端的强制效果将卡牌附属到其上时：复仇魂灵攻击你(无论地点)。",
