    "text": "[fast] Either exhaust Jim’s Trumpet, or spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Choose an enemy to move once toward Jim Culver’s location.\n[fast] Spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Flip your location. (Group limit once per round per location.)\nObjective – If there are 4 copies of Unfinished Business in the victory display, advance.",
    "textZh": "[free]横置吉姆的小号，或共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：将一个敌人向吉姆·卡尔弗的所在地点移动一次。\n[free]共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：将你的所在地点翻面。(每个地点团队每轮仅限一次。)\n目标 - 如果胜利区有4张未了之事，推进场景。",
