    "text": "[reaction] After you deal 1 or more damage to an enemy: Add 1 [bless] token to the chaos bag. (Limit once per phase.)\n[fast] Before you reveal chaos tokens during an attack, remove 3 [bless] tokens from the chaos bag: This attack deals +1 damage. (Limit once per round.)\n[elder_sign] effect: +1 for each [bless] token in the chaos bag.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]在你对敌人造成1点或更多伤害时：在混乱袋中加入1个[bless]标记。(每阶段仅限一次。)\n[free]在一次攻击中揭示混乱标记之前，从混乱袋中移除3个[bless]标记：本次攻击获得+1伤害。(每轮仅限一次。)\n[elder_sign]效果：混乱袋中每有一个[bless]标记，+1。",
