    "availability": "strict",
    "availabilityScope": "scenario-only",
    "backFlavor": "Your house continues to change before your very eyes. The walls have decayed, and the ground in many rooms has turned to dirt. It is almost as if you have been transported somewhere else entirely, although every now and again you recognize elements of your former home.",
    "backFlavorZh": "你的房屋在你眼前持续变换着模样。墙壁已腐败，不少房间的地板化作了泥土。虽然时不时能认出自宅的痕迹，你仍感觉自己仿佛被传送到了截然不同的处所。",
    "backName": "A Lapse in Time",
    "backNameZh": "时间崩坏",
    "backText": "The lead investigator must decide (choose one): Either each investigator discards 1 card at random from his or her hand, or the lead investigator takes 2 horror.",
    "backTextZh": "调查员队长必须决定(选择一项)：每位调查员随机从其手中弃掉一张卡牌，或者调查员队长受到2点恐惧。",
    "backimagesrc": "/bundles/cards/01105b.png",
    "code": "01105",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doom": 3,
    "doubleSided": true,
    "effectStatus": "verified",
