    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "\"Umôrdhoth... Umôrdhoth... Umôrdhoth...\"\nThe chanting builds in intensity, echoing into the cold air of the night. The sparse clouds in the sky coalesce above the Arkham woods, blotting out the faint light of the stars.",
    "flavorZh": "“乌默尔多斯……乌默尔多斯……乌默尔多斯……”\n吟唱声越发响亮，在夜间寒冷的空气中回荡。夜空中仅有的些许云朵都聚集在了阿卡姆密林的上空，遮盖了群星的微光。",
