    "text": "[action] Spend 1 clue: Discard the top 5 cards of the encounter deck (top 10 instead if there is only 1 player in the game).\nForced - If you discard \"Jazz\" Mulligan for any reason, resolve his revelation effect.\nObjective - When you take control of \"Jazz\" Mulligan, advance.",
    "textZh": "[action]花费1个线索：弃掉遭遇牌库顶5张卡牌(单人游戏则改为弃掉遭遇牌库顶10张卡牌)。\n强制-如果你以任何方式弃掉了“爵士”马利根，结算其显现效果。\n目标-在你控制“爵士”马利根时，推进。",
