    "backNameZh": "钥与门",
    "backText": "Revelation - Spawn the set-aside Yog-Sothoth enemy at The Edge of the Universe. If The Edge of the Universe is not in play, spawn it in Another Dimension, instead. Advance to agenda 4a.",
    "backTextZh": "显现 - 将放在一边的犹格·索托斯敌人生成在宇宙的边缘。如果宇宙的边缘不在场上，改为将其生成在另一个次元。推进到密谋4a。",
