    "subnameZh": "士兵",
    "text": "You begin the game with Sophie (In Loving Memory) in play.\n[reaction] After damage is placed on a card you control: Draw 1 card. (Limit once per phase.)\n[elder_sign] effect: +1 for each damage on Mark Harrigan.",
    "textZh": "你开始游戏时把索菲(深切的思念)放置入场。\n[reaction]有伤害放置到你控制的卡牌上后：抽取1张卡牌。(每阶段仅限一次)。\n[elder_sign]效果：马克·哈里根身上每有一点伤害，+1。",
