    "text": "Forced - When you would draw your opening hand: Draw 13 cards, instead. Choose up to 5 events to place beneath this card and keep 8 cards as your opening hand. Discard the rest. (You cannot mulligan.)\n[action]: Choose an event beneath this card and draw it. Does not provoke attacks of opportunity.\n[elder_sign] effect: +3. You may choose an event beneath this card and draw it.",
    "textZh": "强制 - 在你将要抽取起始手牌时：改为抽取13张卡牌。选择最多5张事件放在本卡牌底下，并保留8张卡牌作为你的起始手牌。弃掉其余卡牌。(你不能重调。)\n[action]：选择并抽取本卡牌底下的一张事件。不会触发趁乱攻击。\n[elder_sign]效果：+3。你可以选择并抽取本卡牌底下的一张事件。",
