    "text": "[reaction] After you defeat an enemy: Play an asset from your discard pile (paying its cost). (Limit once per round.)\n[elder_sign] effect: +2. If this test is successful, return 1 card from your discard pile to your hand.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]在你击败敌人后：从你的弃牌堆(支付其费用)打出一张支援。(每轮仅限一次。)\n[elder_sign]效果：+2。如果本次检定成功，将你弃牌堆中的1张卡牌返回你的手牌。",
