    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull]: Reveal another token. If you fail, place 1 doom on the [[Possessed]] enemy in play with the most remaining health.\n[cultist]: -3. Place 1 of your clues on your location.\n[tablet]: -4. Take 1 horror.\n[elder_thing]: -X. X is the shroud value of your location. If you fail, take 1 damage.",
