    "encounterPosition": 7,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "\"This building is very old, and filled with all manner of secret passageways,\" Mr. Peabody explains. \"Perhaps one of them will lead to this library you’re looking for.\"",
    "flavorZh": "“这幢建筑年代久远，这里藏着各种秘密通道。”皮博迪先生解释说，“也许哪一条就通往你要找的这间图书馆。”",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "illustrator": "Yoann Boissonnet",
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/03126.png",
