    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 4,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Ignore the text on the unrevealed side of Arkham Asylum locations.\nGarden gains: \"[action] If there is no ready enemy in the Garden: Resign. Finally, a way out!\"\nObjective - If each undefeated investigator has resigned, advance.",
    "textZh": "忽略阿卡姆疯人院地点未揭示面上的文字。\n花园获得：“[action]如果花园没有处于重整状态的敌人：撤退。终于，找到出口了！”\n目标 - 如果所有未被击败的调查员都撤退，推进场景。",
