    "encounterPosition": 4,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "On the evening of your third night in Paris, a desperate resolve stirs within you. This cat and mouse game cannot go on any longer. One way or another, this night will end it. ",
    "flavorZh": "这是你在巴黎的第三晚了，你暗自下定决心，这场猫抓老鼠的游戏不能再继续下去了。无论如何，今晚必见分晓。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "illustrator": "Dleoblack",
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/03203.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "The Third Night",
    "nameZh": "第三夜",
    "originalCode": "03203",
    "pack": "apot",
    "packName": "A Phantom of Truth",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 203,
    "provenanceId": "03203",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "While you have more Conviction than Doubt, this agenda gains:\n\"When checking the doom threshold, doom on cards other than this agenda subtract from the total doom in play instead of adding to it.\"",
    "textZh": "你的确信高于疑惑时，本密谋获得：\n“在检查毁灭阈值时，改为从场上毁灭标记总数中减去本密谋以外的其他卡牌上的毁灭标记数，而不是加上。”",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
