    "backName": "True Evil",
    "backNameZh": "邪恶本尊",
    "backText": "If you spent clues to advance:\nThe organ you heard earlier continues to haunt you. No matter where you are, the torturous chords play over and over in your head. The sensation that you are being watched tugs at your mind.\nSpawn the set-aside The Organist enemy at the location farthest from all investigators, (Hopeless, I Defied Him) side face-up. Advance to Act 2a - Stalked by Shadows.\nOtherwise:\nYou nearly bump into a tall man, his coat and hat as black as his skin is pale. He gives you a look of hatred, as intense and as deadly as you have ever seen. You recoil at the mere sight of him, and shadows gather around his feet as he marches toward you.\nEach investigator takes 2 horror.\nSpawn the set-aside The Organist enemy at the lead investigator's location, (Hopeless, I Defied Him) side face-up. Advance to Act 2a - Stalked by Shadows.",
    "backTextZh": "如果你花费线索以推进场景：\n你之前听到的风琴演奏始终萦绕在你的心头。无论你走到哪里，这和弦声在你脑中反复演奏，折磨着你。你始终感觉有人监视着自己。\n将放在一边的风琴手敌人生成在离所有调查员最远的的地点，(藐视绝望)面朝上。推进到场景2a“暗影缠身”。\n否则：\n你差点撞上一个高高的男子，他漆黑的外套和帽子与他苍白的肤色形成了鲜明的对照。他恶狠狠地看了你一眼，那是你见过最可怕，最致命的眼神。光是看到他就让你浑身发颤，他朝你步步逼近时，暗影都聚集到了他的脚下。\n每位调查员受到2点恐惧。\n将放在一边的风琴手敌人生成在调查员队长所在地点，(藐视绝望)面朝上。推进到场景2a“暗影缠身”。",
