    "text": "Ignore the Forced ability on Blocked Passage.\nObjective - If each undefeated investigator is at Blocked Passage, advance.",
    "textZh": "忽略堵塞通道上的强制能力。\n目标 - 如果每位没有被击败的调查员都在堵塞通道，推进场景。",
