    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull]: -X. X is the amount of horror on you.\n[cultist]: Reveal another token. If you fail, take 2 horror.\n[tablet]: -5. If you fail and Hastur is in play, place 1 clue on your location (from the token bank).\n[elder_thing]: -5. If this token is revealed during an attack or evasion attempt against a [[Monster]] or [[Ancient One]] enemy, lose 1 action.",
    "backTextZh": "困难/专家\n[skull]：-X。X为你身上的恐惧数量。\n[cultist]：揭示另一个标记。如果你检定失败，受到2点恐惧。\n[tablet]：-5。如果你检定失败且哈斯塔在场，在你所在地点放置1个线索(从供应堆拿取)。\n[elder_thing]：-5。如果攻击或尝试躲避[[怪物]]或[[古神]]敌人期间揭示本标记，失去1个行动。",
