    "permanent": false,
    "position": 317,
    "provenanceId": "03317",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Hastur cannot be defeated.\nForced - If there is at least 3 [per_investigator] damage on Hastur: Advance this agenda.",
    "textZh": "哈斯塔不能被击败。\n强制 -如果哈斯塔上有至少3[per_investigator]伤害：推进本密谋。",
