    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "Black stars sing in the reflection of the water, their melody impossible and uncanny. Yet somehow, you remember the tune. It is as though your earliest living memory has returned to you. You hum at first, ripples appearing along the water's surface as your volume increases. The lyrics return to you, and you join in the stars' singing, your voice echoing across the twisted realm.",
    "flavorZh": "黑星倒映在水中，它们的歌声中透出诡秘而绝无可能的旋律。然而，你却记得这个曲调。就好像你幼年的回忆涌回了你的脑海。你开始哼唱，随着歌声渐响，水面泛起了层层涟漪。这时你想起了歌词，你与众片黑星一同歌唱，你们的歌声在这扭曲的世界里荡漾。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/03325b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "linkedCardCode": "03325",
    "linkedToCode": "03325",
    "linkedToName": "Shores of Hali",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Songs That the Hyades Shall Sing",
    "nameZh": "毕宿奇歌初响",
    "originalCode": "03325b",
    "pack": "dca",
    "packName": "Dim Carcosa",
    "permanent": false,
