    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "On every side of me stretched a bleak and desolate expanse of plain, covered with a tall overgrowth of sere grass, which rustled and whistled in the autumn wind...\n - Ambrose Bierce, \"An Inhabitant of Carcosa\"",
    "flavorZh": "无论我放眼何处，到处都是荒凉而孤寂的平原。地面上覆盖着异常高大的枯草，随着秋风瑟瑟作响……安布罗斯·比尔斯，《一个卡尔克萨的居民》",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "illustrator": "Lukasz Jaskolski",
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/03326c.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Bleak Plains",
