    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "verified",
    "encounterCode": "dim_carcosa",
    "encounterName": "Dim Carcosa",
    "encounterPosition": 13,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "You encounter a man among the ruins of the city, haggard and tired. \"Good stranger,\" he says, \"I am ill and lost. Direct me, I beseech you, to Carcosa.\" You tell him that you believe you are in the realm of Carcosa right now, and he falls to his knees in despair. \"No... But that cannot be!\"\nThe man cries and raves, telling you more of the ancient and famous city. Though his words have little meaning to you, deep within your mind, you begin to understand.",
    "flavorZh": "你在城市的废墟中遇到了一个男子，他面容憔悴，疲惫不堪。“你好，陌生人。”他说，“我生了病，还迷了路。我恳求您，指引我吧，指引我去卡尔克萨。”你告诉他，你觉得你们现在就在卡尔克萨，他跪倒在地，陷入了绝望：“不……但这不可能！”\n男子声带哭腔，咆哮着告诉了你许多有关这座古老而著名城市的往事。虽然他的话对你没有什么意义，但在你内心深处，你开始理解了。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/03327b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "linkedCardCode": "03327a",
