    "encounterCode": "dim_carcosa",
    "encounterName": "Dim Carcosa",
    "encounterPosition": 17,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "You turn a corner, and before you lies a wide, grand street. A great parade marches by, in honor of the King. Banners of tattered yellow cloth sway in the wind.\nThen it strikes you: you remember this scene from the play. You wrack your mind trying to remember what is supposed to happen next. The parade is interrupted and the entourage is attacked...",
    "flavorZh": "你转过一个街角，眼前是一条宽大的街道。街上在以王的名义举行一场盛大的游行。褴褛的黄色旗帜在风中摇摆。\n你突然想了起来：你记得戏剧中出现过这一幕。你绞尽脑汁回忆接下来会发生什么事情。游行突然被打断了，游行队伍惨遭攻击……",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/03328d.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "linkedCardCode": "03328c",
    "linkedToCode": "03328c",
    "linkedToName": "Dim Streets",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "The King's Parade",
    "nameZh": "皇家游行",
    "originalCode": "03328d",
    "pack": "dca",
    "packName": "Dim Carcosa",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 328,
    "provenanceId": "03328d",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Test [combat] (2). If you succeed, exhaust Hastur and disengage him from all investigators.\nRemove this card from the game, and replace it with another set-aside copy of Dim Streets (move all investigators, enemies, and attachments from this location to the new copy of Dim Streets). Add clues to that copy of Dim Streets until it has clues on it equal to its clue value.",
    "textZh": "检定[combat](2)。如果你检定成功，横置哈斯塔，且他与所有调查员解除交战。\n将本卡牌从游戏中移除，并用另一张放在一边的幽暗街道替换它(将本地点上的所有调查员、敌人和附属移动到新的幽暗街道上)。在该幽暗街道上增加线索，直到其拥有的线索数量等于其线索值。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
