    "encounterName": "Dim Carcosa",
    "encounterPosition": 22,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "I pray God will curse the writer, as the writer has cursed the world with this beautiful, stupendous creation, terrible in its simplicity, irresistible in its truth...\n - Robert W. Chambers, \"The Repairer of Reputations,\" <u>The King in Yellow</u>",
    "flavorZh": "我祈求上帝诅咒这个作者，就如同这个作者诅咒这个世界，这鸿篇巨制的诅咒是那么美丽，简朴得令人害怕，真切得让人难以抗拒……罗伯特·W·钱伯斯，“名誉修复师”，《黄衣之王》",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "illustrator": "Alexandr Elichev",
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/03331.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Palace of the King",
    "nameZh": "王之宫殿",
    "originalCode": "03331",
    "pack": "dca",
