    "provenanceId": "03331b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Remember that you \"know the secret.\"\nFlip this card back over. For the remainder of the game, it cannot be flipped over again.",
    "textZh": "记住你“知道了秘密”。\n将本卡牌翻面。直到游戏结束，它不能再次翻面。",
