    "subname": "The King in Yellow",
    "subnameZh": "黄衣之王",
    "text": "Cannot be damaged except by story card effects.\nForced - At the beginning of the enemy phase, if Hastur is ready: Hastur attacks each investigator, in player order (regardless of their location). If Hastur's attack deals you horror in excess of your sanity, you take 1 damage, as well.\n[action]: Test [willpower] (X), where X is Hastur's fight value. If you succeed, exhaust Hastur. Any investigator may trigger this action.",
    "textZh": "除因剧情卡牌效果外不能受到伤害。\n强制 - 当敌军阶段开始时，如果哈斯塔处于重整状态：哈斯塔按玩家顺序攻击场上每位调查员(无视他们的所在地点)。如果哈斯塔的攻击造成的恐惧超出你的神智值，你还受到1点伤害。\n[action]：检定[willpower](X)，其中X为哈斯塔的攻击值。如果你检定成功，横置哈斯塔。任意调查员均可以触发本行动。",
