    "subname": "The Expedition Leader",
    "subnameZh": "探险队长",
    "text": "[reaction] After your turn begins: Play an [[Ally]] asset, reducing its cost by 1.\n[elder_sign] effect: +2. Search the top 3 cards of your deck for an [[Ally]] asset and draw it. Shuffle your deck.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]在你的回合开始后：打出一张[[盟友]]支援卡牌，其费用减1。\n[elder_sign]效果：+2。查找你牌库顶3张卡牌，找出一张[[盟友]]支援卡牌并将其抽取。混洗你的牌库。",
