    "text": "You may take an additional action during your turn, which can only be used to evade.\n[elder_sign] effect: +1 for each exhausted enemy in play. If you succeed by 2 or more, you may discover 1 clue at your location.",
    "textZh": "你可以在自己回合期间进行额外一个行动，该行动只能用于躲避。\n[elder_sign]效果：场上每有一个处于横置状态的敌人，+1。如果你检定成功且超过难度至少2点，你可以发现你所在地点的1个线索。",
