    "subnameZh": "牧师",
    "text": "[reaction] When an investigator reveals an [auto_fail] chaos token: Cancel that token and treat it as an [elder_sign] token, instead. (Limit once per game.)\n[elder_sign] effect: You automatically succeed. After this test ends, either (choose one):\n - Draw 1 card and gain 1 resource.\n - If it is your turn, you may take an additional action this turn.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]在一位调查员揭示[auto_fail]混乱标记时：取消该标记并改为将其视作[elder_sign]标记。(每场游戏仅限一次。)\n[elder_sign]效果：你检定自动成功。在本次检定结束后，选择一项：\n- 抽取1张卡牌并获得1资源。\n- 如果此时是你的回合，你本回合可以进行额外一次行动。",
