    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Each Eztli Guardian enemy cannot attack or be attacked. Ignore the effects of each Arrows from the Trees treachery.\nObjective - Only investigators at the Ruins of Eztli can spend the requisite number of clues, as a group, to advance.",
    "textZh": "每个埃兹特里的守卫者敌人不能攻击，也不能被攻击。忽略每个林中暗箭诡计的效果。\n目标 - 只有在埃兹特里的遗迹的调查员能够共同花费所需数量的线索以推进场景。",
