    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[action]: Explore. Draw the top card of the exploration deck. If it is a connecting location, put it into play and move to it.\nObjective - Only investigators in the Chamber of Time may spend the requisite number of clues, as a group, to advance.",
    "textZh": "[action]：探索。抽取探索牌库顶的一张卡牌。如果该卡牌是一个连接地点，将其放置入场，并移动到该地点。\n目标 - 只有在时间石室的调查员可以共同花费所需数量的线索以推进场景。",
