    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull] : -X. X is the total number of doom in play.\n[cultist]: -2. If you do not succeed by at least 2, take 1 direct damage.\n[tablet]: -2. If you do not succeed by at least 2, place 1 doom on each [[cultist]] enemy.\n[elder_thing]: -3. If you fail, lose 1 of your clues.",
    "backTextZh": "困难 /专家\n[skull]：-X。X为场上的毁灭标记总数。\n[cultist]：-2。如果你检定失败，或成功但没有超过难度至少2点，受到1点直接伤害。\n[tablet]：-2。如果你检定失败，或成功但没有超过难度至少2点，在每个[[异教徒]]敌人上放置1个毁灭标记。\n[elder_thing]：-3。如果你检定失败，失去1个线索。",
