    "subnameZh": "历史理论家",
    "text": "Revelation - Put Harlan Earnstone into play in Easttown.\n[action] Discard the top 3 cards of your deck: Parley. You try to snap Earnstone out of his daze. Test [willpower] (4). If you succeed, place 1 clue on him (from the token pool).",
    "textZh": "显现 - 将哈伦·恩斯通放置入场，放在东城区。\n[action]弃掉你牌库顶3张卡牌：谈判。你试图让恩斯通恢复清醒。检定[willpower](4)。如果你检定成功，在其上放置1个线索(从供应堆拿取)。",
