    "pack": "tof",
    "packName": "Threads of Fate",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 119,
    "provenanceId": "04119",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Objective - Only investigators in the Eztli Exhibit can spend the requisite number of clues, as a group, to advance.",
    "textZh": "目标 - 只有在埃及特里展厅的调查员能够共同花费所需数量的线索以推进场景。",
