    "text": "Revelation - Put Train Tracks into play. Attach the set-aside Alejandro Vela to Train Tracks. Advance to Act 3c - \"Alejandro's Prison.\"\nNorthside is connected to Train Tracks.\n[action] Spend 1 clue: Draw 4 cards. (Limit once per game.)",
