    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[action] If there are no clues on your location: Explore. Draw the top card of the exploration deck. If it is a connecting location, put it into play and move to it.\nForced - When this agenda advances: Do not remove doom from each location in play.",
    "textZh": "[action]如果你所在地点没有线索：探索。抽取探索牌库顶的一张卡牌。如果该卡牌是一个连接地点，将其放置入场，并移动到该地点。\n强制 - 在本密谋推进时：不要从场上任何地点移除毁灭标记。",
