    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Restricted Access",
    "nameZh": "禁止通行",
    "originalCode": "04242",
    "pack": "tcoa",
    "packName": "The City of Archives",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 242,
    "provenanceId": "04242",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Objective - If three of the following are true, you must advance:\n- An investigator \"found the process.\"\n- An investigator \"dissected an organ.\"\n- An investigator \"interviewed a subject.\"\n- An investigator \"realized what year it is.\"\n- An investigator \"activated the device.\"\n- An investigator controls The Custodian.",
    "textZh": "目标 - 如果以下情况中，有三种情况已发生，你必须推进场景：\n- 有调查员“找到了归位程式”。\n- 有调查员“解剖了一个器官”。\n- 有调查员“进行了一次会谈”。\n- 有调查员“发现了现在的年份”。\n- 有调查员“启动了设备”。\n- 有调查员控制了看管人。",
    "traits": [],
