    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[action]: Search your deck or discard pile for the Relic of Ages and add it to your hand. Shuffle your deck.\n[action] If the Relic of Ages is attached to your location and there are no clues on that location: Take control of the Relic of Ages.\nObjective - If an investigator controls the Relic of Ages, advance.",
    "textZh": "[action]：查找你的牌库和弃牌堆，找出古代遗物并将它加入你的手牌。混洗你的牌库。\n[action]如果古代遗物附属到你所在地，且该地点上没有线索：控制古代遗物。\n目标 - 如果有调查员控制古代遗物，推进场景。",
