    "subnameZh": "解开时间线",
    "text": "Forced - After you move from Nexus of N'kai to an [[Otherworld]] location, or vice versa: Take 1 horror for each clue on that [[Otherworld]] location.\n[action]: Explore. Draw the top card of the exploration deck. If it is a connecting location, put it into play and move to it. Do not take horror from the above Forced ability when moving via this effect.",
    "textZh": "强制 - 在你从恩凯联结点移动到一个[[异界]]地点，或从一个[[异界]]地点移动到恩凯联结点后：该[[异界]]地点上每有一个线索，受到1点恐惧。\n[action]：探索。抽取探索牌库顶的一张卡牌。如果该卡牌是一个连接地点，将其放置入场，并移动到该地点。在通过此效果移动时，不从上述强制能力受到恐惧。",
