    "subnameZh": "私家侦探",
    "text": "Forced - When the investigation phase begins: Reveal the top card of your hunch deck. Until the end of the phase, you may play that card as if it were in your hand, at -2 cost. If it is still revealed at the end of the phase, shuffle it back into your hunch deck.\n[elder_sign] effect: +1. You may move an [[Insight]] event from your discard pile to the bottom of your hunch deck.",
    "textZh": "强制 - 在调查阶段开始时：揭示你直觉牌库顶1张卡牌。直到本阶段结束，你可以以-2费用打出该卡牌，如同它是你的手牌。如果当本阶段结束时该卡牌未被打出，将其洗回你的直觉牌库。\n[elder_sign]效果：+1。你可以将你弃牌堆的一张[[洞察]]事件移动到你的直觉牌库底。",
