    "text": "Anytime you gain 1 or more resources from a card effect, place them on Family Inheritance instead of in your resource pool.\n[elder_sign] effect: +0. You may spend 2 resources to automatically succeed, instead.",
    "textZh": "你每次从卡牌效果获得资源，不将其放在资源池，改为放在家族遗产上。\n[elder_sign]效果：+0。你可以花费2资源以改为自动成功。",
