    "subname": "The Redeemed Cultist",
    "subnameZh": "洗心革面的异教徒",
    "text": "Diana Stanley gets +1 [willpower] for each card beneath her.\n[reaction] After a card you own cancels or ignores a card effect or game effect, if there are fewer than 5 cards beneath Diana Stanley: Place that card facedown beneath her. Draw 1 card and gain 1 resource. (Limit once per phase.)\n[elder_sign] effect: +2. You may choose a card beneath Diana Stanley and add it to your hand.",
    "textZh": "黛安娜·史丹利底下每有一张卡牌，其得到+1[willpower]。\n[reaction]你拥有的一张卡牌取消或忽略卡牌效果或游戏效果后，如果黛安娜·史丹利底下的卡牌数量少于5张：将该卡牌正面朝下放在她底下。抽取1张卡牌并获得1资源。(每阶段仅限一次。)\n[elder_sign]效果：+2。你可以选择黛安娜·史丹利底下的一张卡牌加入手牌。",
    "traits": [
      "Cultist",
      "Silver Twilight"
    ],
