    "text": "[reaction] After you evade an enemy: Either deal 1 damage to that enemy, or move to a connecting location. (Limit once per round.)\n[elder_sign] effect: +2. Until the end of the round, ignore the limit on the above [reaction] ability.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]在你躲避一个敌人后：对该敌人造成1点伤害，或移动到一个连接地点。(每轮仅限一次。)\n[elder_sign]效果：+2。直到本轮结束，忽略以上[reaction]能力的限制。",
