    "subnameZh": "演艺人士",
    "text": "While you have 1 or more doom among cards you control, you may take an additional action during your turn, which can only be used to play [[Spell]] cards or activate [[Spell]] [action] abilities.\n[elder_sign] effect: +1. You may add 1 doom to or remove 1 doom from a card you control.",
    "textZh": "你控制的卡牌上有至少1个毁灭标记时，你可以在自己的回合期间进行一个额外行动，但该额外行动只能用于打出[[法术]]卡牌或激活[[法术]][action]能力。\n[elder_sign]效果：+1。你可以在你控制的一张卡牌上增加或移除1个毁灭标记。",
