    "text": "Easy / Standard\n[skull]: -3. If you fail and this is an attack or evasion attempt, resolve each haunted ability on your location.",
    "textZh": "简单/普通\n[skull]：-3。如果你检定失败且本次检定为攻击或躲避尝试，结算你所在地点的每个闹鬼能力。",
