    "stage": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Forced - After doom is placed on any card: Each investigator must either take 1 damage or 1 horror (2 damage or 2 horror instead if there is 5 or more doom in play).\nForced - When any investigator is defeated, that investigator must advance this agenda. Do not remove any doom from this agenda when it advances.",
    "textZh": "强制 - 在任何卡牌上放置了毁灭标记后：每位调查员必须受到1点伤害或1点恐惧(如果场上有至少5个毁灭标记，改为受到2点伤害或2点恐惧)。\n强制 - 在任何调查员被击败时，该调查员必须推进此密谋。在本密谋推进时，不要移除其上任何毁灭标记。",
