    "encounterPosition": 3,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "Something terrible has invaded the home of Josef Meiger. In the moments that follow, you scramble to survive.",
    "flavorZh": "有恐怖之物侵入了约瑟夫·梅吉尔的宅邸。在接下来的时间里你挣扎求生。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
