    "text": "Forced - When an investigator is eliminated: Place each of that investigator's clues on this act instead of his or her location.\nObjective - Discover as many clues as you can before your inevitable demise.",
    "textZh": "强制 - 在有调查员退场时：改为将该调查员的每个线索放在本场景上，而不是放在所在地点。\n目标 - 在你不可避免的末日来临之前，发现尽可能多的线索。",
