    "text": "[fast] During a skill test you are performing, spend 2 resources: Reduce the difficulty of this test by 1. (Limit once per round.)\n[elder_sign] effect: +1. Gain 2 resources.",
    "textZh": "[free]在你执行的技能检定期间，花费2资源：本次检定难度降低1点。(每轮仅限一次。)\n[elder_sign]效果：+1。获得2资源。",
