    "packName": "The Circle Undone",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 67,
    "provenanceId": "05067",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Each [[Silver Twilight]] enemy gains Victory 0, and counts as an investigator for the purpose of determining where hunter enemies move during the enemy phase.\nForced - After the 'hunter enemies move' step of the enemy phase: Each ready [[Spectral]] enemy deals its damage value to each [[Humanoid]] enemy at its location.",
    "textZh": "每个[[银暮秘社]]敌人获得胜利0，且在敌军阶段如要决定猎手敌人的移动方向，将其视为调查员。\n强制 - 在敌军阶段的“猎手敌人移动”步骤后：所有重整状态的[[幽灵]]敌人对同一地点的每个[[类人]]敌人造成等于自己伤害值的伤害。",
