    "text": "Retaliate.\n[action] If no other [[Silver Twilight]] enemy has doom on it: Parley. Test [intellect] (4) to convince Josef that this is not your doing. If you fail, Josef Meiger attacks you. If you succeed, flip this card over and resolve its text.",
