    "encounterCode": "at_deaths_doorstep",
    "encounterName": "At Death's Doorstep",
    "encounterPosition": 21,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "Josef lowers his weapon and studies you for a moment. \"Perhaps you are telling the truth. But if that is true…\" He ponders the situation, then holsters his weapon and checks his pocket watch. \"Regardless, we have little time. If my estimate is correct, the anomaly will recede soon. We must be out of the manor before that occurs, or we'll all be trapped here.\"\nYou ask how he knows all of this, but he merely shakes his head. \"This is not the time. Ask again if we make it out of here alive.\"",
    "flavorZh": "约瑟夫放下手里的武器，仔细思考你说的话。“或许你说的是真的。但这如果是真的……”他认真考虑这一情况，随后将自己的武器收回枪套，查看怀表，“无论如何，我们时间有限。如果我估算无误，这异象很快就会消失。我们必须赶在那之前离开庄园，否则就要被困在这儿了。”\n你问他为什么知道这一切，但他只是摇摇头：“现在不是好时机。要是我们活着离开这儿你再问吧。”",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/05085b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
