    "linkedToCode": "05085",
    "linkedToName": "Josef Meiger",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Josef's Plan",
    "nameZh": "约瑟夫的计划",
    "originalCode": "05085b",
    "pack": "tcu",
    "packName": "The Circle Undone",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 85,
    "provenanceId": "05085b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Remove all doom from this card.\nFor the remainder of the game, doom cannot be placed on [[Silver Twilight]] enemies, and Josef Meiger gains aloof.\nFlip this card back to its enemy side and disengage it from all investigators.",
    "textZh": "移除本卡牌上的所有毁灭标记。\n在本局游戏的剩余时间里，毁灭标记不能被放在[[银暮秘社]]敌人上，约瑟夫·梅吉尔获得冷漠。\n将本卡牌翻回敌人面，并与所有调查员解除交战状态。",
