  "05127": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavor": "The ancient crone lets out a banshee's wail as you dismantle her unholy ritual. The room unfurls through space-time, the cramped, slanted walls unfolding to reveal the oblivion beyond. The creature who was once Keziah Mason croaks a loathsome curse as her shapeless form is pulled into the void. Bit by bit, the wood-paneled flooring below your feet breaks apart. Then you are ripped - the pull from the stars - a muddy alleyway - the flute in the woods - the roaring abyss - the gaze of the watcher - The Tower - a green hillside - the black vortex - the screams of the accused - the piper - three arrows - a sacrifice - a ringing bell - an ascension - and you emerge from the anomaly, crashing painfully onto the floor.",
    "backFlavorZh": "就在你解除老妇的渎神仪式时，她发出一声女妖般的哀嚎。这个房间在时空中展开，狭窄而倾斜的四壁伸展开去，显现出彼端的深渊。曾经是凯夏·梅森的怪物扭曲的身体被拖入虚空，用嘶哑的嗓音恶毒地诅咒着。你脚下的木地板一点一点地分崩离析。然后你被扯落——群星的引力——泥泞的小巷——树林里的长笛——怒号的深渊——看守人的凝视——“高塔”——翠绿山坡——黑色漩涡——受刑者的尖叫——吹笛手——三根箭矢——献祭——铃声——飞升——然后你摆脱了这异象，痛苦地坠在地上。",
    "backName": "Ritual Averted",
    "backNameZh": "仪式已阻止",
    "backText": "(→R2)",
    "backTextZh": "(→结局2)",
    "backimagesrc": "/bundles/cards/05127b.png",
    "code": "05127",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": true,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "the_secret_name",
    "encounterName": "The Secret Name",
    "encounterPosition": 8,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "You part the seams of space-time and arrive at your destination. It is the same cramped attic, but in a different time. The room is dark save for a violet glow emanating from the far edge, where the floor falls into oblivion. From out of the abyss, the ancient crone and her familiar emerge...",
    "flavorZh": "你分开了时空，到达了你的目的地。还是那个狭窄的阁楼，但是处在不同的时间。房间一片黑暗，被一圈紫色光芒所包围，光源来自于地面沉入深渊的远处。从深渊里，年迈的老妇和她的魔宠出现了……",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "illustrator": "Yoann Boissonnet",
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/05127.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Stopping the Ritual",
    "nameZh": "阻止仪式",
    "originalCode": "05127",
    "pack": "tsn",
    "packName": "The Secret Name",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 127,
    "provenanceId": "05127",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Nahab cannot leave the Site of the Sacrifice.\nForced - When Nahab is defeated: Instead of discarding her, heal all damage from her, disengage her from all investigators, and exhaust her. She does not ready during the upkeep phase this round.\nObjective - If there is no doom on Nahab, advance.",
    "textZh": "那赫卜不能离开献祭场所。\n强制 - 在那赫卜被击败时：不将其弃掉，改为治愈其所有伤害，将其与所有调查员解除交战状态并将其横置。本轮补给阶段期间其不重整。\n目标 - 如果那赫卜上没有毁灭标记，推进场景。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "act",
    "typeName": "Act",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/05127"
  },
