    "text": "[reaction] After you successfully investigate Keziah's Room: Instead of discovering clues, put the top card of the Unknown Places deck into play, unrevealed. Then, you may move to that location.\nHaunted - Discard cards from the top of the encounter deck until a [[Hex]] card is discarded. Draw that card.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]在你成功调查凯夏的房间后：不发现线索，改为将未知地点牌库顶的1张卡牌以未揭示面朝上放置入场。然后，你可以移动到该地点。\n闹鬼 - 从遭遇牌库顶弃牌，直到弃到一张[[巫术]]卡牌。抽取该卡牌。",
