    "encounterCode": "the_wages_of_sin",
    "encounterName": "The Wages of Sin",
    "encounterPosition": 7,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "Few creatures call the wooded fields surrounding Hangman's Hill home. Patches of dark, pointed witchweed blossoms have choked out all other flora, and wisps of thin grey fog seep through the air, like long fingers reaching out for something to grasp.",
    "flavorZh": "很少人会以绞刑者山丘附近的林地为家。一丛丛尖锐的黑色独脚金排挤着其他的植物，空气中弥漫着一缕灰色的浓雾，像是颀长的手指，伸手想要抓住什么东西。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
