    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Heretic gets +2 [per_investigator] health.\nWhile Heretic is at a non-[[Spectral]] location, it gains aloof and cannot be engaged or damaged.\n[fast] Spend 1 clue: Parley. Look at Heretic's other side (without resolving its text).\nForced - After Heretic is defeated: Flip it over and resolve the text on its other side.",
    "textZh": "异端者得到+2[per_investigator]生命值。\n异端者位于非[[幽灵]]地点时，其获得冷漠且不能被交战也不能受到伤害。\n[free]花费1个线索：谈判。查看异端者的另一面(不要结算其文字)。\n强制 - 异端者被击败后：将其翻面并结算另一面的文本。",
