    "provenanceId": "05178d",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "The charred ghost thrashes and howls in agony, as though in a constant state of torment. You cannot ease its suffering, but perhaps you can bring it justice.\nKeep this card in your threat area (this side faceup). If you are eliminated, flip it over.\nForced - At the end of the round: You must either take 1 damage or flip this card back to its enemy side.\n[action] If you are at The Gallows and it has no clues on it: Test [willpower] or [agility] (4). If you succeed, the ghost is \"banished\" (resolve the text below).\nDo not read until this ghost is \"banished.\"\nThe fire spreads quickly, consuming the old wooden platform hungrily. The spirit's form twitches with a strange satisfaction.\nAdd this card to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "被烧焦的鬼魂彷佛经受着无尽的折磨，痛苦地捶打、嚎叫。你无法减轻她的痛苦，但或许你能为她伸张正义。\n将本卡牌保留在你的威胁区域(以本面朝上)。如果你退场，将其翻面。\n强制 - 当一轮结束时：你必须受到1点恐惧或将本卡牌翻回敌人面。\n[action]如果你位于绞刑架，且其上没有线索：检定[willpower]或[agility](4)。如果你检定成功，本幽灵被“驱除”(结算以下文本)。\n本幽灵被“驱除”之前，请勿阅读下文。\n火势迅速蔓延，饿极了似的吞噬了绞刑架那古老的木质平台。幽灵诡异地表达自己的心满意足，身躯抽动着。\n将本卡牌加入胜利牌区。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/05178d",
    "victory": 1
