    "provenanceId": "05178h",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "The wraith is mangled and corrupted nearly beyond recognition. Something has torn through its insides and ripped its soul to shreds.\nKeep this card in your threat area (this side faceup). If you are eliminated, flip it over.\nForced - At the end of the round: You must either choose and discard 2 cards from your hand or flip this card back to its enemy side.\n[action] If you are at Heretics' Graves and it has no clues on it: Test [willpower] or [combat] (4). If you succeed, the ghost is \"banished\" (resolve the text below).\nDo not read until this ghost is \"banished.\"\nDigging up the bones was hard work, but as the spirit peers into its open grave, you can see its humanoid shape clearly for the first time.\nAdd this card to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "这鬼魂支离破碎，几乎面目全非。什么东西从内部将他撕裂，还将魂魄撕作碎片。\n将该卡牌保留在你的威胁区域(以本面朝上)。如果你退场，将其翻面。\n强制 - 当一轮结束时：你必须选择并弃掉2张手牌或将本卡牌翻回敌人面。\n[action]如果你位于异端者的墓地，且其上没有线索：检定[willpower]或[combat](4)。如果你检定成功，本幽灵被“驱除”(结算以下文本)。\n本幽灵被“驱除”之前，请勿阅读下文。\n挖掘骨头不是一件易事，但当那鬼魂望向自己敞开的墓穴时，你这才清楚地看到了他的人形。\n将本卡牌加入胜利牌区。",
