    "permanent": false,
    "position": 178,
    "provenanceId": "05178l",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "The spiteful wraith does not relent. Your words cannot reach it, but perhaps you can lay it to rest by force.\nFlip this card back to its enemy side. It makes an immediate attack. The next time it is defeated, it is \"banished\" (resolve the text below).\nForced - If you looked at this side by resolving this Heretic's parley ability: Flip this card back to its enemy side. It makes an immediate attack. (Do not resolve any other text on this card.)\nDo not read until this ghost is \"banished.\"\nWith a final cry, the hellish spirit recoils upon itself and dissipates into thin air.\nAdd this card to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "恶鬼不会良心发现。你的言语没法打动她，但或许你可以用武力来让她安息。\n将本卡牌翻回敌人面。其立即进行一次攻击。下次击败本敌人时，其被“驱除”(结算以下文本)。\n强制 - 如果你通过结算本异端者的谈判能力查看本面：将本卡牌翻回敌人面。其立即进行一次攻击。(不要结算本卡牌上的其他任何文本。)\n本幽灵被“驱除”之前，请勿阅读下文。\n伴随着最后一声呐喊，那凶恶的鬼魂反噬自身，消失得无影无踪。\n将本卡牌加入胜利牌区。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/05178l",
    "victory": 1
