    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Peril.\nRevelation - You must either (choose one):\n- Choose an Unfinished Business card in play, flip it to its Heretic side, and place damage on it equal to half its health.\n- Discard cards from the top of the spectral encounter deck until a [[Geist]] enemy is discarded. Spawn that enemy engaged with you.",
    "textZh": "险境。\n显现 - 你必须(选择一项)：\n- 选择场上的一张未了之事卡牌，将其翻至异端者面，并在其上放置数量等于其生命值一半的伤害标记。\n- 从幽灵遭遇牌库顶弃掉卡牌，直到弃掉一个[[灵怪]]敌人。该敌人生成并与你交战。",
    "traits": [
      "Curse",
      "Spectral"
    ],
    "traitsZh": [
      "诅咒",
      "幽灵"
    ],
    "type": "treachery",
    "typeName": "Treachery",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/05185"
