    "text": "Uses (1 [per_investigator] locks). If there are no locks on The Council's Coffer, each investigator searches his or her deck or discard pile for any card and immediately plays it at no cost. Exile The Council's Coffer. (Max once per campaign.)\n[action] [action]: Test any skill (5). If you succeed, remove 1 lock. Any investigator at your location may activate this ability.\nCard design by The Council at Arkham Nights 2017.",
    "textZh": "使用(1[per_investigator]锁头)。如果委员会的保险箱上没有锁头，每位调查员查找自己的牌库或弃牌堆，找出任意一张卡牌并立即将其免费打出。放逐委员会的保险箱。(每个剧本最多一次。)\n[action][action]：检定任意一项技能(5)。如果你检定成功，移除1锁头。你所在地点的任何调查员均可以激活本能力。\n卡牌设计于阿卡姆之夜2017理事会。",
