    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "The \"device\" is nothing more than a locked puzzle box, just about large enough to hold a pair of shoes. The diagram on its surface depicts a broken pattern which can be manipulated to no apparent end, and there does not appear to be a keyhole of any kind.",
    "flavorZh": "那个“仪器”不过是个上了锁的机关盒，大小只够装下一双鞋子。它表面有着错乱的图形，图块可以无限扭转，而它表面没有任何的钥匙孔。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "illustrator": "A.M. Sartor",
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/05203.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "The Four Keys",
    "nameZh": "四把钥匙",
    "originalCode": "05203",
    "pack": "fgg",
    "packName": "For the Greater Good",
    "permanent": false,
