    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull]: -3. If this is a skill test during a circle action, reveal another token.\n[cultist]: -4. If you have no damage on you, take 1 damage. If you have no horror on you, take 1 horror.\n[tablet]: -4. If you fail, a [[Spectral]] enemy at your location attacks you (even if it is exhausted).\n[elder_thing]: -4. If this is a skill test during a circle action and you fail, resolve each haunted ability on your location.",
    "backTextZh": "困难/专家\n[skull]：-3。如果本次技能检定在阵法行动期间，再抽一个标记。\n[cultist]：-4。如果你身上没有伤害标记，受到1点伤害。如果你身上没有恐惧标记，受到1点恐惧。\n[tablet]：-4。如果你检定失败，你所在地点的一个[[幽灵]]敌人攻击你(不论其是否处于横置状态)。\n[elder_thing]：-4。如果本次技能检定在阵法行动期间且你检定失败，结算你所在地点的每个闹鬼能力。",
