    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/05257.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "The Geist-Trap",
    "nameZh": "灵怪陷阱",
    "originalCode": "05257",
    "pack": "uad",
    "packName": "Union and Disillusion",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 257,
    "provenanceId": "05257",
    "quantity": 1,
    "shroud": 4,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "While The Spectral Watcher is at The Geist-Trap, it gains retaliate.\n[action]: Circle. Test [willpower]+[intellect]+[combat]+[agility] (20) to complete the ritual, or to disrupt it. If you succeed, you may either light or unlight the brazier here.\nHaunted - Take 1 damage and 1 horror.",
    "textZh": "幽灵看守人位于灵怪陷阱时，其获得反击。\n[action]：阵法。检定[willpower]+[intellect]+[combat]+[agility](20)来完成仪式或破坏仪式。如果你检定成功，你可以使此处的火盆点燃或熄灭。\n闹鬼 -受到1点伤害和1点恐惧。",
