    "permanent": false,
    "position": 262,
    "provenanceId": "05262",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Check the \"Missing Persons\" section of the Campaign Log. If Gavriella disappeared into the mist and you are on Gavriella's trail:\nGavriella stumbles out of the mist, her eyes bloodshot and her voice strained. \"Where am I?… Who are you?\"\nTake control of the set-aside Gavriella Mizrah story asset. For the remainder of this scenario, she does not take up an ally slot. Next to Gavriella Mizrah's profile, record Gavriella is alive.If Gavriella was claimed by specters:\nFlip this card to its enemy side and spawn it at your location. If you are on Gavriella's trail, it spawns exhausted and unengaged. Otherwise, it spawns engaged with you.Otherwise:\nYou find Gavriella's weapon lying in the grass, decayed and broken. No other sign of her can be seen.",
    "textZh": "检查剧本日志的“失踪人口”区域。如果加弗瑞拉消失在迷雾之中并且调查员正在追查加弗瑞拉：\n加弗瑞拉从雾中跌出，眼睛血红，紧张地说：“我在哪？……你是谁？”\n控制放在一边的加弗瑞拉·米兹拉克剧情支援卡。她不占用盟友槽，直到本场冒险结束。在“失踪人员”的加弗瑞拉·米兹拉克旁边记录加弗瑞拉还活着。如果加弗瑞拉已被幽灵夺走性命：\n将本卡牌翻回敌人面，将其生成在你所在地点。如果调查员正在追查加弗瑞拉，其生成时被横置并且不处于交战状态。否则，其生成时与你交战。否则：\n你发现加弗瑞拉的武器落在草丛里，已经腐坏、破烂。而她本人不见踪影。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/05262"
