    "provenanceId": "05263",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Check the \"Missing Persons\" section of the Campaign Log. If Jerome disappeared into the mist and you are on Jerome's trail:\nJerome crawls out of the mist, and you help him to his feet. \"Oh god… the mist…\" he whispers. \"It's all connected… It's all connected…\"\nTake control of the set-aside Jerome Davids story asset. For the remainder of this scenario, he does not take up an ally slot. Next to Jerome Davids's profile, record Jerome is alive.If Jerome was claimed by specters:\nFlip this card to its enemy side and spawn it at your location. If you are on Jerome's trail, it spawns exhausted and unengaged. Otherwise, it spawns engaged with you.Otherwise:\nYou find a scrap of paper from Jerome's pocket notebook on the ground. It simply reads: \"HELP\"",
    "textZh": "检查剧本日志的“失踪人口”区域。如果杰罗姆消失在迷雾之中并且调查员正在追查杰罗姆：\n杰罗姆从雾中爬出，你扶着他起身。“我的天啊……那雾……”他低声说道，“一切都有联系……一切都有联系……”\n控制放在一边的杰罗姆·戴维斯剧情支援卡。他不占用盟友槽，直到本场冒险结束。在“失踪人员”的杰罗姆·戴维斯旁边记录杰罗姆还活着。如果杰罗姆已被幽灵夺走性命：\n将本卡牌翻回敌人面，将其生成在你所在地点。如果调查员正在追查杰罗姆，其生成时被横置并且不处于交战状态。否则，其生成时与你交战。否则：\n你从地上找到了一张来自杰罗姆随身笔记的纸片。上面只写着两个字：“救命！”",
