    "text": "Check the \"Missing Persons\" section of the Campaign Log. If Penny disappeared into the mist and you are on Penny's trail:\nPenny nearly runs directly into you. Her whole body shakes with panic as you hold her safe. \"A-are you alive?\" she cries. \"Is this nightmare finally over?\"\nTake control of the set-aside Penny White story asset. For the remainder of this scenario, she does not take up an ally slot. Next to Penny White's profile, record Penny is alive.If Penny was claimed by specters:\nFlip this card to its enemy side and spawn it at your location. If you are on Penny's trail, it spawns exhausted and unengaged. Otherwise, it spawns engaged with you.Otherwise:\nYou find Penny's apron lying on the ground, covered in blood. There is no other sign of her.",
    "textZh": "检查剧本日志的“失踪人口”区域。如果佩妮消失在迷雾之中并且调查员正在追查佩妮：\n佩妮险些把你撞了个满怀。你护着她的时候，她全身都在颤抖。“你、你活着吗？”她哭着说，“噩梦终于结束了吗？”\n控制放在一边的佩妮·怀特剧情支援卡。她不占用盟友槽，直到本场冒险结束。在“失踪人员”的佩妮·怀特旁边记录佩妮还活着。如果佩妮已被幽灵夺走性命：\n将本卡牌翻回敌人面，将其生成在你所在地点。如果调查员正在追查佩妮，其生成时被横置并且不处于交战状态。否则，其生成时与你交战。否则：\n你在地上发现了佩妮的围裙，被血液染红，而她本人不见踪影。",
