    "backFlavor": "One of the richest and most historical neighborhoods in Arkham, the many decaying mansions and estates of French Hill hold a lot of old wealth... and many more secrets.",
    "backFlavorZh": "阿卡姆最为富裕，最具历史意义的街区之一，法兰西山有许多废弃的大宅和庄园，个中藏有许多古老的财宝……还有更多的秘密。",
