    "provenanceId": "05328",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Each location is connected to each location adjacent to it.\nDo not remove doom from enemies when this agenda advances. (Beware - the scenario will not end when this agenda advances, but the doom of the world will be close at hand.)",
    "textZh": "每个地点与其相邻的每个地点相互连接。\n在本密谋推进时，不要移除敌人的毁灭标记。 (注意——在本密谋推进时，本场冒险不会结束，但世界末日即将到来。)",
