    "text": "[action] Spend X clues: Draw the top X cards of the Cosmos. Choose one to put into play using its \"Cosmos -\" instructions, and move to it. Shuffle the rest back into the Cosmos.\nObjective - Only investigators at Court of the Great Old Ones may spend the requisite number of clues, as a group, to advance. (Beware - any investigator who is not there will be killed.)",
    "textZh": "[action]花费X个线索：抽取“宇宙”顶上的X张卡牌。选择其中一张卡牌，按照其“宇宙 -”指示放置入场，并移动到其上。将其余卡牌洗回“宇宙”。\n目标 - 只有旧日支配者皇廷的调查员可以共同花费所需数量的线索以推进场景。(注意——不位于该处的所有调查员将会阵亡。)",
