    "text": "Revelation - Test [willpower] (4). If you fail, attach Ultimate Chaos to Azathoth. If you fail by 2 or more, take 1 damage and 1 horror. If you fail by 3 or more, Ultimate Chaos gains surge. Cannot be canceled.\nIf there are 3 copies of Ultimate Chaos attached to Azathoth, discard them and either place 1 doom on Azathoth, or Azathoth attacks each investigator in player order. Cannot be canceled.",
    "textZh": "显现 - 检定[willpower](4)。如果你检定失败，将究极混沌附属到阿撒托斯上。如果你检定失败且低于难度至少2点，受到1点伤害和1点恐惧。如果你检定失败且低于难度至少3点，究极混沌获得涌动。不能被取消。\n如果阿撒托斯上附属了3张究极混沌，将其全部弃掉，并在阿撒托斯上放置1个毁灭标记或阿撒托斯按玩家顺序攻击每位调查员。不能被取消。",
