    "text": "Azathoth is oblivious and omnipotent. It is immune to all player card effects and investigator actions, and cannot be defeated by any means.\nForced - If there is 10 or more doom on Azathoth: The Blind Idiot God rises from its throne in the ultimate void of chaos and devours the universe. (→R1)",
