    "subnameZh": "赏金猎人",
    "text": "You may take an additional action during your turn, which can only be used to engage or fight an enemy with 1 or more bounties on it.\n[elder_sign] effect: +2. Place 1 bounty on Bounty Contracts.",
    "textZh": "在你回合期间，你可以进行额外一次行动，该行动只能用于与带有赏金的敌人交战，或攻击带有赏金的敌人。\n[elder_sign]效果：+2。在赏金合约上放置1点赏金。",
