    "subnameZh": "入梦者",
    "text": "You begin the game with Gate Box in play.\nYou may play one event each turn as if you were at a connecting location and engaged with each enemy at that location.\n[elder_sign] effect: +1. Place 1 charge on Gate Box.",
    "textZh": "你以门之匣在场上开始游戏。\n你每回合可以打出1张事件卡牌，如同你位于一个连接地点并且与该地点的每个敌人交战。\n[elder_sign]效果：+1。在门之匣上放置1充能。",
