    "text": "Do not draw cards from the encounter deck during the mythos phase.\nObjective - If neither Nasht nor Kaman-Thah are in play, immediately advance.",
    "textZh": "神话阶段期间，不从遭遇牌库抽取卡牌。\n目标 -  如果纳什特和卡曼塔都不在场上，立即推进。",
