    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "The Enchanted Path is connected to each Enchanted Woods location.\nThe Enchanted Path gets +1 shroud for each unrevealed Enchanted Woods location in play.\n[action] [action] [action]: You do as you were told... but you feel as though you are missing something. Place 1 clue on The Enchanted Path (from the token pool).",
    "textZh": "魔幻小路与每个魔幻森林地点连接。\n场上每有一个未揭示的魔幻森林地点，魔幻小路得到隐藏值+1。\n[action][action][action]：你遵照着之前所受的嘱咐去做……但你总感觉自己遗漏了些什么。在魔幻小路上放置1 个线索(从供应堆拿取)。",
