    "subname": "Priest of the Dreamlands",
    "subnameZh": "幻梦境的牧师",
    "text": "Aloof. Retaliate.\n[action]: Parley. Test [willpower] or [intellect] (2) to prove that you are worthy to enter the Dreamlands. This test gets +1 [per_investigator] difficulty. If you succeed, flip Kaman-Thah over and resolve the text on his other side. If you fail, Kaman-Thah attacks each investigator at his location.\nForced - After you defeat Kaman-Thah: Flip him over and resolve the text on his other side.",
    "textZh": "冷漠。反击。\n[action]：谈判。检定[willpower]或[intellect](2)以证明你有资格进入幻梦境。本次检定难度+1[per_investigator]。如果你检定成功，将卡曼塔翻面并结算另一面的文本。如果你检定失败，卡曼塔攻击自己所在地点的每位调查员。\n强制 - 你击败卡曼塔后：将其翻面并结算另一面的文本。",
