    "text": "Each infested location gains: \"[action]: Test [willpower] (X) to attempt to seal the rift. X is this location's shroud. Investigators at this location may spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group, to automatically succeed. If you succeed, replace the damage token on this location with a horror token. For the remainder of the game, this location cannot become infested.\"\nObjective - If there are no infested locations in play, advance.",
    "textZh": "每个蛛巢地点获得：\n“[action]：检定[willpower](X)以尝试弥合裂痕。X为本地点的隐藏值。位于本地点的调查员可以共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索，以自动成功。如果你检定成功，将本地点上的伤害标记替换为恐惧标记。直到本场游戏结束，本地点不能变成蛛巢。”\n目标 - 如果场上没有蛛巢地点，推进。",
