  "06078": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backName": "Infestation Test",
    "backNameZh": "蛛群滋生检定",
    "backText": "Use these results only when revealing infestation tokens from the infestation bag.\n[skull]: Set this token aside. Search the encounter deck and discard pile for a [[Spider]] enemy and spawn it at the infested location nearest to any investigator.\n[tablet]: Set this token aside.\n[cultist]: Set this token aside. Choose a location connected to an infested location. That location becomes infested (place a damage token on it to mark this.). Then, if there are 2 or more [cultist] tokens set aside, return all set-aside infestation tokens to the infestation bag.",
    "backTextZh": "只有在从蛛群滋生袋揭示蛛群滋生标记时，才使用这些结果。\n[skull]：将本标记放在一边。查找遭遇牌库和遭遇弃牌堆，找出一张[[蜘蛛]]敌人并将其生成在距离任意一位调查员最近的蛛巢地点。\n[tablet]：将本标记放在一边。\n[cultist]：将本标记放在一边。选择一个与蛛巢地点连接的地点。该地点变成蛛巢(在该地点上放置1个伤害标记作为表示)。然后，如果有至少2个[cultist]标记被放在一边，将所有放在一边的蛛群滋生标记放回蛛群滋生袋。",
    "backimagesrc": "/bundles/cards/06078b.png",
    "code": "06078",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": true,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "waking_nightmare",
    "encounterName": "Waking Nightmare",
    "encounterPosition": 16,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavorZh": "",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/06078.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "The Infestation Begins...",
    "nameZh": "蛛群入侵",
    "originalCode": "06078",
    "pack": "tde",
    "packName": "The Dream-Eaters",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 78,
    "provenanceId": "06078",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Place 1 damage token on the location with the most clues (the 2 locations with the most clues if there are 3 or 4 investigators in the game). For the remainder of the scenario, damage tokens on locations represent the spreading infestation. Each location with a damage token on it is an \"infested\" location.\nCreate a separate bag consisting of the following tokens: [skull], [tablet], [tablet], [tablet], [tablet], [cultist], [cultist]. (If you do not have a second bag, use a cup, bowl, or other opaque container.) This is the infestation bag, and these are infestation tokens. They are not chaos tokens.\nSome abilities will instruct the players to make an infestation test. An infestation test may cause the infestation to spread to other locations or endanger investigators at infested locations. To resolve an infestation test, an investigator must reveal a random infestation token from the infestation bag, and resolve the effects for that token as indicated on the other side of this card.\nFlip this card over and place it next to the scenario reference card.",
    "textZh": "在线索最多的地点上放置1个伤害标记(如果游戏中有3或4位调查员，改为在线索最多的2个地点上放置)。本场冒险剩余时间内，地点上的伤害标记表示蛛群的蔓延路线。带有伤害标记的每个地点视为“蛛巢”地点。\n用下列标记单独创建一个袋子：[skull]、[tablet]、[tablet]、[tablet]、[tablet]、[cultist]、[cultist]。(如果你没有第二个袋子，你可以用杯子，碗，或其他不透明容器代替。)这个袋子就是蛛群滋生袋，这些标记就是蛛群滋生标记，而不是混乱标记。\n有的能力会指示玩家进行蛛群滋生检定。蛛群滋生检定可能导致蛛群蔓延到其他地点，或者使位于蛛巢地点的调查员陷入危险。要结算一次蛛群滋生检定，调查员必须从蛛群滋生袋中随机揭示一个蛛群滋生标记，结算该标记在本卡牌另一面上所指示的效果。\n将本卡牌翻面，放在冒险参考卡牌旁。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/06078"
  },
