    "text": "Objective - Find and uncover as many Signs of the Gods in this region as you can. At the end of the round, if each investigator is at the same [[Port]] location, you may move to another region by advancing this act.\nObjective - If the investigators have uncovered 10 Signs of the Gods, proceed to (→R1).",
    "textZh": "目标 - 在这个区域发现尽可能多的神迹。当一轮结束时，如果每位调查员都位于同一个[[港口]]地点，你可以通过推进本场景来移动到下一个区域。\n目标 - 如果调查员发现了10个神迹，进入(→结局1)。",
