    "encounterName": "The Search for Kadath",
    "encounterPosition": 10,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "The wilds of the Skai region may appear peaceful, but they are far from safe. You are compelled to travel slowly and take in the beauty and tranquility of this realm, but your dawdling makes you a target for the vicious creatures that call the wetlands home.",
    "flavorZh": "斯凯河流域的荒野看似平静，但并不安全。你不得不放慢前进的脚步，享受这里的宁静与优美，但闲逛会使你成为以湿地为居的邪恶生物的目标。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/06128b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
