    "quantity": 1,
    "shroud": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Veiled.\n[action] Spend 1 resource: Search the top 6 cards of your deck for an [[Item]] asset and draw it. Shuffle your deck.",
    "textZh": "掩藏。\n[action]花费1资源：查找你牌堆顶6张卡牌，找出一张[[道具]]支援并将其抽取。混洗你的牌库。",
