  "06129b": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "",
    "backTextZh": "",
    "code": "06129b",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "the_search_for_kadath",
    "encounterName": "The Search for Kadath",
    "encounterPosition": 11,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "In the port city of Dylath-Leen, you consult with the elders of the city. They believe that the truth of Kadath was hidden for a reason, and they call you a fool for searching for it. Even so, they tell you what little they know of the forsaken peak. Though you are far from finding Kadath, it is clear now that it cannot be in this region. \"We'll need to find a ship captain,\" Randolph muses. \"This journey will be much longer still. The isle of Oriab lies to the south, and I have heard of a great mountain there. To the west lies the ancient land of Mnar, where many secrets lie hidden. To the east is the Timeless Realm ruled by the wise King Kuranes. North of there is a forbidden land where none dare tread...\"",
    "flavorZh": "在港口城市狄拉斯-利恩，你向城中的几位长者请教卡达斯的所在。他们认为卡达斯的真相之所以隐藏起来是有原因的，他们说你是傻瓜，竟想寻找卡达斯。即使如此，他们把自己知道的、关于那座被遗忘的山峰的信息告诉了你，尽管他们知之甚少。凭借现有的信息，远远无法找到卡达斯，但你能明确的是，它不在这片区域。“我们得找个船长。”伦道夫沉思地说，“这趟旅程还有很长的路要走。奥瑞巴岛坐落在南边，我曾听说那里有一座大山。西边是古老的米纳尔，那里藏着许多秘密。东边是睿智的库拉尼斯王所统治的永恒王国。北边则是无人胆敢踏足的禁闭之地……”",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/06129b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Endless Secrets",
    "nameZh": "无穷秘密",
    "originalCode": "06129b",
    "pack": "sfk",
    "packName": "The Search for Kadath",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 129,
    "provenanceId": "06129b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "You have uncovered a Sign of the Gods (place 1 resource on the scenario reference card to indicate this). For the remainder of the scenario, resources on the scenario reference card represent Signs of the Gods the investigators have uncovered. Your quest is to uncover as many of these signs as you can in order to discern the location of Kadath.\nFlip this card back over.",
    "textZh": "你发现了一个神迹(在冒险参考卡牌上放置1资源作为表示)。本场冒险剩余时间内，冒险参考卡牌上的资源表示调查员已发现的神迹。你要做的就是发现尽可能多的神迹，从而找到卡达斯的位置。\n将本卡牌翻面。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/06129b"
  },
