    "permanent": false,
    "position": 131,
    "provenanceId": "06131",
    "quantity": 1,
    "shroud": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Veiled. Sarnath cannot be flipped over unless the investigators \"know what happened to Ib.\"\nForced - After you successfully investigate Sarnath by 1 or less: Take 1 horror.",
    "textZh": "掩藏。萨尔纳斯不能被翻面，除非调查员“知道伊伯发生的事情”。\n强制 - 你成功调查萨尔纳斯且至多超过难度1点后：受到1点恐惧。",
