    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "the_search_for_kadath",
    "encounterName": "The Search for Kadath",
    "encounterPosition": 15,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "High above the walls of Ilek-Vad stands the marvelous Palace of Rainbows, its towers faceted so the sunlight forms bright rainbows when it strikes the palace each dawn. You are surprised to learn that the citizenry of Ilek-Vad - people of all stations and, indeed, even outsiders such as yourself - are free to visit the palace grounds and walk its smooth glass streets lined with fragrant gardens. You are able to meet with the king of Ilek-Vad, who is said to know the music of the Moon, and he is happy to share with you his knowledge of the Dreamlands. You never, ever want to leave.",
    "flavorZh": "伊莱克-瓦达的高墙之上矗立着一座令人惊异的彩虹宫殿，其塔顶由许多刻面形成，所以每当清晨的阳光照耀宫殿，都会形成明亮的彩虹。你会惊讶地发现，伊莱克一瓦达的子民一一形形色色的人们，甚至包括像你一样的外乡人——都可以自由参观宫殿，漫步在光滑的玻璃道路上，两旁是散发着芳香的花园。你可以见到伊莱克-瓦达的王，据说他通晓月亮的音律，他很乐意把他知道的关于幻梦境的一切告诉你。你再也不想离开这里。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/06133b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "The Palace of Rainbows",
    "nameZh": "彩虹宫殿",
    "originalCode": "06133b",
    "pack": "sfk",
    "packName": "The Search for Kadath",
    "permanent": false,
