    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "the_search_for_kadath",
    "encounterName": "The Search for Kadath",
    "encounterPosition": 16,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "Throughout these perilous and hellish lands, you are beset by nameless beasts, hazardous terrain, and creatures too bizarre to describe. Even so, you press onward in the hope that you might learn something of the gods in this forsaken place. On the third evening you spend here, you find a shrine beside a lake of fire. Tucked away among a range of volcanoes, the shrine bears a statue carved in the face of the volcanic rock, long forgotten by ancient dreamers and outsiders alike. A mark of the Dreamlands' gods, perhaps? You draw the statue's likeness in your journal and hope that it might hold some significance.",
    "flavorZh": "在这危机四伏的可怕地方，你被无名野兽、危险地形和难以描述的怪异生物所包围。即便如此，你依然继续前进，希望能在这个被遗弃的地方知道一些关于神明的信息。你在这里度过第三个夜晚时，你发现火焰湖畔旁边有一座庙宇。它隐藏在火山群之中，带有一座雕刻在火山岩表面的雕像，它的存在早已被古代的入梦者和异乡人所忘却。或许这是幻梦境神明的迹象？你在日志里画下这雕像的模样，希望它有所意义。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/06134b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "A Shrine to the Gods",
    "nameZh": "诸神庙宇",
    "originalCode": "06134b",
    "pack": "sfk",
    "packName": "The Search for Kadath",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 134,
    "provenanceId": "06134b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "You have uncovered a Sign of the Gods (place 1 resource on the scenario reference card).\nShuffle 1 set-aside copy of Tenebrous Nightgaunt into the encounter deck, if able.\nFlip this card back over.",
    "textZh": "你发现了一个神迹(在冒险参考卡牌上放置1资源)。\n将1张放在一边的黑暗夜魇混洗入遭遇牌库(如可能)。\n将本卡牌翻面。",
