    "flavor": "It is said that Zulan-Thek, once a mighty city, feared their dead and the Night alike. It was both which rose up to destroy the city in the end.",
    "flavorZh": "据说祖兰-提克曾是显赫一时的城邦，畏惧灭亡与黑夜。它们最终摧毁了这座城邦。",
