    "provenanceId": "06137",
    "quantity": 1,
    "shroud": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Veiled.\nForced - After you enter Mt. Ngranek or discover 1 or more clues at Mt. Ngranek, if the investigators have not \"obtained supplies from Baharna\": Test [combat] (3) or [agility] (3). If you fail, lose your remaining actions and immediately end your turn.",
    "textZh": "掩藏。\n强制 - 你进入恩格拉尼克山脉或发现恩格拉尼克山脉的至少1个线索后，如果调查员未“在巴哈那港口获取补给”：检定[combat](3)或[agility](3)。如果你检定失败，失去你所有剩余的行动并立即结束你的回合。",
