    "provenanceId": "06137b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "You have uncovered a Sign of the Gods (place 1 resource on the scenario reference card).\nShuffle 1 set-aside copy of Tenebrous Nightgaunt into the encounter deck, if able.\nFlip this card back over.",
    "textZh": "你发现了一个神迹(在冒险参考卡牌上放置1资源)。\n将1张放在一边的黑暗夜魇混洗入遭遇牌库(如可能)。\n将本卡牌翻面。",
