    "flavor": "\"By evening he was near the nameless ancient ruins on Yath's farther shore...\"\n - H. P. Lovecraft, <u>The Dream-Quest of Unknown Kadath</u>",
    "flavorZh": "“傍晚时分，他接近了亚斯湖更远的湖畔，远古的无名遗迹……”H.P.洛夫克拉夫特，《梦寻秘境卡达斯》",
