    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "\"...Carter knew that they were come to the land of Ooth-Nargai and the marvellous city of Celephaïs. Swiftly there came into sight the glittering minarets of that fabulous town, and the untarnished marble walls with their bronze statues, and the great stone bridge where Naraxa joins the sea.\"\n - H. P. Lovecraft, <u>The Dream-Quest of Unknown Kadath</u>",
    "flavorZh": "“卡特知道他们来到了欧斯-纳尔盖山谷，以及坐落其中的不可思议的城邦塞勒菲斯。迅速映入眼帘的是那座美丽城邦的亮闪闪的尖塔，还有无瑕的大理石墙壁及其上方矗立的铜像，再就是横跨汇入海洋的纳拉克萨河的巨大石桥。”H.P.洛夫克拉夫特，《梦寻秘境卡达斯》",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
