    "encounterPosition": 23,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "In stark contrast to the rest of the Timeless Realm, Hazuth-Kleg is a decaying city of dingy, twisting streets and basalt towers that lies outside the reach of the king of Celephaïs. Even simple rules of architecture do not seem to apply here, and though there are gods venerated within the city's many temples, none of them are the reputable sort that you seek.",
    "flavorZh": "哈祖斯-克列格与永恒王国其他地方的显著差异在于，这是一座破败的城市，不受塞勒菲斯之王管辖，有着肮脏的蜿蜒小道和玄武岩筑成的高塔。这里的一切似乎都不符合建筑学的基本定律，尽管这座城市的许多寺庙都供奉着神明，但它们都不是你要找的受人敬仰的那些。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
