    "shroud": 6,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Veiled.\nFor each Priest of a Thousand Masks at the City-Which-Appears-On-No-Map, reduce its shroud by 1.\nForced - After you fail a skill test while investigating the City-Which-Appears-On-No-Map: Search the encounter deck and discard pile for a Priest of a Thousand Masks and spawn it here. Shuffle the encounter deck.",
    "textZh": "掩藏。\n每有一个千面祭司位于地图未见之城，其隐藏值-1。\n强制 - 你调查地图未见之城时，技能检定失败后：查找遭遇牌库和遭遇弃牌堆，找出一张千面祭司并将其生成在此。混洗遭遇牌库。",
