    "text": "Tetsuo Mori may be assigned damage and/or horror dealt to other investigators at your location.\n[reaction] When Tetsuo Mori is defeated: Choose an investigator at your location. That investigator searches either their discard pile or the top 9 cards of their deck for an [[Item]] asset and adds it to their hand. Shuffle their deck if it is searched.",
