    "text": "(Hint - The game will not end when this agenda advances... but the agents of Nyarlathotep will tighten their noose.)",
    "textZh": "(提示：本密谋推进时本场游戏不会结束……但奈亚拉托提普的使徒们会收紧它们的圈套。)",
