    "stage": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Clues cannot be discovered from The Black Core except as a result of a successful investigation.\nObjective - If each surviving investigator is at The Black Core and it has no clues on it, advance.",
    "textZh": "黑暗月核的线索只能通过调查成功来发现，其他方式均不能发现。\n目标 -如果每位幸存的调查员都位于黑暗月核，且黑暗月核没有线索，推进。",
