    "text": "Investigators cannot enter or leave Moon-Beast Galley via player card effects.\n[fast] If there are no clues remaining on Moon-Beast Galley: Flip it over.\nForced - At the end of the round, if there are 3 or more doom in play: Flip Moon-Beast Galley over.",
