  "06258b": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "",
    "backTextZh": "",
    "code": "06258b",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "point_of_no_return",
    "encounterName": "Point of No Return",
    "encounterPosition": 12,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "Looking out over the barren vale, you get a sense for the threats that dwell below. Underneath the plateau upon which you stand, a forest of obscene, pale fungi extends for miles. Beyond that is a great heap of bones, like an ocean pouring forth in all directions. You swear you can see something crawling or worming its way along the surface of the bones, but perhaps it's just your imagination. In the distance, great sharp peaks of stone loom over the vale. Black, winged creatures fly around the summits, searching for prey. You see no sign of this \"ocean of pitch\" Pickman described, though you do notice a wide cavern opening along a wall of stone to the right of the vale below...",
    "flavorZh": "你望着荒芜的山谷，感觉到下方的威胁。在你脚下的平原底下，连绵数英里的是一片可憎的苍白真菌。在那之外是堆成山的骸骨，就像朝四面八方涌流的大海一般。你发誓自己看到了那些骸骨的表面爬着某些东西，但或许这只是你的想象。远处陡峭的石峰屹立在山谷之上。长有翅膀的黑色生物在峰顶周围飞翔，寻找着猎物。你并没有看到皮克曼口中的“漆黑之海”，但你发现在下方山谷右边的石壁上有着巨大的洞穴……",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/06258b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Scouting the Vale",
    "nameZh": "探查山谷",
    "originalCode": "06258b",
    "pack": "pnr",
    "packName": "Point of No Return",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 258,
    "provenanceId": "06258b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Look at the top 2 [per_investigator] cards of the encounter deck. You may discard up to half of those cards. Return the rest to the top of the encounter deck, in any order.\nFor the remainder of the game, ignore the text on Crag of the Ghouls.\nFlip this card back over.",
    "textZh": "查看遭遇牌库顶的2[per_investigator]张卡牌。你可以最多弃掉这些卡牌的一半。将其余卡牌以任意顺序放回遭遇牌库顶。\n直到本场游戏结束，忽略食尸鬼峭壁的文本。\n将本卡牌翻面。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/06258b"
  },
