    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "\"There was nothing anywhere but blackness and horror and silence and bones.\"\n- H. P. Lovecraft, <u>The Dream-Quest of Unknown Kadath</u>",
    "flavorZh": "“除了黑暗、恐怖、寂静和无数的骸骨之外，这里什么都没有。”H.P.洛夫克拉夫特，《梦寻秘境卡达斯》",
