  "06259b": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "",
    "backTextZh": "",
    "code": "06259b",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "point_of_no_return",
    "encounterName": "Point of No Return",
    "encounterPosition": 13,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "Traversing this canyon of cadavers and monstrous remains is laborious enough, but it is the churning and digging below the surface that causes you to hate this awful place. What sort of monstrosity could span the entirety of this ocean of bones? Your answer presents itself as you come across a great pit in the ravine. It is swallowing the bones and scraps of rotten meat like a whirlpool. When you reach the base of the tunnel and realize its true purpose, a shudder courses through you. It was made by an enormous creature: the thing that dwells below the sea of bones.",
    "flavorZh": "光是穿越这片满是尸体和怪物遗骸的山谷已非易事，但你对这个可怕地方的憎恨来自于地面以下的搅动与挖掘。什么样的怪物能跨越这片骸骨之海呢？当你看到峡谷中的一个巨坑时，你心中有了答案。它就像漩涡一样吞噬骸骨和带有腐肉的骨头。当你到达隧道底部，意识到它的真实用意时，一股颤栗传遍你的全身。这是由居住在骸骨之海底下的一种巨大生物引起的。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/06259b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Something Below",
    "nameZh": "下方之物",
    "originalCode": "06259b",
    "pack": "pnr",
    "packName": "Point of No Return",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 259,
    "provenanceId": "06259b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "If there is no Dhole Tunnel at this location, search the encounter deck and discard pile for a Dhole Tunnel and attach it to this location, if able. Shuffle the encounter deck.\nIf Slithering Dhole is in play, move it to this location and add 2 clues to it. Otherwise, search the encounter deck, discard pile, and victory display for Slithering Dhole, and spawn it at this location, exhausted and with 2 clues on it.\nFlip this card back over.",
    "textZh": "如果本地点没有巨噬蠕虫隧道，查找遭遇牌库和遭遇弃牌堆，找出一张巨噬蠕虫隧道并将其附属到本地点(如可能)。混洗遭遇牌库。\n如果滑行的巨噬蠕虫在场上，将其移动到本地点，在其上放置2个线索。否则，查找遭遇牌库、遭遇弃牌堆和胜利区，找出滑行的巨噬蠕虫，将其以横置状态生成在本地点，并带有2个线索。\n将本卡牌翻面。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/06259b"
  },
