    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Veiled.\nWhile there are clues remaining on Vale of Pnath, investigators at Vale of Pnath cannot play cards or commit cards to skill tests.",
    "textZh": "掩藏。\n潘斯山谷上有线索时，位于潘斯山谷的调查员不能打出卡牌，也不能投入卡牌到技能检定。",
