    "subname": "A Liar, or a Prophet, or Both",
    "subnameZh": "骗子、预言家、抑或都是",
    "text": "Anytime you reveal a [tablet], [elder_thing], or [elder_sign] symbol during a skill test, you may choose to use the following effects instead of that symbol's normal effects:\n[tablet]: -1. The Black Cat takes 1 direct damage.\n[elder_thing]: -1. The Black Cat takes 1 direct horror.\n[elder_sign]: +5. Heal all damage and horror from The Black Cat.",
    "textZh": "每当你在技能检定期间揭示[tablet]、[elder_thing]或[elder_sign]符号，你可以不使用该符号的效果，改为选择使用以下效果：\n[tablet]：-1。黑猫受到1点直接伤害。\n[elder_thing]：-1。黑猫受到1点直接恐惧。\n[elder_sign]：+5。治愈黑猫的全部伤害和恐惧。",
