    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[action] Spend 1 clue: Look at the top 3 cards of the encounter deck. Draw each of those cards with the hidden keyword and discard the rest.\nObjective - Find and expose Nyarlathotep's true form by adding copies of Nyarlathotep to the victory display. If 1 plus 1 [per_investigator] copies are in the victory display, advance.",
    "textZh": "[action]花费1个线索：查看遭遇牌库顶的3张卡牌。抽取这些卡牌中带有隐私关键词的每张卡牌，弃掉其余卡牌。\n目标 - 将奈亚拉托提普放入胜利区，以找出并揭露它的真形。如果胜利区有1[per_investigator]+1张奈亚拉托提普，推进。",
