    "text": "[fast] During your turn, discard an asset you control: Play an asset with a different title from your hand, reducing its cost by 1. (Limit once per round.)\n[elder_sign] effect: +2. You may return an asset from your play area to your hand. Then, draw 1 card.",
    "textZh": "[free]在你回合期间，弃掉一个你控制的支援：从你手牌中打出一张与之不同名称的支援，其费用-1。(每轮仅限一次。)\n[elder_sign]效果：+2。你可以将你游戏区域的一张支援返回你的手牌。然后，抽取一张卡牌。",
