    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull]: -2 (-3 instead if your location is partially flooded; -4 instead if your location is fully flooded).\n[cultist]: -2. If your location is flooded, take 1 damage.\n[tablet]: -2. If you control a key, take 1 horror.\n[elder_thing]: -3. If The Amalgam is in the depths, put it into play engaged with you.",
    "backTextZh": "困难/专家\n[skull]：-2(如果你所在地点部分淹没，改为-3；如果你所在地点完全淹没，改为-4)。\n[cultist]：-2。如果你所在地点已淹没，受到1点伤害。\n[tablet]：-2。如果你控制钥匙，受到1点恐惧。\n[elder_thing]：-3。如果混生畸物在深渊中，将其放置入场，与你交战。",
