    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "\"My frantic running ceased before I had covered a block, for at my left I began to hear something like the hue and cry of organised pursuit. There were footsteps and guttural sounds, and a rattling motor wheezed south along Federal Street.\"\n- H. P. Lovecraft, <i>The Shadow over Innsmouth</i>",
    "flavorZh": "“我穿过了一整个街区，才停下自己疯跑的脚步。我听到左边传来一阵叫喊，是那群追击我的人。其中夹杂着脚步声和喉咙里的咕噜，还有一辆吱嘎作响的汽车气喘吁吁沿着联邦街一路往南。” H. P. 洛夫克拉夫特，《印斯茅斯之影》",
