    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "All of your evidence leads here. You must rescue Agent Harper at all costs!",
    "flavorZh": "所有的线索都指向此处。你必须不惜任何代价营救哈珀特工！",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
