    "encounterName": "The Vanishing of Elina Harper",
    "encounterPosition": 8,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "\"That refinery, though, used to be a big thing, and Old Man Marsh, who owns it, must be richer'n Croesus.\"\n- H. P. Lovecraft, <i>The Shadow over Innsmouth</i>",
    "flavorZh": "“不过，那家精炼厂倒是笔买卖。那里的老板，老马什，肯定富甲一方。”H. P. 洛夫克拉夫特，《印斯茅斯之影》",
