    "stage": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[fast] Spend 1 [per_investigator] +1 clues, as a group: Remove 1 barrier between your location and a connecting location.\nObjective - Get to the Railroad Station! If each surviving investigator has resigned, advance.",
    "textZh": "[free]共同花费1[per_investigator]+1个线索：移除你所在地点和连接地点之间的1个屏障。\n目标 - 到达火车站！如果所有幸存的调查员都撤退，推进。",
