    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Keys can only be claimed from [[Y'ha-nthlei]] locations using the [fast] ability on those locations.\nObjective - Find and claim as many of the following keys as you can from [[Y'ha-nthlei]] locations (purple, white, and black). If you control all 3 of these keys, advance.",
    "textZh": "[[伊哈·恩斯雷]]地点的钥匙只能通过其地点的[free]能力获取。\n目标 - 尽可能多地从[[伊哈·恩斯雷]]地点找到并获取下列钥匙(紫色、白色和黑色)。如果你控制全部3把这些钥匙，推进。",
