    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull]: -2. If your location is flooded, reveal an additional chaos token.\n[cultist]: -2. If you fail, after this test ends, increase the flood level of your location (if you cannot, take 1 horror instead).\n[tablet]: -3. If you fail this test and your location is flooded, take 2 damage.\n[elder_thing]: -4. Move the nearest unengaged enemy once toward your location. It loses aloof during this movement.",
    "backTextZh": "困难/专家\n[skull]：-2。如果你所在地点已淹没，再揭示一个混乱标记。\n[cultist]：-2。如果你检定失败，本次检定结束后，提升你所在地点的淹没等级(如果你不能这么做，改为受到1点恐惧)。\n[tablet]：-3。如果你检定失败且你所在地点已淹没，受到2点伤害。\n[elder_thing]：-4。最近的未与调查员交战的敌人朝你所在地点移动一次。该敌人本次移动期间失去冷漠。",
