    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavor": "The lobby is full of old wealth hidden under layers of decrepitude. Two cracked statues flank the entrance, behind which loom two sets of wooden stairs leading up to the second floor. Two more doors hide under the stairways to your left and right, and a final locked door stands at the end of the hall.",
    "backFlavorZh": "在荒废的表面之下，这座厅堂里塞满了古代的财富。两尊破裂的塑像拱卫着入口，后面深处两道木楼梯通往二楼。楼梯下你的左右藏着另外两扇门，厅堂另一头也有一扇锁着的门。",
