    "backText": "Hard / Expert\n[skull]: -2 (-4 instead if there are 4 or more unflooded [[Y'ha-nthlei]] locations in play).\n[cultist]: -4. If you fail, place 1 doom on the current agenda (this may cause the current agenda to advance).\n[tablet]: -5. If you fail, you must either increase the flood level of your location or take 1 damage.\n[elder_thing]: -6. If you fail and there is a key on your location, take 1 horror.",
    "backTextZh": "困难/专家\n[skull]：-2(如果场上有至少4个未淹没的[[伊哈·恩斯雷]]地点，改为-4)。\n[cultist]：-4。如果你检定失败，在当前密谋上放置1个毁灭标记(本效果可以导致当前密谋推进)。\n[tablet]：-5。如果你检定失败，你必须提升你所在地点的淹没等级，或受到1点伤害。\n[elder_thing]：-6。如果你检定失败且你所在地点有钥匙，受到1点恐惧。",
