    "text": "[reaction] At the end of your turn, if you started this round 1 location away from your current location: Either gain 1 resource or draw 1 card (if you started this round 2 or more locations away, do both instead).\n[elder_sign] effect: +1. If you started this round 1 or more locations away from your current location, gain 1 resource or draw 1 card.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]当你的回合结束时，如果你本轮开始时的地点与你现在地点的连接次数为1：获得1资源或抽取1张卡牌(连接次数至少为2时，改为执行两项)\n[elder_sign]效果：+1。如果你本轮开始时的地点与你现在地点的连接次数至少为1，获得1资源或抽取1张卡牌。",
