    "encounterName": "Lost in the Night",
    "encounterPosition": 6,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "As you traverse the glacial wilds, something rumbles and churns beneath your feet. Is that where these creatures are coming from? In the depths of the ice?\nA somber thought crosses your mind. If you are right, such entities could exert their vile influence no matter where you stand. Perhaps this has something to do with your missing companions after all, though there are no signs of them here.",
    "flavorZh": "当你穿越冰川荒野时，有东西在你脚下搅动，隆隆作响。这些生物就是从那里来的吗？从冰雪深处？\n一个严峻的想法掠过你的脑海。如果你是对的，那不管你在哪里，都逃不出这些存在的魔爪。也许这跟你失踪的同伴有关系，尽管这里没有他们的踪迹。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/08528.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Cracks in the Ice",
    "nameZh": "冰上裂缝",
    "originalCode": "08528",
    "pack": "eoec",
    "packName": "Edge of the Earth Campaign Expansion",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 28,
    "provenanceId": "08528",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Search your deck for a copy of Tekeli-li and place it on the bottom of the Tekeli-li deck without resolving it. Shuffle your deck.\nAdd this story card to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "查找你的牌库，找出一张忒咳哩-哩并将其放到忒咳哩-哩牌库底，不要结算它。混洗你的牌库。\n将本剧情卡牌加入胜利区。",
    "traits": [],
