    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "lost_in_the_night",
    "encounterName": "Lost in the Night",
    "encounterPosition": 11,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "You follow a set of footprints through the snow, hoping they will lead you to a sign, any sign, of your lost companions. Sadly, the evidence you discover is not the kind you were hoping to find. Where the prints end, you find an ice pick covered in freshly frozen blood. To your horror, a human eye lies nearby, staining the snow red. A shudder creeps up your spine. What on Earth could compel somebody to do such a thing?",
    "flavorZh": "你跟着雪地上的一组脚印，希望它们能指引你找到失踪同伴的任何迹象。遗憾的是，你找到的迹象并不是你想要的那种。在脚印的尽头，你发现一个覆盖着新鲜冻血的破冰锥。令你惊恐的是，旁边放着一个人类的眼珠，把雪染成了红色。你的脊梁上冒出寒气，忍不住打了个寒颤。究竟是什么迫使一个人做出这种事情？",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/08533.png",
