    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "fatal_mirage",
    "encounterName": "Fatal Mirage",
    "encounterPosition": 10,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "Ellsworth appears in a shimmer of mirage-light, staring out over the railing into the cold, blue ocean. \"Beautiful, isn't it?\" he says.\nCookie and Claypool appear nearby, carrying several crates of supplies between them. \"Y'know what would be beautiful?\" Cookie hollers. \"If maybe yeh helped out a lil' bit. Think yeh might get off yer ass for a minute 'n pitch in, Ellsworth?\"\nThe explorer nods with a soft sigh and takes the weight from Claypool's hands, nodding aside for him to take a break. Claypool gives him a gentle, knowing smile.",
    "flavorZh": "埃尔斯沃思出现在闪烁的幻光中，凝视着栏杆外冰冷的蓝色海洋。\n“很美，不是吗？”他说。\n曲奇和克莱普尔出现在旁边，他们中间还有几箱补给品。“那你想知道什么事情更美吗？”曲奇大喊着。“比如你现在就来搭把手。埃尔斯沃思，你能不能动一下，过来帮帮忙？”\n探险家轻轻叹了口气，点了点头，接过克莱普尔手中的东西，向旁边点了下头，让克莱普尔休息一下。克莱普尔给了他一个温柔的、会心的微笑。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Deck of the Theodosia",
    "nameZh": "菲奥多西亚号甲板",
    "originalCode": "08558b",
    "pack": "eoec",
    "packName": "Edge of the Earth Campaign Expansion",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 58,
    "provenanceId": "08558b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Choose one:\n- Follow Cookie's memories. Put the set-aside Coastal Waters location into play.\n- Follow Ellsworth's memories. Put the set-aside Hedge Maze location into play.\n- Follow Claypool's memories. Put the set-aside Standing Stones location into play.\nFlip this card back over.",
    "textZh": "选择一项：\n- 跟随曲奇的记忆。将放在一边的沿海水域地点放置入场。\n- 跟随埃尔斯沃思的记忆。将放在一边的树篱迷宫地点放置入场。\n- 跟随克莱普尔的记忆。将放在一边的耸立岩石地点放置入场。\n将本卡牌翻面。",
