    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "fatal_mirage",
    "encounterName": "Fatal Mirage",
    "encounterPosition": 18,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "A teenage girl shimmers into view. You recognize Takada's chestnut eyes and thin, straight hair. Her cheeks are stained with tears and rain. She waves as the old, rickety aeroplane takes off. You don't recognize the design - this must have been over a decade ago. \"Don't worry, kiddo.\" The man next to her grips her shoulder encouragingly. \"He'll be back soon,\" he reassures her, his voice soft with compassion. \"You'll see.\"",
    "flavorZh": "一个十几岁的女孩闪烁着出现在视线中。你认出高田栗色的眼睛和纤细的直发。她的脸颊被泪水和雨水弄脏了。当那架摇摇晃晃的老旧飞机起飞时，她挥着手。你并不认识这种设计——这一定是十多年前的事了。“别担心，孩子。”她旁边的男人抓住她的肩膀鼓励她。“他很快就会回来的。”他安慰她说，他的声音温柔而富有同情心，“你就等着吧。”",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Airfield",
