    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "fatal_mirage",
    "encounterName": "Fatal Mirage",
    "encounterPosition": 34,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "\"I...I remember this,\" the real Ellsworth says, staring at his own memory. \"This is what made me want to become an explorer. To discover things like this. Ancient secrets, left behind by God knows what. But the more I discover, the more I think that perhaps there are parts of the Earth better left alone. Perhaps all of this is the fault of people like me, who refuse to let history lie. Arrogant fools, the lot of us.\"",
    "flavorZh": "“我……我记得这个。”真正的埃尔斯沃思盯着自己的记忆说，“这就是为什么我想成为一名探险家的原因。为了发现这样的东西。古代秘密，天知道是被什么东西留下来的。但我发现得越多，我就越觉得，不去探索地球的某些地方会更好。也许这一切都是像我这样的人的错，我们这些拒绝让历史被尘封的人。我们都是傲慢的傻瓜。”",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "klass": "mythos",
