    "encounterName": "City of the Elder Things",
    "encounterPosition": 2,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "The hidden alien city looms before you, ancient and enigmatic. What secrets - and terrors - lie in wait within?",
    "flavorZh": "古老而神秘的城市在你面前隐现，里面有着怎样的秘密——和恐怖——在等待着你呢？",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
