    "encounterPosition": 3,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "Below the darkened ice, more of the city lies trapped, encased and frozen in time. This is but the tip of the iceberg...",
    "flavorZh": "在黑暗的冰层下，城市更多部分都被困在那里，冰封于时间的长河中。这只是冰山一角……",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
