    "text": "Revelation - Put Wounded Bystander into play in your play area with 3 damage on it. It cannot leave play while it has damage (unless it is defeated). If it has no damage, discard it.\nForced - When you take non-direct damage: At least 1 of it must be assigned to Wounded Bystander, if able.\nForced - If Wounded Bystander is defeated: You suffer 1 mental trauma.",
    "textZh": "显现 - 将受伤路人放置入场，放到你的游戏区域，带有3点伤害。它有伤害时不能离场(除非被击败)。如果它没有伤害，将他弃掉。\n强制 - 在你受到非直接伤害时，如可能，其中至少1点必须分配到受伤路人。\n强制 - 如果受伤路人被击败：你承受1点精神创伤。",
