    "sanity": 8,
    "subname": "The Photographer",
    "subnameZh": "摄影师",
    "text": "You begin the game with Darrell's Kodak in play.\n[fast] During a skill test at your location, spend 1 evidence from an asset you control: Reduce the difficulty of this test by 2. (Limit once per test.)\n[elder_sign] effect: +1. Place 1 evidence on an asset you control.",
    "textZh": "你以达雷尔的柯达相机在场上开始游戏。\n[free]在你地点的技能检定期间，从你控制的支援上花费1证据：此次检定的难度降低2点。(每次检定仅限一次。)\n[elder_sign]效果：+1。在你控制的一张支援上放置1证据。",
