    "text": "Customizable. Uses (4 charges). Replenish 1 of these charges at the start of each round.\n[action]: Fight. You get +1 [combat] for this attack. Before this attack, you may spend any number of charges to imbue the axe with that many different inscriptions -\n- Accuracy - You get an additional +2 [combat] for this attack.\n- Power - This attack deals +1 damage.",
    "textZh": "定制。使用(4充能)。当每轮开始时重新补满这些充能中的1点。\n[action]：攻击。你本次攻击得到+1[combat]。这次攻击前，你可以花费任意数量的充能，以此为斧子灌注对应数量的不同铭文——\n- 精准——你本次攻击得到额外+2[combat]。\n- 力量——本次攻击造成+1伤害。",
