    "text": "Customizable.\nAttach to a [[Firearm]] asset you control. Limit 1 per asset.\n[reaction] When you reveal a non-[auto_fail] chaos token attacking with attached asset, exhaust Custom Modifications: Cancel that chaos token, return it to the chaos bag, and reveal a new one.",
    "textZh": "定制。\n附属到你控制的[[枪械]]支援。每个支援仅限1张。\n[reaction]你用附属的支援攻击时，在揭示了一个非[auto_fail]混乱标记时，横置定制改良：取消该混乱标记，将其放回混乱袋，并揭示一个新标记。",
