    "code": "09042",
    "cost": 3,
    "customizationChange": "Named asset:\nUsing attached asset's [action] abilities does not provoke attacks of opportunity.\nAttached asset does not take up any slots.\nYou get +2 skill value while performing skill tests on attached asset.\nAdditional named assets:\n[fast] Exhaust The Raven Quill: Move 1 secret or charge from an asset you control to attached asset.\nAfter you resolve an [action] ability on attached asset, you may exhaust The Raven Quill to ready another asset you control.\nAttach to a named asset you control, or you may search your deck, discard pile, and hand for a copy of a named asset and play it (paying its cost). Then, attach The Raven Quill to it.",
    "customizationChangeZh": "指定的[[书籍]]或[[法术]]支援：_____\n使用所附属支援的[action]能力不会触发趁乱攻击。\n所附属的支援不占用任何槽位。\n你执行所附属支援的技能检定时得到+2技能值。\n多指定两个[[书籍]]或[[法术]]支援：_____，_____\n[fast]横置鸦翎羽毛笔：将1秘密或充能从一个你控制的支援移动到所附属支援。\n你结算所附属支援的一个[action]能力后，你可以横置鸦翎羽毛笔以重整另一个你控制的支援。\n在你打出鸦翎羽毛笔时，可以不将其附属到自己控制的所指定支援，改为查找你的牌库、弃牌堆和手牌，找出一张所指定的支援，将其打出(支付其费用)。然后，将鸦翎羽毛笔附属到该卡牌。",
