    "customizationText": "Named [[Tome]] or [[Spell]] asset:\n□ Living Quill. Using attached asset's [action] abilities does not provoke attacks of opportunity.\n□ Spectral Binding. Attached asset does not take up any slots.\n□□ Mystic Vane. You get +2 skill value while performing skill tests on attached asset.\n□□ Endless Inkwell. Name two more [[Tome]] or [[Spell]] assets:\n□□ Energy Sap. The Raven Quill gains: \"[fast] Exhaust The Raven Quill: Move 1 secret or charge from an asset you control to attached asset.\"\n□□□ Interwoven Ink. After you resolve an [action] ability on attached asset, you may exhaust The Raven Quill to ready another asset you control.\n□□□□ Supernatural Record. When you play The Raven Quill, instead of attaching it to a named asset you control, you may search your deck, discard pile, and hand for a copy of a named asset and play it (paying its cost). Then, attach The Raven Quill to it.",
    "customizationTextZh": "指定的[[书籍]]或[[法术]]支援：_____\n□笔如有神。使用所附属支援的[action]能力不会触发趁乱攻击。\n□幽灵封皮。所附属的支援不占用任何槽位。\n□□神秘翎羽。你执行所附属支援的技能检定时得到+2技能值。\n□□无尽墨瓶。多指定两个[[书籍]]或[[法术]]支援：_____，_____\n□□墨力汲取。鸦翎羽毛笔获得：“[fast]横置鸦翎羽毛笔：将1秘密或充能从一个你控制的支援移动到所附属支援。”\n□□□交织墨水。你结算所附属支援的一个[action]能力后，你可以横置鸦翎羽毛笔以重整另一个你控制的支援。\n□□□□神奇记录。在你打出鸦翎羽毛笔时，可以不将其附属到自己控制的所指定支援，改为查找你的牌库、弃牌堆和手牌，找出一张所指定的支援，将其打出(支付其费用)。然后，将鸦翎羽毛笔附属到该卡牌。",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
