    "text": "Customizable. When you purchase The Raven Quill, name a [[Tome]] or [[Spell]] asset and record that name on its upgrade sheet.\nAttach to a named asset you control.\n[reaction] When you resign or the game ends: Either mark a checkbox on The Raven Quill's upgrade sheet, or reduce the experience cost to upgrade the attached asset before the next scenario by 1.",
    "textZh": "定制。你在购买鸦翎羽毛笔时，指定一个[[书籍]]或[[法术]]支援，并将其名称记录在本卡牌的升级卡上。\n附属到你控制的已指定支援。\n[reaction]在你撤退或游戏结束时：勾选鸦翎羽毛笔升级卡上的一个方框，或者在下场冒险开始前升级所附属支援的经验值费用降低1点。",
