    "code": "09059",
    "cost": 4,
    "customizationChange": "While investigating using Damning Testimony, you may ignore any effect or keyword on the investigated location that would trigger.\nCustomizable. Uses (5 evidence).\nYou get +2 [intellect] while investigating using Damning Testimony.\nWhen you successfully investigate using Damning Testimony, you may spend 1 evidence to automatically evade the chosen enemy.\nYou may use Damning Testimony's ability to investigate the chosen enemy's location instead of your location.\nWhen you successfully investigate using Damning Testimony, you may spend X evidence to discard the chosen enemy if it is non-[[Elite]]. X is that enemy's remaining health.",
    "customizationChangeZh": "使用关键证言调查时，你可以忽略调查地点将触发的任何效果和关键词。 \n定制。使用(5证据)。\n你使用关键证言调查时得到+2[intellect]。\n在你使用关键证言调查成功时，你可以花费1证据以自动躲避所选敌人。\n你可以改为使用关键证言的能力来调查所选敌人的地点，而非你所在地点。\n在你使用关键证言调查成功时，如果所选敌人非[[精英]]，你可以花费X证据以弃掉该敌人。X为该敌人剩余的生命值。",
