    "backTextZh": "",
    "code": "09060",
    "cost": 0,
    "customizationChange": "Customizable. Chosen trait: _____\nWhen you play Friends in Low Places, you may choose another investigator at your location to resolve its effects.\nChoose another trait: _____. When you play Friends in Low Places, you may choose one of the looked-at cards with both chosen [[Traits]] to add to your hand without spending 1 resource.\nEach card added to your hand by Friends in Low Places gains a [wild] icon until the end of the phase.\nInstead of shuffling the remaining cards into your deck, you may place each of them on the top of your deck, in any order.\nFast. Play during any [fast] window.\nLook at the top 9 cards of your deck. For each looked-at card with the chosen [[Trait]](s), you may spend 1 resource to add that card to your hand. Shuffle the remaining cards into your deck.\nYou may play one of the cards added to your hand (paying its cost).",
    "customizationChangeZh": "定制。选择的[[特性]]：_____\n你在打出狐朋狗友时，可以选择你所在地点的另一位调查员结算其效果。\n再选择一个[[特性]]：________你在打出狐朋狗友时，可以在查看到的卡牌中，选择一张两个[[特性]]都有的卡牌，将其加入自己手牌，不花费资源。\n由狐朋狗友加入你手牌的每张卡牌获得一个[wild]图标，直到本阶段结束。\n你可以不将剩下的卡牌洗入你的牌库，改为将其以任意顺序放到你的牌库顶。\n快速。可在任何[fast]时间段期间打出。\n查看你牌库顶的9张卡牌。每查看一张所选[[特性]]的卡牌，你可以花费1资源，以将该卡牌加入你的手牌。将剩下的卡牌洗入你的牌库。\n你可以打出一张加入手牌的卡牌(支付其费用)。",
