    "code": "09079",
    "cost": 0,
    "customizationChange": "Customizable. Chosen skill: _____\nYou may play Living Ink under the control of any investigator at your location.\nAt the start of your turn, either remove 1 charge from Living Ink or ignore its ability for the remainder of the round. If Living Ink has no charges, discard it.\nUses (5 charges).\nAdditional skill: _____\nAdditional skill: _____\n[reaction] After you reveal a chaos token with a symbol, exhaust Living Ink: Place 1 charge on it.\nYou get +2 to the chosen skill(s) and -1 to each other skill.",
    "customizationChangeZh": "定制。所选技能：_____\n你打出传神佳墨可以将其置于你所在地点其他调查员控制之下。\n当你回合开始时，你可以选择不从传神佳墨移除1充能，且忽略其能力，直到本轮结束。如果传神佳墨没有充能，将其弃掉。\n使用(5充能)。\n所选额外技能：_____\n所选额外技能：_____\n[reaction]在你揭示带有符号的混乱标记后，横置传神佳墨：在上面放置1充能。\n你得到所选技能+2，其他每项技能-1。",
