    "code": "09081",
    "cost": 3,
    "customizationChange": "- \"Betray.\" Deal 1 damage to any enemy at this enemy's location with an equal or lower fight value than this enemy.\n- \"Mercy.\" An investigator at this enemy's location heals damage or horror equal to this enemy's respective damage/horror value.\n- \"Confess.\" Discover 1 clue at this enemy's location if its health is equal to or higher than its location's shroud.\n- \"Distract.\" Automatically evade any enemy at this enemy's location with an equal or lower evade value than this enemy.\n[fast]: Return Power Word to your hand.\nYou may activate the parley ability on Power Word from up to one location away from the attached enemy.\n[action] If attached enemy is at your location: Parley. Give it up to two different commands (limit once per round per command) -\nYou may include three copies of Power Word in your deck. When you give a command using one copy, also give that command to each other enemy with one of your copies of Power Word attached.",
    "customizationChangeZh": "- “叛变。”对附属敌人所在地点的任意敌人造成1点伤害，受到伤害的敌人的攻击值须小于等于附属的敌人。\n- “开恩。”附属敌人所在地点的一位调查员治愈伤害或恐惧，治愈的数值等于该敌人对应的伤害/恐惧值。\n- “坦白。”发现附属敌人所在地点的1个线索，该地点的隐藏值须小于等于附属敌人的生命值。\n- “引开。”自动躲避附属敌人所在地点的任意一个敌人，被躲避敌人的躲避值须小于等于附属的敌人。\n[fast]：将号令真言返回你的手牌。\n你可以对最多一个地点远的附属敌人，激活号令真言的谈判能力。\n[action]如果所附属敌人在你的地点：谈判。对该敌人下最多两个不同的命令(每个命令每轮仅限一次)——\n你可以将三张号令真言加入自己牌库。在你使用一张号令真言下命令时，也对其他每个附属了你一张号令真言的敌人下同样的命令。",
