    "code": "09100",
    "cost": 1,
    "customizationChange": "When you play Makeshift Trap, you may increase or decrease its uses by 1.\nForced - At the end of the round, if there are one or more enemies at attached location: Remove 1 time from Makeshift Trap.\nFast. Play during any [fast] window.\nWhen you remove 1 or more time from Makeshift Trap, deal 1 damage to an enemy at attached location.\nAttach to your location, or to a revealed connecting location.\nEach non-[[Elite]] enemy at attached location get -1 fight and -1 evade, and cannot move or make attacks of opportunity.\nCustomizable. Uses (2 time). When Makeshift Trap has no time, discard it and deal 3 damage to each enemy and investigator at attached location.",
    "customizationChangeZh": "在你打出简易陷阱时，你可以将其使用提高或降低1点。\n强制 - 当一轮结束时，如果有敌人在被附属的地点：移除简易陷阱的1计时。\n快速。可在任何[fast]时间段期间打出。\n在你移除简易陷阱的计时时，对附属地点的一个敌人造成1点伤害。\n附属到你所在地点，或一个已揭示的连接地点。\n附属地点的每个非[[精英]]敌人得到-1攻击和-1躲避，并且不能移动，不能进行趁乱攻击。\n定制。使用(2计时)。如果简易陷阱没有计时，将其弃掉并对附属地点的每个敌人和每位调查员造成3点伤害。",
