    "customizationText": "□ Improved Timer. When you play Makeshift Trap, you may increase or decrease its uses by 1.\n□ Tripwire. Only trigger Makeshift Trap's forced ability if there are 1 or more enemies at attached location.\n□□ Simple. Makeshift Trap gains fast and \"play during any [fast] window.\"\n□□ Poisonous. When you remove 1 or more time from Makeshift Trap, deal 1 damage to an enemy at attached location.\n□□ Remote Configuration. When you play Makeshift Trap, you may attach it to a revealed connecting location.\n□□□ Net. Non-[[Elite]] enemies at attached location cannot move or make attacks of opportunity.\n□□□□ Explosive Device. When Makeshift Trap has no time and is discarded, deal 3 damage to each enemy and investigator at attached location.",
    "customizationTextZh": "□优化计时器。在你打出简易陷阱时，你可以将其使用提高或降低1点。\n□绊线。如果简易陷阱附属地点没有敌人，则不触发其强制能力。\n□□轻便。简易陷阱获得快速和“可在任何[fast]时间段期间打出。”\n□□带毒。在你移除简易陷阱的计时时，对附属地点的一个敌人造成1点伤害。\n□□远程布置。在你打出简易陷阱时，你可以将其附属到一个已揭示的连接地点。\n□□□束网。附属地点的非[[精英]]敌人不能移动，也不能进行趁乱攻击。\n□□□□爆炸装置。在简易陷阱没有计时并被弃掉时，对附属地点的每个敌人和每位调查员造成3点伤害。",
