    "text": "[reaction] When you draw a non-weakness card from the top of your deck, before resolving any of its effects, exhaust Katja Eastbank: Place that card facedown beneath her (limit 5 cards beneath her). Draw a new card to replace it.\n[action]: Draw any card beneath Katja Eastbank.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]在你从自己牌库顶抽取一张非弱点卡牌时，结算其任何效果前，横置卡蒂亚·伊斯特班克：将该卡牌正面朝下放在她底下(她底下仅限5张卡牌)。抽取一张新卡牌以替代。\n[action]：抽取卡蒂亚·伊斯特班克底下的任意一张卡牌。",
