    "text": "Forced - At the start of the game, or after the agenda deck resets: Set the amount of doom on this agenda to 1 [per_investigator].\nForced - After you expose a decoy: La Chica Roja attacks you.\n(Hint - when this agenda advances, La Chica Roja will collect one of the pieces she seeks!)",
    "textZh": "强制 - 当游戏开始时，或密谋牌库重置后：将本密谋上的毁灭标记数量设为1[per_investigator]。\n强制 - 你揭露诱饵后：红衣女郎攻击你。\n(提示：在本密谋推进时，红衣女郎会得到其中一块碎片！)",
