    "provenanceId": "09548",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "La Chica Roja gains: \"[action] Parley. Test [intellect] or [agility] (6) to outsmart the thief. You may spend 1 clue to reduce this test's difficulty by 2. If you fail, La Chica Roja attacks you.\"\nObjective - If La Chica Roja would be defeated, instead advance.\nObjective - If an investigator successfully parleys with La Chica Roja, advance.",
    "textZh": "红衣女郎获得：“[action]：谈判。检定[intellect]或[agility](6)来胜过窃贼一筹。你可以花费1个线索以将本次检定难度降低2点。如果你检定失败，红衣女郎攻击你。”\n目标 - 如果红衣女郎将要被击败，改为推进。\n目标 - 如果有调查员与红衣女郎谈判，推进。",
