    "text": "If your difficulty level is...\n- ...Easy, X is 2.\n- ...Standard, X is 3.\n - ...Hard, X is 4.\n- ...Expert, X is 5.\n[action]: Resign. Looks like La Chica Roja wins this game.",
    "textZh": "如果你的难度等级为……\n- ……简单，X为2。\n- ……普通，X为3。\n- ……困难，X为4。\n- ……专家，X为5。\n[action]：撤退。看来这次是红衣女郎赢了。",
