    "text": "Easy / Standard\n[skull]: -X. X is the highest number of clues on a [[Cultist]] enemy in play, to a maximum of 3. (If it is act 3, X is 3.)\n[cultist]: -5. You may place 1 doom on the nearest [[Cultist]] enemy to change this token's modifier to -1.\n[tablet]: -3. If you fail, place 1 of your clues on your location.\n[elder_thing]: -2. If you fail, place 1 doom on the nearest [[Cultist]] enemy.",
    "textZh": "简单/普通\n[skull]：-X。X为场上线索标记最多的[[异教徒]]敌人上的线索标记数，最多为3。(如果是场景3，则X为3。)\n[cultist]：-5。你可以在最近的[[异教徒]]敌人上放置1个毁灭标记以将本标记的修正值变为-1。\n[tablet]：-3。如果你检定失败，将你的1个线索放到你所在地点。\n[elder_thing]：-2。如果你检定失败，在最近的[[异教徒]]敌人上放置1个毁灭标记。",
