    "provenanceId": "09570",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Objective - \"Get this thing out of here!\" If an investigator with The Twisted Antiprism is at Galata Docks, you may proceed to (→R1) (page 25).\nObjective - \"Don't let them get away with the Key!\" If an enemy with The Twisted Antiprism is at Galata Docks, or if the investigator with The Twisted Antiprism is defeated, proceed to (→R6) (page 25).",
    "textZh": "目标 - “拿上东西快走！”如果附属了扭曲反棱镜的调查员在加拉塔码头，你可以进入(→结局1)(第25页)。\n目标 - “别让他们带着钥匙跑了！”如果附属了扭曲反棱镜的敌人在加拉塔码头，或附属了扭曲反棱镜的调查员被击败，进入(→结局6)(第25页)。(FAQ v2.1)",
    "traits": [],
