    "text": "Each non-weakness enemy gains: \"Hunter. Prey - Investigator with The Twisted Antiprism.\" If The Twisted Antiprism is attached to that enemy, it instead gains \"Patrol (Galata Docks).\"\nForced - When 1 or more doom would be placed on an enemy: It instead moves and attacks as if it were the enemy phase (without exhausting).\nForced - After a non-weakness enemy attacks the investigator with The Twisted Antiprism: Attach The Twisted Antiprism to that enemy, [[Unstable]] side faceup. Then, that enemy shifts it.\n[reaction] After you evade or defeat the enemy with The Twisted Antiprism: Take control of The Twisted Antiprism, attaching it to your investigator.",
    "textZh": "每个非弱点敌人获得：“猎手。猎物 - 拥有扭曲反棱镜的调查员。”如果扭曲反棱镜附属到该敌人，它改为获得“巡逻(加拉塔码头)。”\n强制 - 在毁灭标记将要放置到敌人时：改为该敌人移动并攻击，如同此刻是敌军阶段(不要横置)。\n强制 - 在非弱点敌人攻击有扭曲反棱镜的调查员后：将扭曲反棱镜附属到该敌人，[[动荡]]面朝上。然后，该敌人变换它。\n[reaction]你躲避或击败有扭曲反棱镜的敌人后：控制扭曲反棱镜，将其附属到你的调查员。",
