    "text": "Hagia Sophia gets +3 shroud for each study token on it.\n[action]: Place 1 [per_investigator] clues on Hagia Sophia (from the token pool). Place 1 resource on Hagia Sophia (also from the token pool), as a study token.",
    "textZh": "圣索菲亚上每有一个研究标记，得到+3隐藏值。\n[action]:(从供应堆)将1[per_investigator]个线索放到圣索菲亚上。将1资源(也从供应堆拿取)放到圣索菲亚上，作为一个研究标记。",
