    "subnameZh": "朱红头巾女士",
    "text": "[fast] Exhaust Ece Şahin: Look at the top card of any investigator's deck. If it is not a weakness, you may place it facedown beneath Ece Sahin (limit 5 cards beneath her).\nForced - After any key is shifted: The owner of each card beneath Ece Şahin draws that card.",
    "textZh": "[free]横置艾婕·萨辛：查看任意一位调查员牌库顶的卡牌。如果它不是弱点，你可以将它正面朝下放在艾婕·萨辛底下(她底下仅限5张卡牌)。\n强制 - 在任意钥匙变换后：艾婕·萨辛底下每张卡牌的所有者抽取该卡牌。",
