    "provenanceId": "09595",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[action]: Resign. \"The deal's off!\" You leave Desi and his crew to their fate.\nForced - If Desiderio Delgado Álvarez leaves play: Set him aside, out of play. Each investigator takes 1 horror.",
    "textZh": "[action]：撤退。“交易结束了！”你任凭德西和他的手下自生自灭。\n强制 - 如果德西德柔·戴佳多·欧瓦瑞兹离场：将他放在一边，位于场外。每位调查员受到1点恐惧。",
