    "text": "[reaction] When an investigator would resolve an enemy's concealed X keyword, spend X clues, as a group: Spawn it engaged with that investigator instead.\n[action]: Resign. You leave Desi and his crew to their fate.\nObjective - If there are no enemies in the shadows, investigators may spend the requisite clues to advance.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]在调查员将要结算敌人的隐匿X关键词时，共同花费X个线索：改为生成该敌人，与结算其关键词的调查员交战。\n[action]：撤退。你任凭德西和他的手下自生自灭。\n目标 - 如果阴影中没有敌人，调查员可以花费所需的线索以推进。",
