    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "Negotiations didn't go so well after all.",
    "flavorZh": "看来谈判终究没什么用。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "illustrator": "Carlos Palma Cruchaga",
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/09597.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "False Step (v. II)",
    "nameZh": "一失足(版本二)",
    "originalCode": "09597",
    "pack": "tskc",
    "packName": "The Scarlet Keys Campaign Expansion",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 97,
    "provenanceId": "09597",
    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Forced - At the end of the enemy phase: Deal X total damage to investigators at Café Luna, divided as they wish. X is the number of enemies in the shadows.\n[reaction] After a [[Coterie]] enemy takes any amount of damage: Discover half that many clues at Café Luna (rounded down).",
    "textZh": "强制 - 当敌军阶段结束时：对月下餐厅的调查员造成总计X点伤害，自由分配。X为阴影中敌人的数量。\n[reaction]在[[结社]]敌人受到任意数量的伤害后：在月下餐厅发现该数量一半的线索(向下取整)。",
