    "text": "[reaction] After you successfully investigate Jardines de la Tropical by 3 or more: Choose a set-aside hollow. Its owner draws it.\nForced - After you fail by 3 or more while investigating Jardines de la Tropical: Choose a non-weakness card in your hand and set it aside, out of play, as a hollow.",
    "textZh": "[reaction]在你成功调查热带花园且超过难度至少3点后：选择一个放在一边的空洞。其所有者将其抽取。\n强制 - 你调查热带花园时检定失败且低于难度至少3点后：选择你手中一张非弱点卡牌，将其放在一边，位于场外，作为一个空洞。",
