    "provenanceId": "09660",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Easy / Standard\n[skull]: -X. X is half the number of charges on The Shade Reaper, rounded up (X cannot be greater than 6).\n[cultist]: -4. If you fail by 2 or more, place 1 charge on The Shade Reaper.\n[tablet]: -1. If you are at a location with a [[Geist]] enemy, reveal an additional chaos token.\n[elder_thing]: -4. You may place 1 charge on The Shade Reaper to treat this token's modifier as 0 instead.",
    "textZh": "简单/普通\n[skull]：-X。X为影穑上充能数的一半，向上取整(X不能大于6)。\n[cultist]：-4。如果你检定失败且低于难度至少2点，在影穑上放置1充能。\n[tablet]：-1。如果你所在地点有[[灵怪]]敌人，揭示额外一个混乱标记。\n[elder_thing]：-4。你可以在影穑上放置1充能，以将本标记的修正值改为视作0。",
