    "text": "[[Geist]] enemies cannot leave [[Haunted]] locations.\nObjective - Quell the restless spirits before they are consumed by Tzu San Niang! At the end of the round, if there are no non-weakness [[Geist]] enemies in play, advance.",
    "textZh": "[[灵怪]]敌人不能离开[[闹鬼]]地点。\n目标 - 赶在朱三娘吞食魂灵之前，使他们安息！当一轮结束时，如果场上没有非弱点[[灵怪]]敌人，推进。",
