  "09674d": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "",
    "backTextZh": "",
    "code": "09674d",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "shades_of_suffering",
    "encounterName": "Shades of Suffering",
    "encounterPosition": 16,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "The theater fills with cacophonous laughter as a spindly shape on the paper screen grows menacing. Melati strides forward, her voice firm. \"I know that you are restless,\" she says. \"But you have nothing to fear from us.\" She intones a low chant in Malay.",
    "flavorZh": "剧场里充满刺耳的笑声，纸幕上细长的身影变得骇人。美拉提大步上前，声音坚定：“我知道你不得安宁，但你无需害怕我们。”她用马来语低声吟唱。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Timorous Shadows",
    "nameZh": "羞怯的阴影",
    "originalCode": "09674d",
    "pack": "tskc",
    "packName": "The Scarlet Keys Campaign Expansion",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 174,
    "provenanceId": "09674d",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "If an investigator has \"peered beyond,\" read the following (otherwise, flip this card back to its enemy side, heal all damage from it, disengage it from all investigators, and exhaust it):\n\"It is the spirit of a girl. She watched many stories unfold in this very theater,\" says Melati. The shadow on the screen forms a hungry smile filled with sharp teeth that turns to a fearful frown. \"She is loathe to let go of this place, for she does not know if her story will continue.\" As Melati translates, you assure the spirit that you have looked beyond the veil and she can leave this plane of existence. As the hoary shadows dissipate, you feel a coldness as you reflect on what you saw - and didn't see - in the beyond. Was it wrong to reassure her?\nAdd this card to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "剧场里响起了刺耳的笑声，纸幕上细长的身影变得骇人。美拉提大步上前，声音中气十足：“我知道你不得安宁，但你无需害怕我们。”她用马来语低吟着。\n如果有调查员“眺望彼端”，阅读下列文本(否则，将本卡牌翻回敌人面，治愈其全部伤害，横置并与所有调查员解除交战)：\n“是个女孩的魂灵。她在这个剧场里看过许多故事。”美拉提告诉你。纸幕上的影子先是露出一个饥饿的笑容，满口尖牙，随即又皱起眉头，十分可怕。“她讨厌离开这里，因为她不知道自己的故事是否还能继续。”你借由美拉提翻译，向这个魂灵保证自己见过帷幕彼端，她可以离开此界。旧影消散，你意识到自己在彼端看见了——与没看见什么，不禁一阵恶寒。给她这样的保证，真的没错吗？\n将本卡牌加入胜利区。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/09674d",
    "victory": 1
  },
