  "09675d": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "",
    "backTextZh": "",
    "code": "09675d",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "shades_of_suffering",
    "encounterName": "Shades of Suffering",
    "encounterPosition": 18,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "The mines are pocked with deep pits brimming with dark, black rainwater. As you traverse the treacherous paths, spectral hands dart out of the water, grasping at you. Melati holds up one hand and turns her ear, as if listening for a whisper.",
    "flavorZh": "矿区遍布盛满漆黑雨水的深坑。你走过危险小径时，幽魂之手从水中猛然伸出，试图抓住你。美拉提抬起一只手，侧耳倾听，仿佛在听低语。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Exhume the Bones",
    "nameZh": "发掘遗骨",
    "originalCode": "09675d",
    "pack": "tskc",
    "packName": "The Scarlet Keys Campaign Expansion",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 175,
    "provenanceId": "09675d",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "If an investigator has \"found hidden bones,\" read the following (otherwise, flip this card back to its enemy side, heal all damage from it, disengage it from all investigators, and exhaust it):\n\"These are the spirits of fallen miners,\" says Melati, gesturing to the oily dark water. \"Compelled by Tzu San Niang's relentless greed, the foreman of the mine has worked them... well, literally to the bone. Their bodies lie, unburied, in these deep pits.\"\nWith her help, you begin exhuming the bones of the fallen miners. It is gruesome, awful work, but as you do it, you can feel a sense of gratitude wash over you. Only when you are finished can you feel a final wave of relief emanate from your surroundings.\nAdd this card to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "矿区的深坑里都盛满了雨水，看上去一片黑亮。你走过这片危险的区域，水中突然伸出幽魂之手抓住了你。美拉提握住一只手，举到耳边，仿佛在聆听对方的低语。\n如果有调查员“找到了掩埋的遗骨”，阅读下列文本(否则，将本卡牌翻回敌人面，治愈其全部伤害，横置并与所有调查员解除交战)：\n“这些魂灵是死去的矿工。”美拉提指着油污的黑水说道，“由于朱三娘的无尽贪欲，这片矿区的工头将他们……活活剥削至死。他们的遗骨就在这些深坑中，未得安葬。”\n你在她的帮助下开始挖掘这些矿工的遗骨。这项工作阴森骇人。但你辛劳之际，一股感激之情荡涤全身。你最后完成的时候，周边涌起一阵最终解脱的情绪。\n将本卡牌加入胜利区。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/09675d",
    "victory": 1
  },
