  "09676d": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "",
    "backTextZh": "",
    "code": "09676d",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "shades_of_suffering",
    "encounterName": "Shades of Suffering",
    "encounterPosition": 20,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "As Melati entreats the spirit, it turns its head, as if it hears something you can't. The bomoh pulls you aside, a gentle smile upon her face. \"It's searching for something,\" she explains. \"Something that reminds it of home.\"",
    "flavorZh": "美拉提恳求魂灵时，它转过头，仿佛听到你听不见的声音。降头师带着温柔微笑将你拉到一旁：“它在寻找什么，能令它想起家的东西。”",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Familial Pain",
    "nameZh": "家庭分离之痛",
    "originalCode": "09676d",
    "pack": "tskc",
    "packName": "The Scarlet Keys Campaign Expansion",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 176,
    "provenanceId": "09676d",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "If an investigator has \"traded for a kitten,\" read the following (otherwise, flip this card back to its enemy side, heal all damage from it, disengage it from all investigators, and exhaust it):\nMelati gestures for you to hold the kitten out to the spirit. \"This one had two daughters and many cats,\" the bomoh says. \"They simply want to know their loved ones are cared for.\" The spirit reaches out and strokes the kitten's fur with a glimmering, spectral hand.\nAfter speaking rapidly in Malay, Melati looks to you. \"Bringing this animal to the family of the departed would comfort them. I have told the spirit I will bring it as a gift soon.\" When you look, the spirit has vanished.\nAdd this card to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "美拉提对魂灵好言相劝。你发现它转过头，就像听到了什么你听不见的东西。降头师把你拉到一边，露出浅浅的微笑。“它是要寻找什么。”她解释道，“寻找能让它想起家庭的东西。”\n如果有调查员“换到了一只小猫”，阅读下列文本(否则，将本卡牌翻回敌人面，治愈其全部伤害，横置并与所有调查员解除交战)：\n美拉提示意你将小猫交给魂灵。“这位有两个女儿，养了很多只猫。”降头师说道，“它想知道自己所爱之人过得好不好。”魂灵伸出闪亮的幽魂之手，摸了摸小猫的皮毛。\n她快速地讲了一串马来语后，看向了你。“把这个小东西带给死者的家人，能安慰他们几分。我已经告诉魂灵，会把它当作礼物带上。”你再回头看去，魂灵已经消失了。\n将本卡牌加入胜利区。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/09676d",
    "victory": 1
  },
