    "stage": 3,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "As an additional cost to enter an unrevealed location, investigators at your location must spend 1[per_investigator] clues, as a group.\n[reaction] After you expose a location: Move to that location (from an adjacent location).\n[fast] Take 1 direct damage or 1 direct horror: Look at the revealed side of a concealed mini-card (without exposing it). (Group limit once per round.)",
    "textZh": "作为进入未揭示地点的额外费用，你所在地点的调查员必须共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索。\n[reaction]你揭露地点后：(从相邻地点)移动到该地点。\n[free]受到1点直接伤害或1点直接恐惧：查看任意一张隐匿迷你卡牌的已揭示面(不将其揭露)。(团队每轮仅限一次。)",
