    "stage": 2,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "The Red-Gloved Man cannot be discarded or drawn.\n[action] If Mimetic Nemesis is at your location, spend 1 clue: Deal 2 damage to it. This action does not provoke attacks of opportunity from Mimetic Nemesis.\nObjective - When The Red-Gloved man enters play, advance.",
    "textZh": "戴红手套的男子不能被弃掉或抽取。\n[action]如果拟态克星在你的地点，花费1个线索：对它造成2点伤害。本行动不会触发拟态克星的趁乱攻击。\n目标 - 在戴红手套的男子入场时，推进。",
