    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "<span class='tsk-glyphs'>So you deign to scale our monument? Our relic to the many worlds we have devoured? Oh yes; yours is not the first. Very well then. Climb to the vertex, if you can, and behold your ruin.</span>",
    "flavorZh": "一段加密的信息……",
