    "encounterName": "Congress of the Keys",
    "encounterPosition": 4,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "<span class='tsk-glyphs'>Hark! You approach your own ruin. Its scarlet robes are the skin of foes long since vanquished. Its embroidery woven with the arteries of Kings long devoured. Its crown forged from the obelisks of once-great civilizations. You are just another meal. You, too, will be forgotten. And in the end only we shall reign.</span>",
