    "encounterPosition": 9,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "A terrible feeling of vertigo washes over you as you begin to scale the cyclopean, Escheresque steps.\nOnly one way to go now.",
    "flavorZh": "你面前的无穷阶梯仿佛埃舍尔笔下的虚幻场景。你向上攀爬，只感到一阵骇人的头晕目眩。\n\n只有一条路可走。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
