    "text": "[action] Flip a [[Stable]] key you control to its [[Unstable]] side: Remove an exposed decoy from the game.\nObjective - If Mimetic Nemesis is defeated, advance.",
    "textZh": "[action]将你控制的一个[[稳定]]钥匙翻至[[动荡]]面：将一个已揭露的诱饵从游戏中移除。\n目标 - 如果拟态克星被击败，推进。",
