    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "And o'er it all loomed the blasphemous effigy,\na ruinous testament to conquered worlds.\n - Virgil Gray, \"In the Court of the Outsiders\"",
    "flavorZh": "这座亵渎的巨像，证明被征服的世界遭到了毁灭。维吉尔·格雷，《身临域外之廷》",
