    "text": "Forced - When a concealed mini-card around Gravity-Defying Climb is exposed: If it is...\n- ...the next in the sequence listed on The Towering Vertex, it remains in play and exposed, and you may expose another concealed mini-card.\n- ...any other mini-card, flip it and each other concealed mini-card facedown (without shuffling them).",
    "textZh": "强制 - 在环绕悖逆重力之阶的隐匿迷你卡牌被揭露时：如果它是……\n- ……睥睨众生之巅上所列顺序的下一位，则它留在场上，保持揭露，且你可以揭露另一张隐匿迷你卡牌。\n- ……其他任意迷你卡牌，将其与其他每张隐匿迷你卡牌翻至正面朝下(不要混洗)。",
