    "text": "Revelation - Put Distorted Reasoning into play in your threat area.\nYou cannot perform the same type of action twice in a row. (Types include activate, engage, evade, fight, investigate, move, play, resource, and draw.)\nForced - At the end of your turn: Test [willpower] (3). If you succeed, discard Distorted Reasoning.",
    "textZh": "显现 - 将理智扭曲放置入场，放到你的威胁区域。\n你不能连续执行同一类型的行动。(类型包括激活、交战、躲避、攻击、调查、移动、打出、资源和抽取。)\n强制 - 当你的回合结束时：检定[willpower](3)。如果你检定成功，弃掉理智扭曲。",
