    "shroud": 4,
    "subname": "Dangerous Exit",
    "subnameZh": "危险出口",
    "text": "When a [[Stowaway]] enemy is drawn, spawn it at Apiary Entrance instead of its normal spawn location.\n[action] Spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Place a [[Cultist]] asset or enemy at this location underneath the act.\n[action]: Resign. You make your exit.",
    "textZh": "抽取一名[[偷渡者]]敌人时，改为将其生成在养育场入口，而非其通常生成地点。\n[action]调查员共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索：将本地点一张[[异教徒]]支援或敌人放在本场景下方。\n[action]：撤退。你离开这里。",
