    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Ancient Relic [tdc_rune_s]",
    "nameZh": "古代遗物[tdc_rune_s]",
    "originalCode": "11581b",
    "pack": "tdcc",
    "packName": "The Drowned City Campaign Expansion",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 81,
    "provenanceId": "11581b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Twisting portions of the relic unlocks a small cylinder in the center. Inside the cylinder is an even smaller version of the same relic, and within the smaller relic is a glittering gem. Holding it up to the light projects a series of small dots that form some kind of code. One of the expedition members identifies it as a blueprint of sorts: the symbols appear to be instructions for repairing some kind of machine.\nYou discover this glyph:\n[tdc_rune_s]\nIn your Campaign Log, record \"Machine\" under [tdc_rune_s] on the glyph record. This glyph has been translated.\nAdd this card to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "扭转遗物的部分构造，打开中央的一个小圆柱。圆柱内还有一个更小的同样遗物，较小的遗物中则嵌着一颗闪耀的宝石。将它举向光线时，投射出一系列小点，组成某种代码。一名远征队成员辨认出那像是一张蓝图：这些符号似乎是修复某种机器的指令。\n你发现了这个符文：\n[tdc_rune_s]\n在剧本日志的符文记录中，于[tdc_rune_s]下记录“机器”。该符文已被翻译。\n将本卡牌加入胜利区。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
