    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "the_grand_vault",
    "encounterName": "The Grand Vault",
    "encounterPosition": 28,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavorZh": "",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Ancient Vault [tdc_rune_p]",
    "nameZh": "古代秘库[tdc_rune_p]",
    "originalCode": "11610b",
    "pack": "tdcc",
    "packName": "The Drowned City Campaign Expansion",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 28,
    "provenanceId": "11610b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "The room within the vault is dark and featureless, save for an incandescent, smoky orb suspended in the center. Inspecting it closer, you find a full-scale model of an alien planet. Small storm systems move along the surface at an accelerated rate, swirling and dissipating in seconds. When you touch it, your senses are assailed by invisible gales, torrential rain, and a crack of thunder. Lines of swirling alien writing appear on the globe, conveying a record of an ancient storm.\nYou discover this glyph:\n[tdc_rune_p]\nIn your Campaign Log, record \"Weather\" under [tdc_rune_p] on the glyph record. This glyph has been translated.\nAdd this card to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "秘库内的房间黑暗而空无一物，只有一颗炽亮、冒着烟雾的球体悬浮在中央。仔细观察后，你发现那是一颗外星行星的等比例模型。小型风暴系统以加快的速度沿表面移动，数秒内盘旋又消散。触碰它时，无形的狂风、暴雨和雷鸣猛然冲击你的感官。球体上浮现蜿蜒的外星文字，传达着一场远古风暴的记录。\n你发现了这个符文：\n[tdc_rune_p]\n在剧本日志的符文记录中，于[tdc_rune_p]下记录“天气”。该符文已被翻译。\n将本卡牌加入胜利区。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
