    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "obsidian_canyons",
    "encounterName": "Obsidian Canyons",
    "encounterPosition": 30,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "A brilliant map of distant nebulae fills the room, bursting with color and light. A cerulean glob near the edge draws your attention. Staring at it fills your mind with a sharp, chittering alien language and the crash of waves. As you begin to mouth the strange language, a symbol glimmers in the cerulean sphere. Looking at it fills you with a deep yearning, an instinct to dive into deep underwater nests. Is this a word you learned, or an ancient, primordial memory recalled?",
    "flavorZh": "一张璀璨的遥远星云地图充满房间，爆发出色彩与光芒。边缘附近一颗天蓝色球体吸引了你的注意。凝视它，尖锐的啁啾外星语言与海浪拍击声充满你的心智。你开始念出这门奇异语言时，一个符号在天蓝色球体中闪烁。看着它，你心中涌起强烈渴望，本能地想潜入深海巢穴。这是你学会的一个词，还是被唤起的远古原始记忆？",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Glyph Orrery [tdc_rune_d]",
    "nameZh": "符文星盘仪[tdc_rune_d]",
    "originalCode": "11662b",
    "pack": "tdcc",
    "packName": "The Drowned City Campaign Expansion",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 162,
    "provenanceId": "11662b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "You discover this glyph:\n[tdc_rune_d]\nIn your Campaign Log, record \"Wave\" under [tdc_rune_d] on the glyph record. This glyph has been translated.\nFlip this card back over to its location side. It cannot be flipped over again.",
    "textZh": "你发现了这个符文：\n[tdc_rune_d]\n在剧本日志的符文记录中，于[tdc_rune_d]下记录“波浪”。该符文已被翻译。\n将本卡牌翻回地点面。其不能再次被翻面。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/11662b"
