    "quantity": 1,
    "stage": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[fast] During an attack at your location, spend 1 clue: That attack deals +1 damage. (Max once per attack.)\nObjective - When the round ends, if there are 3 [[Cthulhu]] enemies in the victory display, advance.",
    "textZh": "[fast]在你所在地点的一次攻击期间，花费1个线索：本次攻击造成的伤害+1。(每次攻击限一次。)\n目标 - 一轮结束时，如果胜利区有3名[[克苏鲁]]敌人，推进。",
