    "text": "[action] Spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group, and place an [[Artifact]] asset you control in the victory display: Place 1 resource (from the token pool) on your location, as a sigil.\nForced - When the enemy phase ends: Draw the top card of the Cthulhu deck.\nObjective - Banish the awakened dreamer! If each [[Cthulhu]] enemy is in the victory display and there are 5 locations with sigils on them, immediately advance.",
    "textZh": "[action]调查员共同花费1[per_investigator]个线索，并将你控制的一张[[神器]]支援放入胜利区：在你所在地点放置1个资源(从标记池中)，作为印记。\n强制 - 敌军阶段结束时：抽取克苏鲁牌库顶的1张卡牌。\n目标 - 放逐苏醒的梦者！如果每名[[克苏鲁]]敌人均位于胜利区，且有5处地点上有印记，立刻推进。",
