    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "The objects tumble down through the shaft, making loud banging noises behind the walls and underneath the floor. Hopefully another group can find them...\nTake the cards, tokens, and notes on or underneath this card and place them on or underneath another group's copy of The Vent.\nFlip this card back over.",
    "textZh": "物件沿井道滚落，撞在墙后和地板下，发出巨响。希望另一组能找到它们……\n将本卡牌上或下方的卡牌、标记和记录放到另一组的通风口卡牌上或下方。\n将本卡牌翻回。",
