    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "the_nights_usurper",
    "encounterName": "The Night's Usurper",
    "encounterPosition": 10,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "After what feels like an eternity, you finally reach the top of the subterranean stairs, where a trapdoor leads you to the surface. You find yourself in the large central plaza of a ruined city on the shoreline of a beautiful sky-blue ocean. A pair of colossal winged lion statues guards the entrance to the stairway.",
    "flavorZh": "仿佛经过永恒，你终于抵达地下阶梯的顶端，一扇活板门通向地面。你发现自己身处一座废城宏大的中央广场，城池坐落在天蓝色美丽海洋的岸边。一对巨大的有翼狮像守卫着阶梯入口。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
