    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "the_nights_usurper",
    "encounterName": "The Night's Usurper",
    "encounterPosition": 11,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "The mist grows ever thicker as you make your way deeper into the depths of the abyss. Finally, you come across an open chamber where the mist has receded, and you are greeted by a tall statue of an elderly man with a great bear and a mane of long hair. He rides a chariot formed from a huge seashell, which is pulled by beasts both wondrous and strange.",
    "flavorZh": "你越深入深渊，迷雾便越浓。终于，你来到一间迷雾退散的开阔厅室，一尊高大的雕像迎接了你。那是一名留有浓密胡须与长发的老者，驾着由巨大海螺构成的战车，奇异而惊人的野兽正牵引着它。",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/83026b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "linkedCardCode": "83026a",
    "linkedToCode": "83026a",
    "linkedToName": "Mist-Filled Caverns",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "Effigy of Nodens",
    "nameZh": "诺登斯的雕像",
    "originalCode": "83026b",
    "pack": "guardians",
    "packName": "Guardians of the Abyss",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 26,
    "provenanceId": "83026b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "You must decide (choose one):\n- Test [willpower] (2) to entreat the entity depicted in this statue for aid. If you succeed, remember that you \"pled for help.\"\n- Test [combat] (2) to overthrow the statue. If you succeed, it topples over and shatters into pieces on the jagged cavern floor; remember that you \"affronted the ruler of this realm.\"\nRegardless of your choice and whether you succeed or fail the indicated skill test, flip this card back over.",
    "textZh": "你必须作出决定(选择以下一项)：\n- 进行一次[willpower](2)检定，以向雕像所描绘的存在祈求帮助。如果你成功，记住你\"寻求了帮助\"。\n- 进行一次[combat](2)检定以推翻雕像。如果你成功，雕像翻倒，在犬牙交错的洞穴地面上摔成碎片；记住你\"触怒了这片领域的主人\"。\n无论你选择哪一项，也无论你是否成功通过指定的技能检定，都将本卡牌翻面。",
    "traits": [],
    "traitsZh": [],
