  "83031b": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "",
    "backTextZh": "",
    "code": "83031b",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "brotherhood_of_the_beast",
    "encounterName": "Brotherhood of the Beast",
    "encounterPosition": 1,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "\"I didn't have a choice!\" Layla cries. \"The things I've read… The records I've translated… They all point to one thing,\" she claims. \"Destruction. Ruin. We can't stop it. All we can do is forge a place for our loved ones in the rubble.\" You tell her that you will do everything in your power to stop this 'destruction', but she shakes her head, tears in her eyes. \"It's a fool's errand. But… \" Layla takes a deep breath as she considers her options. \"Promise you'll keep my daughter and my son safe, and I'll help you in any way I can.\"",
    "flavorZh": "\"我别无选择！\"莱拉喊道，\"我读过的东西……我翻译的记录……它们全都指向一件事。\"她断言，\"毁灭。破灭。我们无法阻止。我们能做的，只是在废墟中为所爱之人开辟一处容身之地。\"你告诉她会竭尽全力阻止这场\"毁灭\"，但她摇头，眼中含泪。\"这是一件徒劳无功的事。不过……\"莱拉深吸一口气，思考着自己的选择。\"答应我保护好我的女儿和儿子，我就会尽我所能帮助你。\"",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/83031b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "The Translator's Evidence",
    "nameZh": "译者的证据",
    "originalCode": "83031b",
    "pack": "guardians",
    "packName": "Guardians of the Abyss",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 31,
    "provenanceId": "83031b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "After an investigator has \"discovered an ancient tablet,\" read the following (if this task has already been completed, read the following immediately):\nYou bring the tablet to Dr. El Masri, and she translates it to the best of her ability. \"When the Choice is made, He shall be empowered by a thousand sacrifices from the sacred land.\" She blinks a few times, trying to process what it means. \"How many coma patients are there right now?\" she asks, wide-eyed.\nRemove 1 strength from the abyss. (Group limit once per game.)",
    "textZh": "一位调查员\"发现了一块古代石板\"后，阅读以下内容(如果此任务已完成，立即阅读以下内容)：\n你将石板带给艾尔·马斯里博士，她尽自己所能将其翻译出来。\"抉择一旦作出，祂将从圣地的一千名祭品中获得力量。\"她眨了几下眼睛，试图理解其中的含义。\"现在有多少昏迷病人？\"她睁大眼睛问道。\n将深渊之力减弱1点。(每局游戏团队限一次。)",
    "traits": [
      "Evidence"
    ],
    "traitsZh": [
      "证据"
    ],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/83031b",
    "victory": 1
  },
