    "subnameZh": "恶兽的女祭司",
    "text": "Spawn - Temple Courtyard.\n[action]: Parley. Test [willpower] (7). You may take up to 3 horror to reduce the difficulty of this test by 2 for each horror taken in this way. If you succeed, add Nadia Nimr to the victory display. If you fail, Nadia Nimr attacks you.",
