  "83033b": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "",
    "backTextZh": "",
    "code": "83033b",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "brotherhood_of_the_beast",
    "encounterName": "Brotherhood of the Beast",
    "encounterPosition": 3,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "Nadia's faith is shaken. Scared and confused, she finally gives in. \"There is only one residence in Cairo they told us to spare,\" she explains. \"None of us know why, or what their connection is to the Brotherhood. All we know is they were not to be disturbed.\" She hesitantly gives you a small brass key. \"… So maybe it's time to disturb them. The building's door is marked with lamb's blood.\"",
    "flavorZh": "纳迪娅的信仰动摇了。她惊慌失措、困惑不已，最终屈服。\"他们只让我们放过开罗城中的一个地方。\"她解释道，\"没人知道为什么，也没人知道那里与兄弟会有何联系。我们只知道不能打扰他们。\"她犹豫着交给你一把小巧的黄铜钥匙。\"也许现在该去打扰他们了。那地方的门上有羔羊之血留下的标记。\"",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/83033b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "The Priestess's Evidence",
    "nameZh": "女祭司的证据",
    "originalCode": "83033b",
    "pack": "guardians",
    "packName": "Guardians of the Abyss",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 33,
    "provenanceId": "83033b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "After an investigator has \"found a door marked with blood,\" read the following (if this task has already been completed, read the following immediately):\nUsing the key Nadia gave you, you enter the marked residence. To your surprise, there is nobody inside - only the faint stench of rot and aged leather. The basement of the residence is littered with old books, records kept by the Brotherhood and its many agents. They will take some time to peruse, but a lead is a lead.\nRemove 1 strength from the abyss. (Group limit once per game.)",
    "textZh": "一位调查员\"找到了一扇用血标记的门\"后，阅读以下内容(如果此任务已完成，立即阅读以下内容)：\n你用纳迪娅给你的钥匙进入标记的住所。令你惊讶的是，里面空无一人，只有淡淡的腐臭与陈年皮革气味。住所的地下室散落着旧书，以及兄弟会和其众多特工留下的记录。要仔细查阅它们需要一些时间，但线索总归是线索。\n将深渊之力减弱1点。(每局游戏团队限一次。)",
    "traits": [
      "Evidence"
    ],
    "traitsZh": [
      "证据"
    ],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/83033b",
    "victory": 1
  },
