    "subname": "Seedy Salesman",
    "subnameZh": "阴暗的商贩",
    "text": "Spawn - Cairo Bazaar.\n[action]: Parley. Test [intellect] (7). You may spend up to 5 resources to reduce the difficulty of this test by 1 for each resource spent in this way. If you succeed, add Farid to the victory display. If you fail, Farid attacks you.",
    "textZh": "生成 - 开罗巴扎。\n[action]：谈判。进行一次[intellect](7)检定。你可以花费至多5个资源；以此方式每花费1个资源，本次检定难度-1。如果你成功，将法里德加入胜利牌区。如果你失败，法里德攻击你。",
