  "83034b": {
    "availability": "catalog-only",
    "backFlavorZh": "",
    "backNameZh": "",
    "backText": "",
    "backTextZh": "",
    "code": "83034b",
    "customizationChange": "",
    "customizationChangeZh": "",
    "customizationText": "",
    "customizationTextZh": "",
    "dataStatus": "validated",
    "doubleSided": false,
    "effectStatus": "unimplemented",
    "encounterCode": "brotherhood_of_the_beast",
    "encounterName": "Brotherhood of the Beast",
    "encounterPosition": 4,
    "exceptional": false,
    "exile": false,
    "factionName": "Mythos",
    "flavor": "\"All right, all right,\" Farid relents, \" I'm a businessman, not a soldier. Strike a deal with me, and I'll tell you what I know. Then I'll skip out of town and be out of your hair.\" You ask what he wants. \"There's a vault in the abandoned temple to the east. Word is, there are a lot of old, valuable artifacts in there. The kind that would fetch a high price on the black market.\" He grins toothily. \"Get me into that temple, and I'm all yours. Deal?\"",
    "flavorZh": "\"好吧，好吧。\"法里德的态度软化下来，\"我是商人，不是战士。我们做个交易，我就把知道的一切告诉你，然后逃出这座城市，不再烦你。\"你问他想要什么。\"东边一座废弃的神庙里有间地穴。传言里面满是珍奇古物，就是那种能在黑市卖大价钱的东西。\"他咧嘴一笑，露出一口牙齿。\"带我进入神庙，我就听你的。成交吗？\"",
    "healthPerInvestigator": false,
    "hidden": true,
    "icons": {},
    "imageStatus": "unresolved",
    "imagesrc": "/bundles/cards/83034b.png",
    "klass": "mythos",
    "localeStatus": "complete",
    "myriad": false,
    "name": "The Salesman's Evidence",
    "nameZh": "商贩的证据",
    "originalCode": "83034b",
    "pack": "guardians",
    "packName": "Guardians of the Abyss",
    "permanent": false,
    "position": 34,
    "provenanceId": "83034b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "After an investigator has \"broken into a deserted temple,\" read the following (if this task has already been completed, read the following immediately):\nFarid grins wide as he scoops golden idols into his rucksack. You press him for information before he gets too excited. \"Look, they promised me wealth beyond my wildest dreams. Even I have my price, you know?\" He throws up his hands, resigned. \"Let me show you my records. I've done a lot of 'business' in the last few months. That'll point you in the right direction.\"\nRemove 1 strength from the abyss. (Group limit once per game.)",
    "textZh": "一位调查员\"闯入一间废弃的神庙\"后，阅读以下内容(如果此任务已完成，立即阅读以下内容)：\n法里德将黄金偶像塞进背包，笑得合不拢嘴。趁他还没有兴奋得忘乎所以，你向他追问情报。\"听着，他们答应给我超乎想象的财富。你知道的，就连我也有自己的价码。\"他认命地举起双手。\"让我给你看看我的记录。过去几个月我做了很多'生意'。它们会给你指明正确的方向。\"\n将深渊之力减弱1点。(每局游戏团队限一次。)",
    "traits": [
      "Evidence"
    ],
    "traitsZh": [
      "证据"
    ],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
    "unique": false,
    "url": "https://arkhamdb.com/card/83034b",
    "victory": 1
  },
