    "text": "Spawn - Outskirts of Cairo.\n[action] As a group, investigators at Professor Nathaniel Taylor's location discard cards from hand with a total of at least 4 [intellect] icons among them: Parley. Add Professor Nathaniel Taylor to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "生成 - 开罗市郊。\n[action]纳撒尼尔·泰勒教授所在地点的调查员作为团队，从手牌中弃掉合计至少具有4个[intellect]图标的卡牌：谈判。将纳撒尼尔·泰勒教授加入胜利牌区。",
