    "text": "[action] If you, Thomas Corrigan, and Mary Zielinski are all at the [[Past]] Miskatonic University: Announce \"Thomas and Mary have met.\"\n[action] If Thomas Corrigan, Mary Zielinski, and Nikola Tesla are all at the same location, spend 2 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Announce \"Thomas and Mary are inspired by Nikola Tesla.\"\n[fast] If you are at the [[Past]] Miskatonic University, spend 2 [per_investigator] resources: Announce \"funding for an observatory has begun.\"\nObjective - If all 3 abilities on this story card have been triggered, add it to the victory display (Place a resource token over each ability when it is triggered).",
    "textZh": "[action]如果你、托马斯·科里根和玛丽·杰林斯基都位于[[过去]]的米斯卡塔尼克大学：宣告\"托马斯和玛丽相识了。\"\n[action]如果托马斯·科里根、玛丽·杰林斯基和尼古拉·特斯拉都位于同一地点，作为团队花费2[per_investigator]个线索：宣告\"托马斯和玛丽受尼古拉·特斯拉启发。\"\n[fast]如果你位于[[过去]]的米斯卡塔尼克大学，花费2[per_investigator]个资源：宣告\"天文台开始筹建。\"\n目标 - 如果本剧情卡牌上的全部3个能力均已触发，将其加入胜利牌区(每个能力触发时，在该能力上放置一个资源标记)。",
