    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[action] If you are at the [[Present]] Miskatonic University and \"funding for an observatory has begun:\" Announce \"the observatory is built.\"\n[action] If \"the observatory is built,\" \"Thomas and Mary are inspired by Nikola Tesla,\" and Thomas Corrigan, Mary Zielinski and Ezra Graves are at the [[Present]] Miskatonic University, spend 2 [per_investigator] clues, as a group (4 [per_investigator] clues, as a group, instead if you are playing in Epic Multiplayer Mode): Announce \"teleportation research has begun.\"\n[fast] If \"Thomas and Mary have met\" and Thomas Corrigan and Mary Zielinski are at Ye Olde Magick Shoppe, spend 1 [per_investigator] resources: Announce \"Corrigan Industries has been founded\" and put the set-aside Corrigan Industries location into play in the future era.\nObjective - If all 3 abilities on this story card have been triggered, add it to the victory display (place a resource token over each ability when it is triggered).",
    "textZh": "[action]如果你位于[[现在]]的米斯卡塔尼克大学，且\"天文台开始筹建\"：宣告\"天文台建成了。\"\n[action]如果\"天文台建成了\"、\"托马斯和玛丽受尼古拉·特斯拉启发\"，且托马斯·科里根、玛丽·杰林斯基和埃兹拉·格雷夫斯位于[[现在]]的米斯卡塔尼克大学，作为团队花费2[per_investigator]个线索(如果你在史诗多人模式中游戏，改为作为团队花费4[per_investigator]个线索)：宣告\"传送研究开始了。\"\n[fast]如果\"托马斯和玛丽相识了\"，且托马斯·科里根和玛丽·杰林斯基位于古老魔法商店，花费1[per_investigator]个资源：宣告\"科里根工业成立\"，并将放在一边的科里根工业地点放置入场，位于未来时代。\n目标 - 如果本剧情卡牌上的全部3个能力均已触发，将其加入胜利牌区(每个能力触发时，在该能力上放置一个资源标记)。",
