    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[action] If Thomas Corrigan and Mary Zielinski are at Corrigan Industries: Put the set-aside Dimensional Beam Machine asset into play under your control (if you are eliminated, set it aside, out of play).\n[action] If \"teleportation research has begun\" and Thomas Corrigan, Mary Zielinski, and the Dimensional Beam Machine are at the [[Future]] Miskatonic University: Test [intellect] (3). If you succeed, spend 2 [per_investigator] clues, as a group (8 [per_investigator] clues, as a group, instead if you are playing in Epic Multiplayer Mode) and announce \"Thomas and Mary have made a historic discovery.\"\n[action] If \"Thomas and Mary have made a historic discovery\" and Thomas Corrigan and Mary Zielinski are at the [[Future]] Arkham Advertiser: Announce \"Thomas and Mary have won a Nobel Prize.\"\nObjective - If all 3 abilities on this story card have been triggered, add it to the victory display (place a resource token over each ability when it is triggered).",
    "textZh": "[action]如果托马斯·科里根和玛丽·杰林斯基位于科里根工业：将放在一边的维度光束机器支援放置入场，由你控制(如果你被淘汰，将其放在一边，位于场外)。\n[action]如果\"传送研究开始了\"，且托马斯·科里根、玛丽·杰林斯基和维度光束机器位于[[未来]]的米斯卡塔尼克大学：进行一次[intellect](3)检定。如果你成功，作为团队花费2[per_investigator]个线索(如果你在史诗多人模式中游戏，改为作为团队花费8[per_investigator]个线索)，并宣告\"托马斯和玛丽取得了一项历史性发现。\"\n[action]如果\"托马斯和玛丽取得了一项历史性发现\"，且托马斯·科里根和玛丽·杰林斯基位于[[未来]]的阿卡姆广告报：宣告\"托马斯和玛丽获得了诺贝尔奖。\"\n目标 - 如果本剧情卡牌上的全部3个能力均已触发，将其加入胜利牌区(每个能力触发时，在该能力上放置一个资源标记)。",
