    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[action] [action]: Ready and move Edwin Bennet to your location (even if he is in another era).\n[action] If Edwin Bennet is at your location: Fight/Evade. Either attack or attempt to evade Edwin Bennet. If you succeed, spend X clues as a group, where X is the global number of players. Then, place 1 resource on him, as a target. (Group limit once per round.)\nObjective - If Edwin Bennet has 3 targets on him and he is at Tindalos, the forces of Tindalos seize him. Remove Edwin Bennet from the game and add all copies of this story card in each era to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "[action][action]：重整艾德温·贝内特，将其移动到你所在地点(即使他位于另一时代)。\n[action]如果艾德温·贝内特位于你所在地点：攻击/躲避。攻击或尝试躲避艾德温·贝内特。如果你成功，作为团队花费X个线索，其中X为全局玩家人数。然后，在他身上放置1个资源，作为目标。(每轮团队限一次。)\n目标 - 如果艾德温·贝内特上有3个目标，且其位于廷达洛斯，廷达洛斯的势力将他捕获。将艾德温·贝内特移出游戏，并将每个时代的本剧情卡牌加入胜利牌区。",
