    "text": "[action] [action]: Ready and move Edwin Bennet to your location (even if he is in another era).\n[action] If Edwin Bennet is at your location: Parley. Test [willpower] (3) or [intellect] (3). If you succeed, spend X clues, as a group where X is the global number of players. Then, place 1 resource on him, as a redemption.\nObjective - If Edwin Bennet has 3 or more redemption on him and he is at any Miskatonic University with Thomas Corrigan and Mary Zielinski, he is redeemed. Remove all redemption from him and flip him over. Add all copies of this story card in each era to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "[action][action]：重整艾德温·贝内特，将其移动到你所在地点(即使他位于另一时代)。\n[action]如果艾德温·贝内特位于你所在地点：谈判。进行一次[willpower](3)或[intellect](3)检定。如果你成功，作为团队花费X个线索，其中X为全局玩家人数。然后，在他身上放置1个资源，作为救赎。\n目标 - 如果艾德温·贝内特上有3个或更多救赎，且他与托马斯·科里根和玛丽·杰林斯基位于任意米斯卡塔尼克大学，他得到救赎。移除他身上的所有救赎并将他翻面。将每个时代的本剧情卡牌加入胜利牌区。",
