    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "[action] If Edwin Bennet is at your location and he is ready: Parley. Place 1 of your clues on him. You may test [intellect] (4). If you succeed, place 1 more of your clues on him. If you fail, exhaust him.\n[action]: Ready and move Edwin Bennet to your loaction (even if he is in another era).\nForced - At the end of the round: Remove 1 clue from Edwin Bennet (2 clues instead if you are playing in Epic Multiplayer Mode). If you cannot, place 1 doom on the current agenda. This effect can cause the current agenda to advance.\nForced - When Edwin Bennet would be abducted: Remove all damage and horror from him and place 2 doom on the current agenda instead.\nObjective - If \"Thomas and Mary have won a Nobel Prize\" and there is no [[Plot]] story card in play in any era, add this story card to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "[action]如果艾德温·贝内特位于你所在地点且处于重整状态：谈判。将你的1个线索放在他身上。你可以进行一次[intellect](4)检定。如果你成功，再将你的1个线索放在他身上。如果你失败，将其横置。\n[action]：重整并将艾德温·贝内特移动到你所在地点(即使他位于另一时代)。\n强制 - 一轮结束时：移除艾德温·贝内特上的1个线索(如果你在史诗多人模式中游戏，改为移除2个线索)。如果你无法如此做，在当前密谋上放置1个毁灭标记。本效果可以导致当前密谋推进。\n强制 - 艾德温·贝内特将要被绑架时：改为移除其所有伤害和恐惧，并在当前密谋上放置2个毁灭标记。\n目标 - 如果\"托马斯和玛丽获得了诺贝尔奖。\"，且任意时代的场上都没有[[情节]]剧情卡牌，将本剧情卡牌加入胜利牌区。",
