    "permanent": false,
    "position": 35,
    "provenanceId": "87038b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Abilities on locations with an anomaly cannot be triggered.\n[action] Spend any number of clues: Test [willpower] (3) or [agility] (3). You get +3 skill value to this test for each clue spent this way. If you succeed, remove 1 anomaly from your location (2 anomalies instead if you succeed by 3 or more). Then, if you succeed by 4 or more and \"Corrigan Industries has been founded,\" remove 1 anomaly from a location with the same title as your location, in any era.\nObjective - If it is agenda 2a and each location has no anomalies, add this story card to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "有异常地点上的能力不能触发。\n[action]花费任意数量的线索：进行一次[willpower](3)或[agility](3)检定。以此方式每花费1个线索，你本次检定得到+3技能值。如果你成功，移除你所在地点的1个异常(如果你成功超过难度至少3点，改为移除2个异常)。然后，如果你成功超过难度至少4点，且\"科里根工业成立\"，移除任意时代中一处与本地点同名地点上的1个异常。\n目标 - 如果当前密谋为2a，且每个地点均没有异常，将本剧情卡牌加入胜利牌区。",
    "traits": [
      "Plot"
    ],
    "traitsZh": [
      "情节"
    ],
    "type": "story",
    "typeName": "Story",
