    "text": "[action] If \"the debt has been paid,\" spend 1 [per_investigator] clues, as a group: Search the play area, encounter deck, or encounter discard pile for a Sheldon Gang enemy and add it to the victory display. If you searched the encounter deck, shuffle it. This action does not cause attacks of opportunity.\nObjective - If all 3 Sheldon Gang enemies are in the victory display, add this story card to the victory display.",
    "textZh": "[action]如果\"债务已偿还\"，作为团队花费1[per_investigator]个线索：查找游戏区域、遭遇牌库或遭遇弃牌堆，找出一名谢尔顿帮敌人，将其加入胜利牌区。如果查找遭遇牌库，将其混洗。本行动不会引发趁乱攻击。\n目标 - 如果全部3名谢尔顿帮敌人均位于胜利牌区，将本剧情卡牌加入胜利牌区。",
