    "subnameZh": "交谊厅歌姬",
    "text": "[action]: Parley. Take control of Isamara Ordoñez.\n[action]: If you control Isamara Ordoñez: Parley. Automatically evade all [[Casino]] enemies at your location. Then, test [willpower] (3). If you fail, lose 2 actions. If at least 1 enemy at a [[Restricted]] location was evaded by this effect, remember that \"Isamara mesmerized the guards with her song.\" (Group limit once per game.)",
    "textZh": "[action]：谈判。控制伊萨玛拉·奥多涅斯。\n[action]：如果你控制伊萨玛拉·奥多涅斯：谈判。自动躲避你所在地点的所有[[赌场]]敌人。然后，进行一次[willpower](3)检定。如果你失败，失去2次行动。如果至少1名位于[[管制区域]]地点的敌人被以此效果躲避，请记住\"伊萨玛拉用歌声迷惑守卫\"。(团队每场游戏限一次。)",
