    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "Revelation - If there are no non-unique [[Casino]] enemies in play, Inconvenient Questioning gains surge. Otherwise, the nearest non-unique [[Casino]] enemy moves once toward you, and you test [intellect] (3). If you fail, raise your alarm level by 1 and each non-unique [[Casino]] enemy at your location loses aloof until the end of this round.\n♠9",
    "textZh": "显现 - 如果场上没有非独特[[赌场]]敌人，麻烦的质问获得涌动。否则，最近的一名非独特[[赌场]]敌人朝你移动一次，然后进行一次[intellect](3)检定。如果你失败，将你的警戒等级提升1，你所在地点的每名非独特[[赌场]]敌人失去冷漠，直到本轮结束。\n♠9",
    "traits": [
      "Scheme"
    ],
