    "text": "Peril.\nRevelation - You must either (choose one):\n- Take 2 horror.\n- Test [willpower] (X), where X is half your alarm level (rounded up). If you succeed, gain 2 resources. If you fail, take 2 horror and raise your alarm level by 1.\n♦Q",
