    "provenanceId": "88043b",
    "quantity": 1,
    "subnameZh": "",
    "text": "- J♠: The Prayer. Nothing happens.\n- J♥: The Wind. You may take an additional 3 actions this turn.\n- J♦: The Chest. Gain 10 resources.\n- J♣: The Tome. Choose 2 different skills. You get +1 to each of those skills for the remainder of the game.\n- Q♦: The Champion. Select an [[Ally]] asset from among your collection and put it into play (for the remainder of the game).\n- Q♠: The Sword. Select an [[Item]] asset from among your collection and put it into play (for the remainder of the game).\n- K♥: The Lifeblood. Heal all damage and horror on your investigator.\n- K♣: The Lamp. Choose a non-[[Elite]] enemy or treachery in play. That card ceases to exist (remove it from the game).\n- A♠: The Evil Eye. For the remainder of the game, treat each [elder_sign] you reveal on a chaos token as an [auto_fail].",
    "textZh": "- J♠：祈祷者。无事发生。\n- J♥：疾风。你可以在本回合进行额外3次行动。\n- J♦：宝藏。获得10资源。\n- J♣：典籍。选择两个不同的技能。游戏结束前，你的这两个技能得到+1。\n- Q♦：冠军。从你的收藏中选择一张[[盟友]]支援，并将其放置入场(直到游戏结束)。\n- Q♠：宝剑。从你的收藏中选择一张[[道具]]支援，并将其放置入场(直到游戏结束)。\n- K♥：生命之血。治愈你调查员身上的所有伤害与恐惧。\n- K♣：神灯。选择场上一名非[[精英]]敌人或一张诡计。抹除该卡牌的存在(将其从游戏中移除)。\n- A♠：邪眼。游戏结束前，将你抽取的每个[elder_sign]混乱标记都视为[auto_fail]。",
