    "text": "Revelation - Attach to the nearest location without a copy of Dimensional Hypnosis attached.\nAs an additional cost for you to leave attached location, test [willpower] (3). If you fail, cancel the effects of the move, move the nearest [[Extradimensional]] enemy once toward you, and discard Dimensional Hypnosis.\n♠5",
    "textZh": "显现 - 附属到最近的、未附属异空间催眠的地点。\n作为你离开被附属地点的额外费用，进行一次[willpower](3)检定。如果你失败，取消移动效果，将最近的一名[[异次元]]敌人朝你移动一次，然后弃掉异空间催眠。\n♠5",
